i.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/commits/d5f6f05983679eb807e6f7fae8402370d392c352/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:38:35Z","email":"116077423+AbdullahHAK@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:38:35Z","email":"116077423+AbdullahHAK@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah"},"message":"Add a no-backend \"suggest a company\" intake\n\nThe cheapest remaining item from the long-standing \"beat LinkedIn\"\nroadmap (flagged across several earlier sessions as worth doing\nbefore anything needing real infrastructure) - a structured GitHub\nissue template (company name, careers URL, why) plus a \"Suggest a\ncompany\" link in the sidebar footer on all three pages, opening the\ntemplate pre-selected. No backend, no new data store - suggestions\njust land as GitHub issues for manual triage, same as how every\nscraper candidate in this project has always been sourced and\nverified by hand anyway.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fab24227706dacffadf6ea2ea2b7a0cca63ef614","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/trees/fab24227706dacffadf6ea2ea2b7a0cca63ef614"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/commits/d5f6f05983679eb807e6f7fae8402370d392c352","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116077423?v=4","events_url":"https://