 others with\nidentical titles are genuinely separate postings with distinct URLs -\ngrouped by application_url, not by title, to tell them apart.\n\"Future Opportunities\" is a recurring generic catch-all posting (same\npattern as Genetech''s \"Other Positions\"/Bazaar''s \"Talent Pool\"),\nexcluded by name.\n\nVerified live: 146 real current Pakistan-tagged postings - the\nlargest single-company haul so far, spanning real software\nengineering roles (DevOps, Full Stack, Android, iOS, Data Science,\nJava, Python, React, Node, .NET, QA Automation) alongside the\ncompany''s non-tech functions, the same realistic mix seen at other\nlarger companies already in the dataset.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0cab1201dae9216b13224d6e2635676cca428251","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/trees/0cab1201dae9216b13224d6e2635676cca428251"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/commits/dd6c90fc6bc80cc903f115ee6ea1ef919e52f0a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116077423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AbdullahHAK","id":116077423,"login":"AbdullahHAK","node_id":"U_kgDOBuszbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/subscrip