:"116077423+AbdullahHAK@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah"},"message":"35th scraper: Dubizzle\n\ncareers.dubizzle.com doesn''t resolve - their Pakistan engineering org\n(\"Dubizzle Labs\", ~400 people across Lahore and Karachi per their own\ncareers copy) hires through a separate Breezy-hosted board instead\n(dubizzlelabs.breezy.hr). Same quirk as Strategic Systems\nInternational: a role open in multiple locations renders as an\nunresolved \"%LABEL_MULTIPLE_LOCATIONS%\" placeholder rather than naming\nthem, so those are skipped - only postings resolving to a single\nliteral \"Lahore, PK\" or \"Karachi, PK\" are kept. The page also repeats\nat least one posting verbatim (seen live, covered by a test), deduped\nby apply-link href. robots.txt only disallows static-asset paths and\nAhrefsBot specifically.\n\nVerified live: 7 real current openings (Frontend/Backend Engineer,\nAndroid Developer, SQA Engineer, Senior Laravel Engineer, Product\nDesigner, Accounts/Admin Officer).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"10b5cb3f05cddcdf3bd7f240dfa04d74a85f093c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/trees/10b5cb3f05cddcdf3bd7f240dfa04d74a85f093c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/commits/c3156c94d3c78bb6c8a46fdf8d283af4f37e2e3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116077423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AbdullahHAK","id":116077423,"login":"AbdullahHAK","node_id":"U_kgDOBuszbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/o