.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/commits/4e82c23f1f0d60eb30754520015a998561a262ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:18:32Z","email":"116077423+AbdullahHAK@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:18:32Z","email":"116077423+AbdullahHAK@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah"},"message":"Add visible keyboard focus states and respect prefers-reduced-motion\n\nTwo real accessibility gaps introduced by the redesign, not present\nbefore: the default browser focus outline barely registers against a\nnear-black background, and several new interactive elements (pill\nbuttons, cards, the star rating) had no focus indicator at all. Added\na :focus-visible outline (accent-colored, so it only shows for\nkeyboard navigation, not mouse clicks) across links/buttons/form\ncontrols/summary.\n\nAlso added a prefers-reduced-motion block collapsing all\nanimation/transition durations to near-zero - the hero badge''s pulse,\nskeleton shimmer, and hover/lift transitions are all decorative, not\nload-bearing, so they''re safe to drop for anyone who''s opted out of\nnon-essential motion at the OS level.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7dcc0e2bdb04f753c2255ca84695b58840966422","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/trees/7dcc0e2bdb04f753c2255ca84695b58840966422"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/commits/4e82c23f1f0d60eb30754520015a998561a262ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116077423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdul