}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AbdullahHAK","id":116077423,"login":"AbdullahHAK","node_id":"U_kgDOBuszbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/commits/34625fe214266fa34a221bf4f201a3d8eaa417e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:28:35Z","email":"116077423+AbdullahHAK@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:28:35Z","email":"116077423+AbdullahHAK@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah"},"message":"Add moderated company reviews - schema, API, and a new Reviews page\n\nAdds a Glassdoor-style reviews section for Pakistani tech companies:\ncompany/role/rating/salary-range/review submissions, held unapproved\nuntil a moderator clears them (POST /reviews/{id}/approve|reject,\ngated behind an ADMIN_TOKEN header) before GET /reviews ever returns\nthem. Deliberately not seeded with scraped or fabricated content -\nGlassdoor''s review data is proprietary and scraping/republishing it\nviolates their ToS, and writing fake reviews ourselves to fill the\npage would be presenting synthetic opinions as real ones. The page\nlaunches with a genuine, working submission flow instead.\n\nNew frontend/reviews.html (added to the sidebar nav on every page)\ntalks to the API directly rather than the daily-export static-JSON\npattern used for jobs, since reviews need real-time submission and\nmoderation. The API isn''t deployed publicly yet, so reviews.js''s\nAPI_BASE is empty and the page shows a clear \"launching soon\" state\ninstead of throwing fetch errors at visitors - flipping one constant\nonce a deployment exists turns browsing and submission on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d15a54b35eb0a1399137068fb6cd233c5832418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/trees/7d15a54b35eb0a1399137068fb6cd233c5832418"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/commits/34625fe214266fa34a221bf4f201a3d8eaa417e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116077423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AbdullahHAK","id":116077423,"login":"AbdullahHAK","node_id":"U_kgDOBuszbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AbdullahHAK/jobless/commit/34625fe214266fa34a221bf4f201a3d8eaa417e6","node_id":"C_kwDOTPbx2NoAKDM0NjI1ZmUyMTQyNjZmYTM0YTIyMWJmNGYyMDFhM2Q4ZWFhNDE3ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AbdullahHAK/jobless/commit/a22d2213edd1922d81f1a28b4d653d760ca67e02","sha":"a22d2213edd1922d81f1a28b4d653d760ca67e02","url":"https: