hich is listed in Veeam''s public sitemap and lives outside robots.txt''s\nonly disallowed path (/search-jobs/). That same disallowed path hosts the\nportal''s AJAX pagination endpoint, so it is deliberately not used; the\nserver ignores ?p=N here, and a page holds 15 results, so a warning is\nlogged (rather than silently truncating) if Pakistan ever exceeds one page.\n\n9 real Pakistan openings (Islamabad/Karachi), matching the sitemap''s\nPakistan job URLs exactly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e4fd351f3b36c3ab679c9d5db5b167ddc0902dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/trees/3e4fd351f3b36c3ab679c9d5db5b167ddc0902dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/commits/21b4bb890f32cb3e83ac3b534a1b0386d09fe973","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116077423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AbdullahHAK","id":116077423,"login":"AbdullahHAK","node_id":"U_kgDOBuszbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AbdullahHAK/jobless/commit/21b4bb890f32cb3e83ac3b534a1b0386d09fe973","node_id":