ef103b711f427e467ab67a03dbe4493d81b7ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T12:15:28Z","email":"116077423+AbdullahHAK@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T12:15:28Z","email":"116077423+AbdullahHAK@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah"},"message":"Add location (Lahore/Karachi/Islamabad) and tech/non-tech filters\n\nLocation matches by substring against the free-text location field\n(e.g. \"Lahore, Punjab, Pakistan\" still counts as Lahore); Islamabad\ngroups in Rawalpindi since postings almost always list the twin\ncities together.\n\nTech vs non-tech is a title-keyword heuristic - no scraper exposes a\nreal department/function field. A disqualifying-discipline check\n(civil/mechanical/automotive/call-center etc.) runs before the\ntech-keyword check, so roles like \"Civil Site Engineer\" or \"Quality\nAssurance Executive (Call Center)\" don''t get miscounted as tech just\nfor containing \"engineer\"/\"quality assurance\". Verified against the\nlive dataset (806 jobs): correctly splits ~322 tech / ~484 non-tech,\nspot-checked against real titles to confirm no glaring misclassification.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51376e5e5ccf54a90a617f9af92bb8ac504faeaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/trees/51376e5e5ccf54a90a617f9af92bb8ac504faeaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AbdullahHAK/jobless/git/commits/caef103b711f427e467ab67a03dbe4493d81b7ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116077423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbdullahHAK/gists{/gist_id}","gra