关联支持，新增数据库字段`knowledge_base_ids`并兼容旧字段\n- 新增知识库多选组件，支持配置多个知识库联合检索\n- 升级authz依赖至0.3.0，支持RS256 JWT签名与联邦认证\n- 实现跨系统用户身份同步：角色映射、状态同步与生命周期管理\n- 优化知识库检索逻辑，支持多库并行检索与全局排序\n- 更新文档与测试用例，完善部署与验收流程","tree":{"sha":"b8b26ad11b41b2da1716c3b80e96367d1f6129fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/b8b26ad11b41b2da1716c3b80e96367d1f6129fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/74472eca4913b41d52416ce0b681604130ce9fb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/74472eca4913b41d52416ce0b681604130ce9fb9","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDc0NDcyZWNhNDkxM2I0MWQ1MjQxNmNlMGI2ODE2MDQxMzBjZTlmYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/952350bf14359dc6ccdedacf097ece683cd04d96","sha":"952350bf14359dc6ccdedacf097ece683cd04d96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/952350bf14359dc6ccdedacf097ece683cd04d96"}],"sha":"74472eca4913b41d52416ce0b681604130ce9fb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/74472eca4913b41d52416ce0b681604130ce9fb9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/952350bf14359dc6ccdedacf097ece683cd04d96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T15:15:37Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T15:15:37Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"更新文档","tree":{"sha":"b3942707b7da09fd18e556621a56fee1c3668037","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/b3942707b7da09fd18e556621a56fee1c3668037"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/952350bf14359dc6ccdedacf097ece683cd04d96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/952350bf14359dc6ccdedacf097ece683cd04d96","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDk1MjM1MGJmMTQzNTlkYzZjY2RlZGFjZjA5N2VjZTY4M2NkMDRkOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/9ebf32d6b3f4bbd4bdaf96dbd18b7d1594281c5b","sha":"9ebf32d6b3f4bbd4bdaf96dbd18b7d1594281c5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/9ebf32d6b3f4bbd4bdaf96dbd18b7d1594281c5b"}],"sha":"952350bf14359dc6ccdedacf097ece683cd04d96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/952350bf14359dc6ccdedacf097ece683cd04d96"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/9ebf32d6b3f4bbd4bdaf96dbd18b7d1594281c5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:58:49Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:58:49Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"fix(voice-agent): 过滤 dashscope 正常关闭帧的 ERROR 日志噪音\n\n- dashscope SDK 把服务端正常关闭帧（opcode=8, 关闭码 1000 \"Bye\"）当 ERROR\n  记录，每次 TTS 合成结束刷两条，掩盖真实错误\n- NormalCloseFrameFilter 只丢弃\"opcode=8 且关闭码 1000\"的记录，非 1000\n  关闭码/连接丢失/异常栈一律放行；挂载到 dashscope 与 websocket 两个 logger\n  （main._load_env，WS 与 CLI 入口共同生效），幂等\n- 核实确认无连接泄漏：正常/打断/异常路径均落入 finally close(1000)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"076438d06dcce95405f6d499b7ec7eb23bc216f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/076438d06dcce95405f6d499b7ec7eb23bc216f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/9ebf32d6b3f4bbd4bdaf96dbd18b7d1594281c5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/9ebf32d6b3f4bbd4bdaf96dbd18b7d1594281c5b","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDllYmYzMmQ2YjNmNGJiZDRiZGFmOTZkYmQxOGI3ZDE1OTQyODFjNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/68e0499488649b6c8b562dbe3578bf2d97fb30e2","sha":"68e0499488649b6c8b562dbe3578bf2d97fb30e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/68e0499488649b6c8b562dbe3578bf2d97fb30e2"}],"sha":"9ebf32d6b3f4bbd4bdaf96dbd18b7d1594281c5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/9ebf32d6b3f4bbd4bdaf96dbd18b7d1594281c5b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/68e0499488649b6c8b562dbe3578bf2d97fb30e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:58:19Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:58:19Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(voice): 插话应答过渡语 sideQuestionAck，答案生成与播报并行\n\n- 插话（SIDE_QUESTION）识别后先播一句可配置过渡语（默认\"好的，稍等哈，\n  我帮您看一下。\"），同时并行启动 RAG+LLM 答案生成，掩盖 ~1.5s 生成延迟\n  （实测插话端到端 ~3s 全程静默的体验问题）\n- 取消/失败语义保持：过渡语被 barge-in/挂断取消时先取消生成任务再上抛，\n  不留孤儿任务；生成失败仍走模板桥接回退，未答问题不丢\n- 三态配置语义：键不存在=默认文案；空串=显式禁用（不播过渡语）；有值=自定义。\n  dashboard 插话处理分组新增\"插话时先播应答语\"复选框 + 文本输入\n- 修复：编辑场景清空 dialogRepair 后 PATCH 显式携带空对象，旧配置可被真正清除\n  （此前 undefined 丢 key，后端跳过写入导致残留）\n- 全链路：shared DialogRepairConfig / API DTO 校验 / dashboard 表单 / RepairPhrases\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e14746b2813b9150aa5f84c7c2fa69714fc17f01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/e14746b2813b9150aa5f84c7c2fa69714fc17f01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/68e0499488649b6c8b562dbe3578bf2d97fb30e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/68e0499488649b6c8b562dbe3578bf2d97fb30e2","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDY4ZTA0OTk0ODg2NDliNmM4YjU2MmRiZTM1NzhiZjJkOTdmYjMwZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/6052ca54c8adcac0ad596647825dfd42aae92a16","sha":"6052ca54c8adcac0ad596647825dfd42aae92a16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/6052ca54c8adcac0ad596647825dfd42aae92a16"}],"sha":"68e0499488649b6c8b562dbe3578bf2d97fb30e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/68e0499488649b6c8b562dbe3578bf2d97fb30e2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/6052ca54c8adcac0ad596647825dfd42aae92a16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:57:43Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:57:43Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"fix(voice-agent): 契约层补 dialogRepair 字段 + /text-test 加载流程绑定场景\n\n- ScenarioConfigContract 增加 dialog_repair（alias dialogRepair）：此前 extra=\"ignore\"\n  在边界静默丢弃该字段，场景自定义修复话术/静默配置在真实通话中从未生效、\n  一律走内置默认（默认与旧硬编码零漂移故未暴露）。嵌套的 flow 快照契约自动受益\n- contracts/task-api.schema.json $defs/scenarioConfig 同步补 dialogRepair\n- /text-test 流程调试通道改用流程绑定场景的真实配置（scenario_from_contract），\n  无绑定时回退内置 ecommerce；此前硬编码内置场景导致调试面板验收断链\n- 回归测试：契约 dump 保留 dialogRepair（顶层+快照）、端到端透传 RepairPhrases、\n  text-test 用流程场景/无场景回退\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"051d882addaf98401f522fcc5422d7841f33b9de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/051d882addaf98401f522fcc5422d7841f33b9de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/6052ca54c8adcac0ad596647825dfd42aae92a16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/6052ca54c8adcac0ad596647825dfd42aae92a16","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDYwNTJjYTU0YzhhZGNhYzBhZDU5NjY0NzgyNWRmZDQyYWFlOTJhMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/87b98cf88ff1753375f190a74eff076447dfd0da","sha":"87b98cf88ff1753375f190a74eff076447dfd0da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/87b98cf88ff1753375f190a74eff076447dfd0da"}],"sha":"6052ca54c8adcac0ad596647825dfd42aae92a16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/6052ca54c8adcac0ad596647825dfd42aae92a16"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/87b98cf88ff1753375f190a74eff076447dfd0da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T12:10:41Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T12:10:41Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(dashboard): 场景/流程 07-16 优化批\n\n场景配置：\n- 描述→说明文案；身份单选/沟通风格多选标签化（支持新增自动聚焦、可删除，内置标签不可删）\n- 行业模板选择并回显到表单；静默处理独立分组（行内布局）\n- 插问→插话文案，自然过渡的承接提示词可自定义\n- 去掉开场白模板、声音风格两个表单字段；列表状态与操作联动\n- 表单迁 useForm+zod+FormProvider（headless 试点 B）\n外呼流程：\n- 列表迁 DataTable：名称搜索/状态筛选/更新时间排序/场景过滤/刷新按钮（headless 试点 A）\n- 修复编辑已发布流程后发布按钮锁死：FlowBuilderClient 订阅 SWR 缓存 + useTaskFlow fallbackData\n- 节点配置只保留回复目标（去系统提示词入口）\n- 测试抽屉每次打开重置为新会话，支持测试变量注入模拟\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e880fbe2d54650cdbcf72c3cbf135a2928e3e610","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/e880fbe2d54650cdbcf72c3cbf135a2928e3e610"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/87b98cf88ff1753375f190a74eff076447dfd0da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/87b98cf88ff1753375f190a74eff076447dfd0da","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDg3Yjk4Y2Y4OGZmMTc1MzM3NWYxOTBhNzRlZmYwNzY0NDdkZmQwZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/cd77c86693755dffdefa123c5ba986b59deb6a17","sha":"cd77c86693755dffdefa123c5ba986b59deb6a17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/cd77c86693755dffdefa123c5ba986b59deb6a17"}],"sha":"87b98cf88ff1753375f190a74eff076447dfd0da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/87b98cf88ff1753375f190a74eff076447dfd0da"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/cd77c86693755dffdefa123c5ba986b59deb6a17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T12:09:41Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T12:09:41Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(dashboard): headless UI 基建 — DataTable 与 RHF 表单字段封装\n\n- DataTable：TanStack Table 封装，透传标准 ColumnDef 约定；排序表头（aria-sort）、受控 globalFilter/columnFilters、空态、行点击，渲染走全局 .table-wrap 样式\n- FormInput/FormTextarea/FormSelect：useController + zod 中文错误 role=alert，走全局 .form-input 类\n- 新增依赖 @tanstack/react-table@8.21.3（pnpm-lock 已补条目）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"249ac539d3e63eb91abb7775594b2148584bcc8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/249ac539d3e63eb91abb7775594b2148584bcc8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/cd77c86693755dffdefa123c5ba986b59deb6a17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/cd77c86693755dffdefa123c5ba986b59deb6a17","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGNkNzdjODY2OTM3NTVkZmZkZWZhMTIzYzViYTk4NmI1OWRlYjZhMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/8a50b06ef9835f2564abaac7858343d833f72223","sha":"8a50b06ef9835f2564abaac7858343d833f72223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8a50b06ef9835f2564abaac7858343d833f72223"}],"sha":"cd77c86693755dffdefa123c5ba986b59deb6a17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/cd77c86693755dffdefa123c5ba986b59deb6a17"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8a50b06ef9835f2564abaac7858343d833f72223/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T12:09:13Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T12:09:13Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(api): 场景级 dialogRepair 配置（Prisma 迁移 + DTO 校验 + 读写链路）\n\n- OutboundScenario 新增 dialog_repair Json 列（迁移 20260715140556，生产需 prisma migrate deploy）\n- DialogRepairConfigDto 校验：静默超时 1000-600000ms、连续静默 1-10 轮、超限动作 hangup|transfer、各话术字段\n- scenarios.service 读写归一化（空对象→undefined，不落无效配置）\n- packages/shared 补 DialogRepairConfig 类型与展示默认值\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8aa7b35482dc6965127968fe0dcc389fba4c77de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/8aa7b35482dc6965127968fe0dcc389fba4c77de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/8a50b06ef9835f2564abaac7858343d833f72223","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/8a50b06ef9835f2564abaac7858343d833f72223","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDhhNTBiMDZlZjk4MzVmMjU2NGFiYWFjNzg1ODM0M2Q4MzNmNzIyMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/5f3e36c530ca2452e24bd4feafabed11dd5041b1","sha":"5f3e36c530ca2452e24bd4feafabed11dd5041b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5f3e36c530ca2452e24bd4feafabed11dd5041b1"}],"sha":"8a50b06ef9835f2564abaac7858343d833f72223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8a50b06ef9835f2564abaac7858343d833f72223"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5f3e36c530ca2452e24bd4feafabed11dd5041b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T12:07:45Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T12:07:45Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(voice): 分层对话路由 + 声学回声门控 + 修复话术配置化执行侧\n\n- 语义层 DialogTurnRouter：一次 strict tool call 统一判定业务回答/暂停/重复/附和/插话/未匹配，置信度分层 + 业务边际；精确匹配走零模型快路径\n- 流程状态机仅在高置信业务回答时前进，不确定一律留在当前节点\n- 修复话术全部外提 RepairPhrases，按场景 dialogRepair 配置渲染，默认值与原硬编码零漂移\n- 插话改 LLM 一次生成自然承接（承接提示词可配置，失败回退模板桥接）\n- 静默处理：全局默认 6s（TURN_TIMEOUT_S），LLM 复述式追问，连续静默超限支持挂机/转人工；预算优先级 节点 retryCount > 场景 > env\n- 声学层：EchoGate TTS 回声门控 + web 通道 AEC 参考相关性门控；上行聚批 200ms→60ms、TTS 预送 240ms，降低打断延迟\n- LLM 上下文滑动窗口（LLM_HISTORY_WINDOW_TURNS=20，保留全部 system 消息，窗口起点跳过孤儿 tool 消息）\n- 修复 RAG 检索把 NestJS 201 响应当失败的问题（改用 is_success）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff774a74f8c23ea81e63793b6e6c8d6f038159fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/ff774a74f8c23ea81e63793b6e6c8d6f038159fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/5f3e36c530ca2452e24bd4feafabed11dd5041b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/5f3e36c530ca2452e24bd4feafabed11dd5041b1","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDVmM2UzNmM1MzBjYTI0NTJlMjRiZDRmZWFmYWJlZDExZGQ1MDQxYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/8f6e5985f4d11040e95047d25d9851a2ddeb4e64","sha":"8f6e5985f4d11040e95047d25d9851a2ddeb4e64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8f6e5985f4d11040e95047d25d9851a2ddeb4e64"}],"sha":"5f3e36c530ca2452e24bd4feafabed11dd5041b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5f3e36c530ca2452e24bd4feafabed11dd5041b1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8f6e5985f4d11040e95047d25d9851a2ddeb4e64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T23:20:24Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T23:20:24Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(dashboard): 按钮级权限门控 + toast 修复/防刷屏 + 操作节流 + 任务导出\n\n权限门控(viewer 隐藏,权限码逐一按 apps/api controller 装饰器核对镜像):\n- 新增 hooks/use-permission.ts(usePermission/usePermissions,未登录 fail-closed)\n- 覆盖 35+ 写操作按钮:任务(发起/创建)、流程(新建/编辑/发布/复制/删除/保存,含空态入口)、\n  场景(新建/发布/停用/保存)、知识库上传、音色克隆(录制/上传/试听/入库/删除)、\n  系统用户/角色全部写操作、人工承接(认领/回拨/完成/关闭)、集成、模板克隆\n- tasks/task-flows 页为 Server Component,按共置模式抽出客户端小组件承载门控\n\ntoast 体系修复与防刷屏(lib/toast.ts + app/layout.tsx):\n- 修存量 bug:sonner <Toaster/> 从未挂载,全应用 toast 调用一直渲染不出来;现挂载于根布局\n- 自动消失 4s;同屏上限 3 条(超出丢最旧);2s 相同文案去重;调用方 API 不变\n\n操作节流(hooks/use-throttle-fn.ts,leading-edge 800ms):\n- 应用于无 pending 保护的写操作(场景发布/停用、用户/角色删除);已有 disabled 保护的不重复加\n\n死按钮清理与真实现:\n- 任务详情:删除无后端语义的「暂停任务」桩(对已完成任务也显示,误导用户);\n  「导出任务」实现为含转写记录的 JSON 下载\n- 任务列表:「导出」实现为当前筛选结果的 CSV 下载(中文表头/RFC4180 转义/UTF-8 BOM)\n- 知识库列表:删除无 onClick 且后端无路由的「新建知识库」死按钮(本地 mock 页)\n\n验证:vitest 21 文件 132 用例全绿(新增 use-permission/use-throttle-fn/toast 测试),\ntsc --noEmit 零错误;后端无改动\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45846e3fb2ea64df942dafeabf38f78e2a014863","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/45846e3fb2ea64df942dafeabf38f78e2a014863"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/8f6e5985f4d11040e95047d25d9851a2ddeb4e64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/8f6e5985f4d11040e95047d25d9851a2ddeb4e64","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDhmNmU1OTg1ZjRkMTEwNDBlOTUwNDdkMjVkOTg1MWEyZGRlYjRlNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/a42e96bf5b13b5330ee9b49a020262ade5924f2c","sha":"a42e96bf5b13b5330ee9b49a020262ade5924f2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/a42e96bf5b13b5330ee9b49a020262ade5924f2c"}],"sha":"8f6e5985f4d11040e95047d25d9851a2ddeb4e64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8f6e5985f4d11040e95047d25d9851a2ddeb4e64"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/a42e96bf5b13b5330ee9b49a020262ade5924f2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T23:02:59Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T23:02:59Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"fix(tasks): scheduler-worker 增加 stale 通话回收器（修复任务永久卡「拨打中/通话中」）\n\n根因：状态机只有事件驱动前进，唯一兜底（快照对账）仅覆盖 freeswitch 通道、跳过\nproviderJobId=null 的 attempt、且依赖 freeswitch-event-worker 存活。web 通道\n（浏览器模拟外呼）断线/服务重启后无人收口——实测 61 个卡死任务全部 channel=web\n（37 个 in_call 已完整对话甚至写了 outcome、24 个 calling 从未接通）。\n\n- TasksService.reapStaleActiveCalls：时间驱动回收，全通道、不看 providerJobId。\n  CALLING 超时（默认 10min，TASK_REAPER_CALLING_TIMEOUT_MS）→ FAILED；\n  IN_CALL 超时（默认 2h，TASK_REAPER_IN_CALL_TIMEOUT_MS）按接通证据收口\n  （answeredAt 或 IN_CALL 状态本身 → COMPLETED，不把真实发生过的对话判 FAILED）；\n  已有 hangupCause 保留并按其派生终态；写 call.stale_reaped 审计事件 + 联系历史；\n  DB 侧粗筛缩小 Serializable 读集，避免与快照对账在健康行上冲突\n- TaskSchedulerService：独立 reaper 定时器（默认 60s，TASK_REAPER_ENABLED /\n  TASK_REAPER_INTERVAL_MS 可配），与派发器互相独立；跑在 scheduler-worker 进程，\n  与 freeswitch-event-worker 互为看门狗\n- task-payloads：登记 call.stale_reaped 事件类型与载荷\n- tasks.module.spec：修正 dev:outbox/dev:scheduler 存量过期断言（worker 已改跑编译产物）\n\n实测：重建 dist 重启 scheduler-worker 后首轮扫描回收全部 61 个卡死任务\n（37→completed，24→failed，in_call/calling 清零）；API 测试 238/238，tsc 零错误\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"daa5b0c12d46f7f6d28336b3692f3b684c65ca64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/daa5b0c12d46f7f6d28336b3692f3b684c65ca64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/a42e96bf5b13b5330ee9b49a020262ade5924f2c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/a42e96bf5b13b5330ee9b49a020262ade5924f2c","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGE0MmU5NmJmNWIxM2I1MzMwZWU5YjQ5YTAyMDI2MmFkZTU5MjRmMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/132a742859b49de60b0b223425cfdd541e402686","sha":"132a742859b49de60b0b223425cfdd541e402686","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/132a742859b49de60b0b223425cfdd541e402686"}],"sha":"a42e96bf5b13b5330ee9b49a020262ade5924f2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/a42e96bf5b13b5330ee9b49a020262ade5924f2c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/132a742859b49de60b0b223425cfdd541e402686/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T10:24:26Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T10:24:26Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat: 统计外呼任务数据和ASR门控参数更新","tree":{"sha":"6ebf66f1e9776806d86be85fe7ee74d42c48006f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/6ebf66f1e9776806d86be85fe7ee74d42c48006f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/132a742859b49de60b0b223425cfdd541e402686","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/132a742859b49de60b0b223425cfdd541e402686","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDEzMmE3NDI4NTliNDlkZTYwYjBiMjIzNDI1Y2ZkZDU0MWU0MDI2ODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/f72c3466e483332a70221bdc0488e69d6cf2b3c2","sha":"f72c3466e483332a70221bdc0488e69d6cf2b3c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/f72c3466e483332a70221bdc0488e69d6cf2b3c2"}],"sha":"132a742859b49de60b0b223425cfdd541e402686","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/132a742859b49de60b0b223425cfdd541e402686"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.