opic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c23bc1c7d4a5e14936372ec314d6a52e1d8deb7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/c23bc1c7d4a5e14936372ec314d6a52e1d8deb7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/b836e22186366da1a891350af3ff4baa77fa5c57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/b836e22186366da1a891350af3ff4baa77fa5c57","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGI4MzZlMjIxODYzNjZkYTFhODkxMzUwYWYzZmY0YmFhNzdmYTVjNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/f012fecef8f104b57d4f493b1cb0d904463f0b2b","sha":"f012fecef8f104b57d4f493b1cb0d904463f0b2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/f012fecef8f104b57d4f493b1cb0d904463f0b2b"}],"sha":"b836e22186366da1a891350af3ff4baa77fa5c57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/b836e22186366da1a891350af3ff4baa77fa5c57"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/f012fecef8f104b57d4f493b1cb0d904463f0b2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T19:36:21Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T19:36:21Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"docs(deploy): 同步 voice-agent WS 同源反代 + CosyVoice 云端 TTS 配置\n\n- §9 前端部署：NEXT_PUBLIC_VOICE_AGENT_WS_URL 改为「通常留空、按环境派生」说明\n  （本地直连 :8090 / 生产同源不带端口走 nginx 路径反代），补三个 WS 路径\n  （/audio-stream、/asr-stream、/tts-stream）的完整 nginx 配置块（Upgrade 头 + 长超时），\n  并说明 api→voice-agent 服务端调用走内网直连、不经浏览器反代。\n- §8 provider 表：TTS 行纠正为 CosyVoice v2 云端 / Qwen-TTS（均百炼），补充\n  每通话 provider 由场景 ttsConfig 决定、TTS_PROVIDER 仅兜底、\n  COSYVOICE_ENABLE_INSTRUCT 须保持 false 等配置说明。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e9a35aea3e2b554523d8d1330544aea48805ead","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/4e9a35aea3e2b554523d8d1330544aea48805ead"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/f012fecef8f104b57d4f493b1cb0d904463f0b2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/f012fecef8f104b57d4f493b1cb0d904463f0b2b","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGYwMTJmZWNlZjhmMTA0YjU3ZDRmNDkzYjFjYjBkOTA0NDYzZjBiMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/0182c2fa07035ed9eb67ddf021532ba9028f18c7","sha":"0182c2fa07035ed9eb67ddf021532ba9028f18c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/0182c2fa07035ed9eb67ddf021532ba9028f18c7"}],"sha":"f012fecef8f104b57d4f493b1cb0d904463f0b2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/f012fecef8f104b57d4f493b1cb0d904463f0b2b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/0182c2fa07035ed9eb67ddf021532ba9028f18c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T19:32:04Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T19:32:04Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"fix(dashboard): voice-agent WS 生产走同源不带端口，由 nginx 反向代理转发\n\n上一版未配置时无脑拼 :8090，生产会得到 wss://域名:8090/audio-stream（错误，\n8090 是 voice-agent 内网监听端口，不该暴露给浏览器）。\n\n改：voiceAgentWsBaseUrl() 未配置时——\n- 本地 localhost/127.0.0.1 → 直连 <ws|wss>://<host>:8090（voice-agent 独立跑，与页面不同源）；\n- 其它主机（生产域名）→ 同源、不带端口 <ws|wss>://<host>，由 nginx 按路径\n  （/audio-stream、/asr-stream、/tts-stream）反向代理转发到 voice-agent。\n显式配置（NEXT_PUBLIC_VOICE_AGENT_WS_URL）仍最优先，供独立子域/自定义前缀场景。\n\n补充生产同源/带路径前缀/非标准端口用例，voice-agent-ws 单测 8 例、\ndashboard 相关 34 测全绿，typecheck 通过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"456ad4cb712bacdd7c3c0ae0e42e0102b35de1cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/456ad4cb712bacdd7c3c0ae0e42e0102b35de1cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/0182c2fa07035ed9eb67ddf021532ba9028f18c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/0182c2fa07035ed9eb67ddf021532ba9028f18c7","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDAxODJjMmZhMDcwMzVlZDllYjY3ZGRmMDIxNTMyYmE5MDI4ZjE4Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/046f6eb4a26d82af812143d406aa06ce6aebdab9","sha":"046f6eb4a26d82af812143d406aa06ce6aebdab9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/046f6eb4a26d82af812143d406aa06ce6aebdab9"}],"sha":"0182c2fa07035ed9eb67ddf021532ba9028f18c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/0182c2fa07035ed9eb67ddf021532ba9028f18c7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/046f6eb4a26d82af812143d406aa06ce6aebdab9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:30:51Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:30:51Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"refactor(flow)!: 移除流程「归档 / archived」状态\n\narchived 不再是合法流程状态：流程生命周期收敛为 draft / published。\n- shared：FlowStatus 去掉 ARCHIVED。\n- api：删除 POST /task-flows/:id/archive 端点与 archive() 服务方法、\n  去掉编辑/默认流程校验里的 ARCHIVED 分支。\n- dashboard：移除流程行的「归档」操作、归档徽章/文案与 archive mutation。\n- 迁移 remove_flow_archive_status：存量 archived 流程按是否留有已发布版本\n  归一化（version>0→published，否则→draft），与 backfill_published_flows 同一信号。\n\nshared 重建 + api/dashboard typecheck 通过，受影响 spec 全绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa1501dd94528bd729dcc2faf0e63dda5134beed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/fa1501dd94528bd729dcc2faf0e63dda5134beed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/046f6eb4a26d82af812143d406aa06ce6aebdab9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/046f6eb4a26d82af812143d406aa06ce6aebdab9","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDA0NmY2ZWI0YTI2ZDgyYWY4MTIxNDNkNDA2YWEwNmNlNmFlYmRhYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/605979d19bc7cdf15b5df363525badb4adbc176a","sha":"605979d19bc7cdf15b5df363525badb4adbc176a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/605979d19bc7cdf15b5df363525badb4adbc176a"}],"sha":"046f6eb4a26d82af812143d406aa06ce6aebdab9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/046f6eb4a26d82af812143d406aa06ce6aebdab9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/605979d19bc7cdf15b5df363525badb4adbc176a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:11:26Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:11:26Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"fix(voice-agent): CosyVoice 丢弃 instruction 参数，修复带 stylePrompt 场景整通无声\n\n真机根因：cosyvoice-v2（tts_v2）不支持 instruction 参数——预设音色与复刻音色带上\n都会被服务端拒为 428 InvalidParameter → task-failed → 整通电话无声。而 dashboard\n试听（/tts-stream 不传 instruct_text）正常出声，通话链路 agent._speak 会把场景\nstylePrompt/communication_style_prompt 当 instruct_text 传入 → 触发无声。\n\n修复：CosyVoiceTTS 默认不透传 instruction（COSYVOICE_ENABLE_INSTRUCT 显式开启才传，\n留给未来支持 instruct 的模型）；有 stylePrompt 时静默丢弃并记 debug。语气仍由复刻\n音色本身 + LLM 措辞承载。\n\n联调实测（同一复刻 voiceId）：修复前带 instruct_text=0 字节/不带=正常；修复后\n带与不带均正常出声（160338 字节）。新增 3 个单测（含伪 dashscope 捕获合成 kwargs\n验证 instruction 丢弃/透传），voice-agent pytest 235 绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ecd6f7fc963413de351df13ae2131195a25a51b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/ecd6f7fc963413de351df13ae2131195a25a51b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/605979d19bc7cdf15b5df363525badb4adbc176a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/605979d19bc7cdf15b5df363525badb4adbc176a","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDYwNTk3OWQxOWJjN2NkZjE1YjVkZjM2MzUyNWJhZGI0YWRiYzE3NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/ee0fde4b3d8ddf7c5b6eaa64827d2f9e75a3170f","sha":"ee0fde4b3d8ddf7c5b6eaa64827d2f9e75a3170f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/ee0fde4b3d8ddf7c5b6eaa64827d2f9e75a3170f"}],"sha":"605979d19bc7cdf15b5df363525badb4adbc176a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/605979d19bc7cdf15b5df363525badb4adbc176a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/ee0fde4b3d8ddf7c5b6eaa64827d2f9e75a3170f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:49:58Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:49:58Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"fix(dashboard): voice-agent WS 前缀随页面协议派生，移除硬编码 ws://localhost:8080\n\n问题：浏览器连 voice-agent 的 WS 地址硬编码 ws:// 前缀且端口写成过期的 8080。\nhttps 页面上 ws:// 会被浏览器按「混合内容」拦截，生产必然连不上。\n\n方案：新增 lib/voice-agent-ws.ts 的 voiceAgentWsBaseUrl()——\n- 配置了 NEXT_PUBLIC_VOICE_AGENT_WS_URL 则采用（生产显式配 wss://）；\n  仅当 https 页面 + 配置写 ws:// 时升级为 wss://（不降级已配置的 wss://）。\n- 未配置则按页面协议派生（http→ws / https→wss）+ 当前主机 + 8090（voice-agent 端口）。\nweb-call-client / useTTS / useASR 的连接地址、以及 3 个 demo 面板的展示（经\nuseVoiceAgentWsBaseUrl 挂载后解析避免水合不一致）统一改用它；文档端口 8080→8090。\n\n新增 voice-agent-ws 单测 5 例（http/https 派生、ws→wss 升级、不降级、去尾斜杠），\ndashboard 相关测试 31 绿，typecheck 通过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0581cbaef02b474f54f59a40e277c8b606299f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/c0581cbaef02b474f54f59a40e277c8b606299f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/ee0fde4b3d8ddf7c5b6eaa64827d2f9e75a3170f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/ee0fde4b3d8ddf7c5b6eaa64827d2f9e75a3170f","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGVlMGZkZTRiM2Q4ZGRmN2M1YjZlYWE2NDgyN2QyZjllNzVhMzE3MGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/7b3e1ece4461e493b20103ba7d11716037eab281","sha":"7b3e1ece4461e493b20103ba7d11716037eab281","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/7b3e1ece4461e493b20103ba7d11716037eab281"}],"sha":"ee0fde4b3d8ddf7c5b6eaa64827d2f9e75a3170f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/ee0fde4b3d8ddf7c5b6eaa64827d2f9e75a3170f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/7b3e1ece4461e493b20103ba7d11716037eab281/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:35:21Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:35:21Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(voice-clone): 音色克隆试听改为经 voice-agent 流式真合成，不再回放源音频\n\n问题：点「生成」试听放的是用户上传的源录音——因 CosyVoice v2 / Qwen vc-realtime\n复刻音色只有 WebSocket 流式合成接口，dashboard HTTP 试听无法直连，此前退回源音频占位。\n\n方案：api 作编排者经 voice-agent /tts-stream 用真实复刻音色流式合成试听。\n- voice-agent demo_server：/tts-stream 支持按请求 provider 懒建专属 TTS 实例\n  （让复刻 voiceId 路由到正确模型，且不与共享实例在途合成抢占冲突），\n  final 帧回传 sample_rate 供调用方封 WAV；连接结束关闭临时实例。\n- api voice-clones：新增 synthesizeViaVoiceAgent（全局 WebSocket 连 /tts-stream，\n  binaryType=arraybuffer 收 PCM，收齐封 WAV）；CosyVoice/Qwen realtime 试听改走它；\n  voice-agent 不可达时抛「请确认 voice-agent 已启动」的明确错误（不再静默回放源音频）。\n  连接地址复用 VOICE_AGENT_WS_* 配置，空串/0.0.0.0 归一到 127.0.0.1。\n\n联调验证：Node WebSocket → /tts-stream → CosyVoice 云端流式，35 帧/168KB PCM/\nsample_rate=16000 出声。新增 2 个 demo_server 测试（provider 路由 + sample_rate），\nvoice-agent pytest 232 绿，api typecheck 通过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bb559771a56f338e299eb9c029342ae6fda087a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/4bb559771a56f338e299eb9c029342ae6fda087a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/7b3e1ece4461e493b20103ba7d11716037eab281","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/7b3e1ece4461e493b20103ba7d11716037eab281","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDdiM2UxZWNlNDQ2MWU0OTNiMjAxMDNiYTdkMTE3MTYwMzdlYWIyODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/3985faada0f1ac210623fd4d02f680bb641db0ca","sha":"3985faada0f1ac210623fd4d02f680bb641db0ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/3985faada0f1ac210623fd4d02f680bb641db0ca"}],"sha":"7b3e1ece4461e493b20103ba7d11716037eab281","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/7b3e1ece4461e493b20103ba7d11716037eab281"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/3985faada0f1ac210623fd4d02f680bb641db0ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T15:56:22Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T15:56:22Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(tts): CosyVoice v2 云端流式合成 + 复刻音色云化，Qwen 复刻切 vc-realtime\n\nCosyVoiceTTS 由弃用的本地 HTTP(/inference_sft) 改为阿里云百炼 DashScope\ntts_v2 云端流式（SpeechSynthesizer，PCM 24kHz→重采样 16kHz），沿用 QwenTTS\n的 asyncio 队列桥 + barge-in 子任务契约（interrupt 只取消合成子任务，不误杀\n会话，2026-07-12 僵尸通话同款修复）。工厂按 api_key/model/default_speaker\n构造，缺 DASHSCOPE_API_KEY 降级 MockTTS。\n\n声音复刻：voice-clones 服务 CosyVoice 试听改走云端 voice-enrollment\n（create_voice，url 字段用 base64 data URL 免公网音频托管），返回云端\nvoice_id；Qwen 复刻 target_model 默认切 qwen3-tts-vc-realtime-2026-01-15，\nrealtime 复刻音色只能 WebSocket 流式合成，HTTP 非流式试听改源音频兜底。\n\n.env.example 同步：CosyVoice 云端配置 + QWEN_TTS_CLONE_MODEL + 复刻 target_model。\nvoice-agent pytest 230 绿，api typecheck 通过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1875a34fefdfe412f13ee931c4702a6260aea3f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/1875a34fefdfe412f13ee931c4702a6260aea3f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/3985faada0f1ac210623fd4d02f680bb641db0ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/3985faada0f1ac210623fd4d02f680bb641db0ca","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDM5ODVmYWFkYTBmMWFjMjEwNjIzZmQ0ZDAyZjY4MGJiNjQxZGIwY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/154fd3fea9904c31af79cc7bd732e0cb0f4a2ab5","sha":"154fd3fea9904c31af79cc7bd732e0cb0f4a2ab5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/154fd3fea9904c31af79cc7bd732e0cb0f4a2ab5"}],"sha":"3985faada0f1ac210623fd4d02f680bb641db0ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/3985faada0f1ac210623fd4d02f680bb641db0ca"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/154fd3fea9904c31af79cc7bd732e0cb0f4a2ab5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T10:20:57Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T10:20:57Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(dashboard): 任务列表页自动轮询刷新\n\n任务列表页每 3 秒调用 router.refresh() 自动刷新，页面隐藏时暂停\n(通用 use-polling hook + TaskListPoller 组件)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58ec2a928e6f25d4da6d91bdb6a0ff80e9154dec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/58ec2a928e6f25d4da6d91bdb6a0ff80e9154dec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/154fd3fea9904c31af79cc7bd732e0cb0f4a2ab5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/154fd3fea9904c31af79cc7bd732e0cb0f4a2ab5","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDE1NGZkM2ZlYTk5MDRjMzFhZjc5Y2M3YmQ3MzJlMGNiMGY0YTJhYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/cf1049990580c524539274823eaa407b45d2280b","sha":"cf1049990580c524539274823eaa407b45d2280b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/cf1049990580c524539274823eaa407b45d2280b"}],"sha":"154fd3fea9904c31af79cc7bd732e0cb0f4a2ab5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/154fd3fea9904c31af79cc7bd732e0cb0f4a2ab5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/cf1049990580c524539274823eaa407b45d2280b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T10:20:39Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T10:20:39Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(scenario): 场景音色人设配置 + 场景管理页精简\n\n- 音色人设配置侧：内置音色注册表新增 persona 字段，TtsVoiceConfig 新增\n  voicePersona 可选字段，场景页音色 tab 增加\"音色人设\"文本框(选内置音色\n  自动带入、可编辑)，api asTtsConfig 透传 voicePersona；与语音侧\n  voice_personas.py 构成同一功能两端；\n- 场景管理页精简：标题改为\"场景配置\"，隐藏未完工的\"测试记录\" tab/链接与\n  创建引导框；\n- 附带：scenarios-page 测试泛型标注修复、legacy-ui 链接 hover 样式调整。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc3be58d3a89ee10a5c0616e3bc0c443236b03b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/bc3be58d3a89ee10a5c0616e3bc0c443236b03b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/cf1049990580c524539274823eaa407b45d2280b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/cf1049990580c524539274823eaa407b45d2280b","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGNmMTA0OTk5MDU4MGM1MjQ1MzkyNzQ4MjNlYWE0MDdiNDVkMjI4MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/5431b56051dcfb6ef5fb2bc124cd1ca1636a75a0","sha":"5431b56051dcfb6ef5fb2bc124cd1ca1636a75a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5431b56051dcfb6ef5fb2bc124cd1ca1636a75a0"}],"sha":"cf1049990580c524539274823eaa407b45d2280b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/cf1049990580c524539274823eaa407b45d2280b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5431b56051dcfb6ef5fb2bc124cd1ca1636a75a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T10:20:21Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T10:20:21Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(voice-agent): 音色人设注入 + TTS provider 按场景解析 + ASR 拖尾保护\n\n- 音色人设：会话启动时把所选音色的人设/身份/沟通风格拼进 system prompt\n  (voice_personas.py)，使 LLM 生成话术的语气与音色匹配；\n- TTS provider 动态解析：按场景 ttsConfig.provider 惰性创建并缓存 TTS\n  实例，凭证缺失时回退默认实例避免静默变 mock(create_tts 支持显式 provider)；\n- ASR 拖尾保护：agent 本轮开口之前就已开始的 ASR 语音判为上一轮拖尾，不\n  打断、不作为当前问题回答，只合并进上一条 user 消息；utterance 起始信号\n  (首个 partial)缺失时用兜底窗口 ASR_TAIL_GUARD_MS(默认 800ms)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b002fc633a302058b569b57aa98ecb0e4ef481c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/5b002fc633a302058b569b57aa98ecb0e4ef481c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/5431b56051dcfb6ef5fb2bc124cd1ca1636a75a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/5431b56051dcfb6ef5fb2bc124cd1ca1636a75a0","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDU0MzFiNTYwNTFkY2ZiNmVmNWZiMmJjMTI0Y2QxY2ExNjM2YTc1YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/76e4ef6a3e7eae0ef700fa12b874eaf5ece5ef75","sha":"76e4ef6a3e7eae0ef700fa12b874eaf5ece5ef75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/76e4ef6a3e7eae0ef700fa12b874eaf5ece5ef75"}],"sha":"5431b56051dcfb6ef5fb2bc124cd1ca1636a75a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5431b56051dcfb6ef5fb2bc124cd1ca1636a75a0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/76e4ef6a3e7eae0ef700fa12b874eaf5ece5ef75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T10:19:54Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T10:19:54Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"fix(voice-agent): 修复 ASR 幽灵语句(task_id 过滤 + 救援窗口 + 句末 flush 等待)\n\nDashScope Fun-ASR 每句 finish-task 后立即换新 task_id，服务端会把旧\ntask 缓冲句 flush 成带旧 task_id 的 final 发回；_recv_loop 原不校验\ntask_id，导致同句出现第二个 final，在用户沉默时被缓存成\"待处理输入\"、\n在下一问播完时被当作回答消费(幽灵语句)。\n\n- _recv_loop 按当前活跃 task_id 过滤，旧 task 迟到消息丢弃；\n- 救援窗口：speech_end 时本地未合成出 final(云端延迟>语音段长)，放行旧\n  task 的第一条 flush final，避免整句丢失；\n- 句末 flush 等待：end_speech 发 finish-task 后等服务端 flush 最多\n  ASR_FLUSH_WAIT_MS(默认 600ms，0 关闭)，取更完整带标点的文本，超时回退\n  本地 partial，修复快语速短答被截断走错分支。\n\n真机两通验证通过，新增 5 个回归测试。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ec99943d36043289a705cfcecb0765f411823a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/4ec99943d36043289a705cfcecb0765f411823a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/76e4ef6a3e7eae0ef700fa12b874eaf5ece5ef75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/76e4ef6a3e7eae0ef700fa12b874eaf5ece5ef75","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDc2ZTRlZjZhM2U3ZWFlMGVmNzAwZmExMmI4NzRlYWY1ZWNlNWVmNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/1bb3165e5e05f0d2e0ee993cd4fe2647ee82a704","sha":"1bb3165e5e05f0d2e0ee993cd4fe2647ee82a704","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/1bb3165e5e05f0d2e0ee993cd4fe2647ee82a704"}],"sha":"76e4ef6a3e7eae0ef700fa12b874eaf5ece5ef75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/76e4ef6a3e7eae0ef700fa12b874eaf5ece5ef75"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/1bb3165e5e05f0d2e0ee993cd4fe2647ee82a704/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T10:19:30Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T10:19:30Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"refactor(flow)!: 移除决策节点，分支路由收敛到连线 intentExamples\n\n删除 decision 节点类型及其条件表达式/意图分类分支逻辑，原\n\"dialog → decision → 下游\" 三层结构改为 \"dialog 直接带 label/\nintentExamples 的连线 → 下游\"，dashboard 编辑器、shared 校验、\nvoice-agent 运行时三端同步移除。\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: FlowNodeType / FlowNodeContract 去掉 \"decision\"。\n已发布快照中若存在 decision 节点，拉取 /tasks/:id/context 会因\nschema 校验失败，上线前需确认无此类存量数据或做数据迁移。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3607e029e9be9753dac0415446a7a413af91436","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/d3607e029e9be9753dac0415446a7a413af91436"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/1bb3165e5e05f0d2e0ee993cd4fe2647ee82a704","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/1bb3165e5e05f0d2e0ee993cd4fe2647ee82a704","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDFiYjMxNjVlNWUwNWYwZDJlMGVlOTkzY2Q0ZmUyNjQ3ZWU4MmE3MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/040830a0636b36532aa9c406de0973321358627b","sha":"040830a0636b36532aa9c406