port template dynamic variables","tree":{"sha":"044ac776a7ddf1cd4a5d827c443dae187a62dcb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/044ac776a7ddf1cd4a5d827c443dae187a62dcb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/de6cee5388c5f7c36cfd3e10080f4028a737f5ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/de6cee5388c5f7c36cfd3e10080f4028a737f5ad","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGRlNmNlZTUzODhjNWY3YzM2Y2ZkM2UxMDA4MGY0MDI4YTczN2Y1YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/8bce1dede1d3f9be44fb63f5b8cb5934f623f047","sha":"8bce1dede1d3f9be44fb63f5b8cb5934f623f047","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8bce1dede1d3f9be44fb63f5b8cb5934f623f047"}],"sha":"de6cee5388c5f7c36cfd3e10080f4028a737f5ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/de6cee5388c5f7c36cfd3e10080f4028a737f5ad"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8bce1dede1d3f9be44fb63f5b8cb5934f623f047/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T16:56:43Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T16:56:43Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"fix(voice-agent): 修复云端 STT 跨句文本累加(整通电话只建一个 task 致服务端缓冲不清空)\n\n真机复现:第一轮\"到了呀\"，第二轮变成\"到了呀，明天下午2点\"——服务端识别文本\n一直在拼接。根因:DashScopeFunASRClient 整通电话只发一次 run-task，本地 FunASR\n靠 is_speaking:false/true 显式告知服务端句子边界，云端协议里没做等效实现，\nend_speech() 原来只在本地清状态、从不通知服务端，服务端缓冲从未真正清空。\n\n- end_speech():发 finish-task 结束当前 task + 立即重置本地状态(新 task_id、\n  _run_task_sent=False、_started.clear())，下一句第一帧音频触发全新 run-task，\n  服务端从零识别\n- _recv_loop:task-finished/task-failed 从 break(终止整条连接)改成 continue，\n  一条 WS 连接内按 run-task/finish-task 循环复用(DashScope 协议本就支持连接复用)\n- 新增回归测试 test_end_speech_resets_task_for_next_utterance，验证两轮\n  run-task 用不同 task_id、第二轮文本不含第一轮前缀；顺带修复 FakeWS 测试桩\n  (消息队列耗尽不该 StopAsyncIteration，应等待新消息直到 close())\n\n真机验证:两轮 task-started 各自独立，第二轮识别结果干净不带第一轮前缀。\n204 pytest 全绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e846f06db06f1ba09ec8d063432cc3f8e9f23d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/6e846f06db06f1ba09ec8d063432cc3f8e9f23d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/8bce1dede1d3f9be44fb63f5b8cb5934f623f047","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/8bce1dede1d3f9be44fb63f5b8cb5934f623f047","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDhiY2UxZGVkZTFkM2Y5YmU0NGZiNjNmNWI4Y2I1OTM0ZjYyM2YwNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/54b2d51b2cececf65ed76c0c4f152719f134801f","sha":"54b2d51b2cececf65ed76c0c4f152719f134801f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/54b2d51b2cececf65ed76c0c4f152719f134801f"}],"sha":"8bce1dede1d3f9be44fb63f5b8cb5934f623f047","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8bce1dede1d3f9be44fb63f5b8cb5934f623f047"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/54b2d51b2cececf65ed76c0c4f152719f134801f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T15:36:28Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T15:36:28Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"refactor: 移除营销活动(campaigns)功能,外呼任务批量创建改走 /tasks/new\n\n外呼任务成为唯一拨号业务对象,活动/活动名单不再作为独立概念存在。\n\n- API:删除 campaigns module/controller/service/DTO 及其单测;\n  tasks.service.ts 清理 campaignId/campaignLeadId 引用(联系历史记录/查询字段)\n- Prisma:新增迁移 20260712150000_remove_campaigns,按依赖顺序\n  drop 外键约束 → drop 字段(outbound_tasks/handoff_tickets/\n  contact_attempt_history) → drop 表(campaigns/campaign_leads/\n  lead_import_batches)\n- shared:移除 CAMPAIGN_READ/CREATE/UPDATE 权限点及角色模板引用、\n  campaigns 类型定义\n- dashboard:删除 /campaigns 页面及组件;新增 /tasks/new 页面承接\n  批量任务创建(CSV 导入,task-import-card 组件),已有测试覆盖\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a405af0767a557ed55f9d6d40da8c58d22f87d3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/a405af0767a557ed55f9d6d40da8c58d22f87d3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/54b2d51b2cececf65ed76c0c4f152719f134801f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/54b2d51b2cececf65ed76c0c4f152719f134801f","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDU0YjJkNTFiMmNlY2VjZjY1ZWQ3NmMwYzRmMTUyNzE5ZjEzNDgwMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/686977427367730c6d43a544ad03884abb4b1abd","sha":"686977427367730c6d43a544ad03884abb4b1abd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/686977427367730c6d43a544ad03884abb4b1abd"}],"sha":"54b2d51b2cececf65ed76c0c4f152719f134801f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/54b2d51b2cececf65ed76c0c4f152719f134801f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/686977427367730c6d43a544ad03884abb4b1abd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T15:25:26Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T15:25:26Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"docs(deployment): 补充前端(dashboard)部署节\n\n新增第 9 节,填补文档对前端部署的空白:\n- next build + next start -p 3000(非静态站点,不能纯 CDN 托管)\n- 前端两类 env:NEXT_PUBLIC_*(构建时内联,改了要重 build)vs 服务端私有\n- 浏览器 /api/* 的转发机制:dev 用 next rewrites、prod 用 Route Handler\n  (app/api/[...path]/route.ts),后端无需公网暴露、前后端可不同域\n- NEXT_PUBLIC_VOICE_AGENT_WS_URL 生产需 wss 反代、浏览器可达\n- KNOWLEDGE_ZONE_URL 微前端 Multi-Zones、反向代理拓扑\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c20ae0fe6ef978fffc93bec6415ac5540cc76427","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/c20ae0fe6ef978fffc93bec6415ac5540cc76427"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/686977427367730c6d43a544ad03884abb4b1abd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/686977427367730c6d43a544ad03884abb4b1abd","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDY4Njk3NzQyNzM2NzczMGM2ZDQzYTU0NGFkMDM4ODRhYmI0YjFhYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/afa98becd78a13fe38f637dd55e3ebc9b4e1f8f4","sha":"afa98becd78a13fe38f637dd55e3ebc9b4e1f8f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/afa98becd78a13fe38f637dd55e3ebc9b4e1f8f4"}],"sha":"686977427367730c6d43a544ad03884abb4b1abd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/686977427367730c6d43a544ad03884abb4b1abd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/afa98becd78a13fe38f637dd55e3ebc9b4e1f8f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T15:13:14Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T15:13:14Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"docs(deployment): 补充 AI Provider 本地/云端部署形态(ASR/embedding 云化)\n\n- 新增第 8 节:本地模型 vs 阿里云百炼云端切换表、全云化免部署 funasr-server、\n  云端 Fun-ASR 的 23s 空闲超时/句尾兜底特性、contracts extra=ignore 丢字段的坑\n- 第 3 节启动顺序标注 funasr-server 仅本地 STT/embedding 时需要\n- 第 5 节配置清单加 DASHSCOPE_API_KEY / STT_PROVIDER / INTENT_EMBED_PROVIDER\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0fcef2f0766376413588a99258f4f5954f19cb5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/0fcef2f0766376413588a99258f4f5954f19cb5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/afa98becd78a13fe38f637dd55e3ebc9b4e1f8f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/afa98becd78a13fe38f637dd55e3ebc9b4e1f8f4","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGFmYTk4YmVjZDc4YTEzZmUzOGY2MzdkZDU1ZTNlYmM5YjRlMWY4ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/90be1f0da2fa380846dc1b658b749ac791cf10d4","sha":"90be1f0da2fa380846dc1b658b749ac791cf10d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/90be1f0da2fa380846dc1b658b749ac791cf10d4"}],"sha":"afa98becd78a13fe38f637dd55e3ebc9b4e1f8f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/afa98becd78a13fe38f637dd55e3ebc9b4e1f8f4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/90be1f0da2fa380846dc1b658b749ac791cf10d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T15:06:16Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T15:06:16Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(voice-agent): ASR/embedding 云化(阿里云百炼 Fun-ASR + text-embedding)\n\n无 GPU 服务器改用云端:STT 与意图 embedding 切到阿里云百炼,复用 DASHSCOPE_API_KEY,\n可 env 切换、保留本地、一键回退。\n\n- STT: DashScopeFunASRClient(云端 Fun-ASR 实时,run-task/result-generated/finish-task)\n  + create_stt_client 工厂(STT_PROVIDER=funasr|dashscope);end_speech 用最近 partial\n  兜底 final(门控不发句尾静音,云端不自判句尾);修复 DashScope task 23s 空闲超时\n  (run-task 延迟到首帧真实音频,WS 靠 ping 保活)\n- embedding: DashScopeEmbedProvider(OpenAI 兼容 /embeddings,text-embedding-v4,按 index\n  排序 + L2 归一化)+ create_embed_provider_from_env dashscope 分支\n- 契约: FlowEdgeContract 补 intentExamples 字段(ContractModel extra=ignore 曾静默丢弃\n  边意图例句,致 embedding 层拿不到例句被跳过)\n- flow_executor: _exec_decision 从出边聚合意图例句 + embedding 诊断日志\n- 新增 test_stt_dashscope/test_intent_embed_dashscope;全量 203 pytest 绿\n\n真机验证:云端 STT 识别正常无超时;embedding 端到端触发(keyword 未命中→3 次真实\ndashscope /embeddings + cosine 计算,below_threshold 正常 fail-open LLM);契约修复\n确定性验证保留边例句。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df94bcad4fb5ab25c41427ca7e9a3227e7396eab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/df94bcad4fb5ab25c41427ca7e9a3227e7396eab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/90be1f0da2fa380846dc1b658b749ac791cf10d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/90be1f0da2fa380846dc1b658b749ac791cf10d4","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDkwYmUxZjBkYTJmYTM4MDg0NmRjMWI2NThiNzQ5YWM3OTFjZjEwZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/31e7ddef89376940428d08bb2b2d00579de0ce56","sha":"31e7ddef89376940428d08bb2b2d00579de0ce56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/31e7ddef89376940428d08bb2b2d00579de0ce56"}],"sha":"90be1f0da2fa380846dc1b658b749ac791cf10d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/90be1f0da2fa380846dc1b658b749ac791cf10d4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/31e7ddef89376940428d08bb2b2d00579de0ce56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T14:27:40Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T14:27:40Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"fix: trigger flow variables with dollar sign","tree":{"sha":"949ce24442dfe4911c9bc00f63125685920987fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/949ce24442dfe4911c9bc00f63125685920987fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/31e7ddef89376940428d08bb2b2d00579de0ce56","verification":{"paylo