912","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/09ad82851d8c557c1dfcb6b5dd58a22f8dfb3912"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/af4380c06cc4f8a970e646028722ff01afa58497/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:34:42Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:34:42Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"fix: 修复worker启动方式","tree":{"sha":"23c1488fbf243940d342acc9a0c8ead8767b2eb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/23c1488fbf243940d342acc9a0c8ead8767b2eb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/af4380c06cc4f8a970e646028722ff01afa58497","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/af4380c06cc4f8a970e646028722ff01afa58497","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGFmNDM4MGMwNmNjNGY4YTk3MGU2NDYwMjg3MjJmZjAxYWZhNTg0OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/d66298510ea81b506ee86dc7a7ba47081955d75c","sha":"d66298510ea81b506ee86dc7a7ba47081955d75c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/d66298510ea81b506ee86dc7a7ba47081955d75c"}],"sha":"af4380c06cc4f8a970e646028722ff01afa58497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/af4380c06cc4f8a970e646028722ff01afa58497"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/d66298510ea81b506ee86dc7a7ba47081955d75c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T21:03:17Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T21:03:17Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(flow-executor): 增强意图匹配能力，支持口语化表达和示例匹配\n\n1. 新增口语化语气词处理和归一化逻辑\n2. 新增短语匹配和意图极性判断，处理\"收到\"/\"收到了\"这类变体\n3. 新增基于配置示例的匹配逻辑，无需嵌入模型即可匹配用户表述\n4. 扩展否定词范围，新增\"无\"作为否定词\n5. 优化LLM分类提示词，添加参考示例辅助分类\n6. 新增相关测试用例验证功能正确性","tree":{"sha":"c5550f1a0b1cf7f086fd3fce256d16964af606c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/c5550f1a0b1cf7f086fd3fce256d16964af606c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/d66298510ea81b506ee86dc7a7ba47081955d75c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/d66298510ea81b506ee86dc7a7ba47081955d75c","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGQ2NjI5ODUxMGVhODFiNTA2ZWU4NmRjN2E3YmE0NzA4MTk1NWQ3NWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/9b9c8c323a06e3ba25989ba610206cfcfe8675b4","sha":"9b9c8c323a06e3ba25989ba610206cfcfe8675b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/9b9c8c323a06e3ba25989ba610206cfcfe8675b4"}],"sha":"d66298510ea81b506ee86dc7a7ba47081955d75c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/d66298510ea81b506ee86dc7a7ba47081955d75c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/9b9c8c323a06e3ba25989ba610206cfcfe8675b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T20:14:27Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T20:14:27Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"fix(voice-agent): TTS interrupt 误杀会话任务致僵尸通话（真机复现根治）\n\n根因：三个 TTS provider 的 synthesize() 都记录 asyncio.current_task()\n（= 会话任务本身），interrupt() 对它 .cancel()。于是 barge-in 取消与\n挂断取消都落在会话任务上、取消计数同样 +1，agent._speak 用\ntask.cancelling() 区分二者的判别器（ae9b459）把打断误判成挂断，\nCancelledError 一路上抛拆掉会话协程；媒体循环独立存活 → 僵尸通话\n（听得见、不回答，直到用户挂断）。真机日志 call_id=b3eebebd 复现：\n两条 final 间隔 <1s 时打断落在合成在途，会话即死。\n\n修复（TTS 层所有权，agent.py 判别器不动即变正确）：\n- synthesize() 改薄壳：create_task 专用合成子任务并 await；\n  interrupt() 只取消子任务，调用方取消计数永远为 0\n- 外部（挂断）取消 → 级联 cancel 子任务并等待收尾，不泄漏\n- 身份守卫清理登记，防止旧任务 finally 清掉新一轮状态\n- qwen run_sync 在阻塞 connect() 前后补 cancel 检查（打断后不再\n  白建会话白合成一遍，消除 ~700ms 冻结窗口）\n- close() 等在途合成收尾；server.py 会话取消日志不再臆断原因\n- 新增 tests/test_tts_interrupt.py 10 例：三 provider 参数化验证\n  打断不杀调用方/挂断上抛且回收子任务/连环打断可复用\n\n双盲交叉分析（deep-reasoner + Codex）结论一致。遗留跟进：共享 TTS\n实例的全局 interrupt() 在并发通话下的按 call 隔离（记 backlog）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"656eb2522a890a23e065d69c1bf44d826b272830","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/656eb2522a890a23e065d69c1bf44d826b272830"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/9b9c8c323a06e3ba25989ba610206cfcfe8675b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/9b9c8c323a06e3ba25989ba610206cfcfe8675b4","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDliOWM4YzMyM2EwNmUzYmEyNTk4OWJhNjEwMjA2Y2ZjZmU4Njc1YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/0d08610b8e9accae1aaa933e524df235aa4c1637","sha":"0d08610b8e9accae1aaa933e524df235aa4c1637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/0d08610b8e9accae1aaa933e524df235aa4c1637"}],"sha":"9b9c8c323a06e3ba25989ba610206cfcfe8675b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/9b9c8c323a06e3ba25989ba610206cfcfe8675b4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/0d08610b8e9accae1aaa933e524df235aa4c1637/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T19:09:13Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T19:09:13Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"docs(backlog): B-P2a 已交付划线,D3 标注部分交付(Twilio 网关)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd2215050a6a608e67db0c4d054d6734e4198364","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/dd2215050a6a608e67db0c4d054d6734e4198364"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/0d08610b8e9accae1aaa933e524df235aa4c1637","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/0d08610b8e9accae1aaa933e524df235aa4c1637","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDBkMDg2MTBiOGU5YWNjYWUxYWFhOTMzZTUyNGRmMjM1YWE0YzE2Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/5418b0a2d4ff97102d14c2a39d24a891dd882aed","sha":"5418b0a2d4ff97102d14c2a39d24a891dd882aed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5418b0a2d4ff97102d14c2a39d24a891dd882aed"}],"sha":"0d08610b8e9accae1aaa933e524df235aa4c1637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/0d08610b8e9accae1aaa933e524df235aa4c1637"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5418b0a2d4ff97102d14c2a39d24a891dd882aed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T19:07:41Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T19:07:41Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(voice-agent): Silero VAD 可插拔帧级检测器（backlog B-P2a）\n\n- vad.py 新增 FrameSpeechDetector 协议：状态机与单帧判定解耦，\n  底层模型可插拔且永不把主循环带崩\n- SileroFrameDetector（pysilero-vad/onnxruntime，无 torch）：\n  320 样本帧 → 512 样本窗字节缓冲；推理异常永久降级 webrtc\n- make_frame_detector_factory：VAD_PROVIDER=webrtc|silero（默认 webrtc），\n  silero 探针加载失败启动即回退；每通电话新建实例（逐句内部状态不复用）\n- agent/demo_server/main 统一接线；VAD_SILERO_THRESHOLD=0.5 可调\n- 新增 tests/test_vad_silero.py 12 例（缓冲数学/阈值边界/降级/reset/工厂回退）\n\n不注入 detector 时与旧内联 webrtcvad 路径逐帧等价，默认行为零变化。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31c24806391a22433356e33b124abe81b667c203","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/31c24806391a22433356