m/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/313e3be8ac099f616e1622ea25caeacb906796ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T15:33:16Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T15:33:16Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(voice-agent): 语义自适应端点检测（backlog B-P1b）\n\n固定 560ms 静音判停对报数字/犹豫的自然停顿一刀切。现按最近 partial\n文本结尾动态延长端点判停窗：\n\n- vad.py：注入 extra_silence_frames_provider（默认 lambda:0 逐帧等价\n  现状）；仅作用于 speech→silence 端点判停，不碰 P0 pending 噪声丢弃\n  （无 partial 可依据，延长只会削弱拒识）；provider 异常按 0 兜底\n- agent.py：结尾数字 +600ms、犹豫词(嗯/呃/就是/那个…) +400ms，总窗\n  1600ms 封顶；speech_start/end/打断/会话结束四处复位缓存防跨句污染；\n  [VAD/Semantic] 日志每 utterance 首次生效打一行供调参\n- 开关 VAD_SEMANTIC_ENDPOINT_ENABLED（默认开，false 完全回现状）；\n  env 全部安全解析\n- pytest +34（帧数学/封顶/复位/pending 不受影响/e2e），163 全绿\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"295b96f3f0fdaf678777345e88b1d55eb9dd8502","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/295b96f3f0fdaf678777345e88b1d55eb9dd8502"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/313e3be8ac099f616e1622ea25caeacb906796ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/313e3be8ac099f616e1622ea25caeacb906796ec","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDMxM2UzYmU4YWMwOTlmNjE2ZTE2MjJlYTI1Y2FlYWNiOTA2Nzk2ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/55a4036f12f1c3adb3dd874201ec894128d7748e","sha":"55a4036f12f1c3adb3dd874201ec894128d7748e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/55a4036f12f1c3adb3dd874201ec894128d7748e"}],"sha":"313e3be8ac099f616e1622ea25caeacb906796ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/313e3be8ac099f616e1622ea25caeacb906796ec"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/55a4036f12f1c3adb3dd874201ec894128d7748e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T15:33:15Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T15:33:15Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(funasr): 服务端 fsmn-vad 可配置关闭（backlog B-P1a）\n\n上游 voice-agent 的 WebRTC VAD 已做门控（只放行语音帧 + \"说完了\"信号\n驱动 2pass 整句），服务端 fsmn-vad 属重复推理，且引入整句边界不准风险。\n\n- config 新增 FUNASR_SERVER_VAD_ENABLED（默认 true 零行为变化）\n- 关闭时：ws/sse 流水线跳过服务端 VAD 推理，整段上游音频走既有\n  fallback 成熟路径；不加载 VAD 模型省显存；health models.vad 报 false\n  不影响整体 status\n- pytest 27→35（+8：关闭态流水线出 final、配置解析、模型跳过加载）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d75c1dc701b104f0c1463269a5e0475214dd07f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/1d75c1dc701b104f0c1463269a5e0475214dd07f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/55a4036f12f1c3adb3dd874201ec894128d7748e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/55a4036f12f1c3adb3dd874201ec894128d7748e","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDU1YTQwMzZmMTJmMWMzYWRiM2RkODc0MjAxZWM4OTQxMjhkNzc0OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/2a318fd6610a7ba4c168db94caed71c44bc2f9c3","sha":"2a318fd6610a7ba4c168db94caed71c44bc2f9c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/2a318fd6610a7ba4c168db94caed71c44bc2f9c3"}],"sha":"55a4036f12f1c3adb3dd874201ec894128d7748e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/55a4036f12f1c3adb3dd874201ec894128d7748e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/2a318fd6610a7ba4c168db94caed71c44bc2f9c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T15:18:57Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer