 归属打通）","tree":{"sha":"d23ed9609746f1e7dc3c35599bb9da272b3bf39d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/d23ed9609746f1e7dc3c35599bb9da272b3bf39d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/50dd0ba83a061db951271bddc6fe9e61219bd11e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/50dd0ba83a061db951271bddc6fe9e61219bd11e","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDUwZGQwYmE4M2EwNjFkYjk1MTI3MWJkZGM2ZmU5ZTYxMjE5YmQxMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/1097718e17f806343b679d287a7506cccdbed11f","sha":"1097718e17f806343b679d287a7506cccdbed11f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/1097718e17f806343b679d287a7506cccdbed11f"}],"sha":"50dd0ba83a061db951271bddc6fe9e61219bd11e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/50dd0ba83a061db951271bddc6fe9e61219bd11e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/1097718e17f806343b679d287a7506cccdbed11f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T19:06:13Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T19:06:13Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"docs(knowledge): 标注路线 B（无状态联合登录）已实现 + 语义边界","tree":{"sha":"4ac8f8e2adc316e2d13b3420a3dfcf8e74ed6fbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/4ac8f8e2adc316e2d13b3420a3dfcf8e74ed6fbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/1097718e17f806343b679d287a7506cccdbed11f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/1097718e17f806343b679d287a7506cccdbed11f","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDEwOTc3MThlMTdmODA2MzQzYjY3OWQyODdhNzUwNmNjY2RiZWQxMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/a9c34508cb0d53b00d24560d6318e0bedd5d3ece","sha":"a9c34508cb0d53b00d24560d6318e0bedd5d3ece","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/a9c34508cb0d53b00d24560d6318e0bedd5d3ece"}],"sha":"1097718e17f806343b679d287a7506cccdbed11f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/1097718e17f806343b679d287a7506cccdbed11f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/a9c34508cb0d53b00d24560d6318e0bedd5d3ece/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T18:40:58Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T18:40:58Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"docs(knowledge): 更正鉴权判断 + 补网关配置样例（nginx/traefik）\n\n联调后核查发现两系统鉴权当前不互通：JWT 密钥不同值、ai-call 用 httpOnly\ncookie 而 ai-knowledge 用 localStorage+Bearer 且 API 只认 header、claim\nrole/roles 不一致。故 Multi-Zones 只解决界面内嵌与路由，未自动带来 SSO。\n\n- 把「鉴权流（为什么免改造）」更正为「鉴权：现状、差距与两条路」，如实\n  列出差距，给出路线 A（interim 各登各的，零代码）与路线 B（真 SSO，改动\n  在 ai-knowledge：统一密钥 + API 接受 cookie + web 带 credentials）。\n- 联调步骤标注「界面出来≠数据出来」。\n- 新增附录：nginx 与 traefik 网关样例（四条前缀规则，/knowledge/api 优先于\n  /knowledge，剥前缀到 ai-knowledge API）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e48744fecdc89c70857c40724c3e0d25d1217567","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/e48744fecdc89c70857c40724c3e0d25d1217567"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/a9c34508cb0d53b00d24560d6318e0bedd5d3ece","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/a9c34508cb0d53b00d24560d6318e0bedd5d3ece","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGE5YzM0NTA4Y2IwZDUzYjAwZDI0NTYwZDYzMThlMGJlZGQ1ZDNlY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/151fe5ea6f2d15b5a3d7279bdc1b9820211b85cb","sha":"151fe5ea6f2d15b5a3d7279bdc1b9820211b85cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/151fe5ea6f2d15b5a3d7279bdc1b9820211b85cb"}],"sha":"a9c34508cb0d53b00d24560d6318e0bedd5d3ece","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/a9c34508cb0d53b00d24560d6318e0bedd5d3ece"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/151fe5ea6f2d15b5a3d7279bdc1b9820211b85cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T18:16:05Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T18:16:05Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(knowledge): 知识库管理界面改用 Multi-Zones 内嵌 ai-knowledge\n\n前端知识库管理页此前在外部模式下会 404（代理到 ai-knowledge 不存在的\n/knowledge-base 端点）。改为 Next.js Multi-Zones 微前端内嵌 ai-knowledge\n原厂知识库 UI，零重写、永不脱节。检索链路（voice RAG + 检索测试，走\n/search/retrieve）完全不动。\n\n- next.config.js: 新增 env 门控 rewrite——KNOWLEDGE_ZONE_URL 指向\n  ai-knowledge web 时，beforeFiles 把 /knowledge 与 /knowledge/:path*\n  转发到该 zone（覆盖本地 mock 页）；不设则渲染自带 mock 页，现状不变。\n  原 /api rewrite 移到 afterFiles，行为不变。\n- .env.example: 记录 KNOWLEDGE_ZONE_URL。\n- docs/knowledge-base-microfrontend.md: 跨仓设计文档（路由拓扑、API 分流\n  陷阱与解法、鉴权流、env、联调步骤、回滚、取舍）。\n\n鉴权免改造：两系统共享 @xiaoli-byte/authz + JWT 密钥 + httpOnly cookie，\n同域部署后 cookie 自动共享。前提硬约束：必须同域。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a84cda189b19810e61aef949576f85e48fbe432e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/a84cda189b19810e61aef949576f85e48fbe432e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/151fe5ea6f2d15b5a3d7279bdc1b9820211b85cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/151fe5ea6f2d15b5a3d7279bdc1b9820211b85cb","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDE1MWZlNWVhNmYyZDE1YjVhM2Q3Mjc5YmRjMWI5ODIwMjExYjg1Y2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/8e3c7d1f0a6785670e88f1dafe29dae9e11d68af","sha":"8e3c7d1f0a6785670e88f1dafe29dae9e11d68af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8e3c7d1f0a6785670e88f1dafe29dae9e11d68af"}],"sha":"151fe5ea6f2d15b5a3d7279bdc1b9820211b85cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/151fe5ea6f2d15b5a3d7279bdc1b9820211b85cb"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=3159e60128958c65a0e2f42622529a36f12952cf&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A43%3A31.480Z"}');
