jU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/bcd0d2586d46eb60c1faf0b93f618cc59b712097","sha":"bcd0d2586d46eb60c1faf0b93f618cc59b712097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/bcd0d2586d46eb60c1faf0b93f618cc59b712097"}],"sha":"0c12316910cb30ca90bfe35fe7bb6b9c19bb9eb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/0c12316910cb30ca90bfe35fe7bb6b9c19bb9eb5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/bcd0d2586d46eb60c1faf0b93f618cc59b712097/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:58:52Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:58:52Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"test(authz): CALL-10 真环境隔离验证通过（14/14）+ 脚本成功码修 2xx\n\n在本地 ai-call:3001 + ai-knowledge:9999、两租户各一篇 COMPANY 文档上跑通\nscripts/call-10-cross-tenant-retrieval.mjs：14/14 必过断言通过——直连与经 ai-call\n代理两路径下租户 A 只得 A 文档、B 只得 B、id 不相交；缺 X-Tenant-Id/X-User-Id、\nai-call 缺 X-Service-Token 均 401。\n\n脚本修复：成功码判定从 ===200 改为 2xx（NestJS POST 默认 201，此前误判失败）。\n\n联调抓到的 retrieve 401 bug 已在 ai-knowledge 侧修复（commit 832daae，retrieve 拆\n独立 controller）。backlog/architecture/runbook 记录 CALL-10 完成；P2 上线阻塞仅剩\nCALL-11（迁移真库演练）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98ee0128925d07601bfe4302439f201cac96e103","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/98ee0128925d07601bfe4302439f201cac96e103"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/bcd0d2586d46eb60c1faf0b93f618cc59b712097","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/bcd0d2586d46eb60c1faf0b93f618cc59b712097","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGJjZDBkMjU4NmQ0NmViNjBjMWZhZjBiOTNmNjE4Y2M1OWI3MTIwOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/23b9a4385f40f187037c38ca1a5e3926d556678d","sha":"23b9a4385f40f187037c38ca1a5e3926d556678d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/23b9a4385f40f187037c38ca1a5e3926d556678d"}],"sha":"bcd0d2586d46eb60c1faf0b93f618cc59b712097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/bcd0d2586d46eb60c1faf0b93f618cc59b712097"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/23b9a4385f40f187037c38ca1a5e3926d556678d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:06:21Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:06:21Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"docs(authz): 定 CALL-08 暂缓 / CALL-12 配置对齐（决策 2026-07-10）\n\n- CALL-08 部门(DEPT)级 ACL：ai-call 侧暂缓——部门能力落在 ai-knowledge（已有\n  departments 模块）；无产品驱动前不付高风险 User/claim 迁移，现用显式 grant 模拟。\n- CALL-12 激活按库过滤：取「配置对齐」方案——scenario 的 knowledgeBaseId 直接填\n  ai-knowledge 目标 folder 的真实 id，零代码运营激活。\n- architecture §8「接入 ResourceGrant ACL」勾选为 [x]（call_task + campaign 已做，\n  DEPT 暂缓）；CALL-10 手册的激活条件更新为配置对齐。\n\n至此 P2 收尾仅剩 CALL-10/11 两个上线阻塞项（脚本已备，待真环境执行）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8760760e49a52ea478fe31413d0a56e5b6ec4917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/8760760e49a52ea478fe31413d0a56e5b6ec4917"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/23b9a4385f40f187037c38ca1a5e3926d556678d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/23b9a4385f40f187037c38ca1a5e3926d556678d","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDIzYjlhNDM4NWY0MGYxODcwMzdjMzhjYTFhNWUzOTI2ZDU1NjY3OGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/c001b0361aadc97557c2d721ed70a3f46809c9fc","sha":"c001b0361aadc97557c2d721ed70a3f46