all/commits/001bec578e9bd49fc5fdb15c1381684069dc8f79"}],"sha":"0f204391834e5ddf99ae1b42afe886861576c584","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/0f204391834e5ddf99ae1b42afe886861576c584"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/001bec578e9bd49fc5fdb15c1381684069dc8f79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T14:43:28Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T14:43:28Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(authz): CALL-10 实测脚本 + 修 ownerId=null 检索 401（缺口#2）\n\n准备 CALL-06 跨仓真隔离联调（CALL-10，上线阻塞项）：\n- scripts/call-10-cross-tenant-retrieval.mjs：零依赖驱动，覆盖租户隔离/鉴权边界/\n  端到端代理/knowledgeBaseId 作用域探针，退出码语义化。\n- docs/testing/call-10-cross-tenant-retrieval.md：运行手册（令牌对齐、fixtures、\n  判定标准、两处已修缺口的激活条件与限制）。\n\n缺口#2 修复：ai-knowledge 的 ServiceAuthGuard 强制要求 X-User-Id，而 CALL-05 保留了\nownerId=null 的系统/历史任务 → 这类通话检索被 401、做不了 RAG。knowledge-base.service\n的 resolveIdentity 无用户上下文时回退到服务账号 KNOWLEDGE_SERVICE_FALLBACK_USER_ID\n（默认 system），只检索租户公开文档。用 || 兜底使空串 X-User-Id 也回退（review Finding A）。\n\n配套缺口#1（knowledgeBaseId 按库过滤）在 ai-knowledge 侧实现。\n测试：KB spec 12/12；typecheck 通过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1dac5412c1c1e27142d94ea33b47af19eb19825e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/1dac5412c1c1e27142d94ea33b47af19eb19825e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/001bec578e9bd49fc5fdb15c1381684069dc8f79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/001bec578e9bd49fc5fdb15c1381684069dc8f79","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDAwMWJlYzU3OGU5YmQ0OWZjNWZkYjE1YzEzODE2ODQwNjlkYzhmNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/f08ac7eae317a5dc456dad78227c3de0107dbf94","sha":"f08ac7eae317a5dc456dad78227c3de0107dbf94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/f08ac7eae317a5dc456dad78227c3de0107dbf94"}],"sha":"001bec578e9bd49fc5fdb15c1381684069dc8f79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/001bec578e9bd49fc5fdb15c1381684069dc8f79"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/f08ac7eae317a5dc456dad78227c3de0107dbf94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T13:15:49Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T13:15:49Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"docs(authz): 登记 P2 收尾工单 CALL-08~11，勾选架构 §8 ai-call 清单\n\nCALL-01~07 代码工单已完成并进 main；对照 authz-architecture §8 仍有 4 项未闭合，\n登记为收尾工单：\n- CALL-08 ResourceGrant 扩到部门(DEPT)主体（范围决策，需先确认部门模型）\n- CALL-09 Campaign 复用 ResourceGrant ACL（范围决策）\n- CALL-10 CALL-06 跨仓真隔离联调实测（上线阻塞：单测绿但真环境未验，含 knowledgeBaseId 契约核对）\n- CALL-11 CALL-05 迁移真库 migrate deploy 演练（上线阻塞）\n\narchitecture.md §8 ai-call 清单按 main 实况勾选：已完成 [x]，ResourceGrant ACL 标 [~]\n并指向 CALL-08/09 的遗留部分。\n\n跨仓契约：同步改动需镜像到 ai-knowledge 两份同名文档。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"219bd5951c56e969ad71a7a641dbcdde7817bb9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/219bd5951c56e969ad71a7a641dbcdde7817bb9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/f08ac7eae317a5dc456dad78227c3de0107dbf94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/f08ac7eae317a5dc456dad78227c3de0107dbf94","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGYwOGFjN2VhZTMxN2E1ZGM0NTZkYWQ3ODIyN2MzZGUwMTA3ZGJmOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/8c741016abc0d00a9d7fbbadfccc56308bc653e5","sha":"8c741016abc0d00a9d7fbbadfccc56308bc653e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8c741016abc0d00a9d7fbbadfccc56308bc653e5"}],"sha":"f08ac7eae317a5dc456dad78227c3de0107dbf94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/f08ac7eae317a5dc456dad78227c3de0107dbf94"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8c741016abc0d00a9d7fbbadfccc56308bc653e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T12:52:47Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T12:52:47Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(authz): RAG 检索链路透传租户身份，服务间调用收紧（CALL-06）\n\n打通 voice-agent → ai-call → ai-knowledge 的租户隔离检索链路：\n\n- 任务上下文透传 tenantId/ownerId（contracts + shared 类型 + Python contract 同步）\n- voice-agent RAG 请求补 X-Service-Token（SERVICE_API_TOKEN）+ X-Tenant-Id/X-User-Id，\n  从 CallSession 取租户上下文；检索失败仍优雅降级为空上下文，不中断通话\n- knowledge-base.service 代理切到 ai-knowledge 的 /search/retrieve，携带\n  X-Service-Token（KNOWLEDGE_SERVICE_API_TOKEN，与入站令牌分离）+ 租户身份，\n  并对多种响应外形做防御性归一\n- 缺租户上下文时 fail-closed：代理外部前即拒绝，杜绝跨租户泄露\n\nReview 加固（同轮）：\n- 外部模式启动自检：KNOWLEDGE_SERVICE_BASE_URL 已配但缺 SERVICE_API_TOKEN 时拒绝启动，\n  堵死「ServiceAuthGuard 非 prod fail-open + 代理真实数据」的未鉴权跨租户读洞\n- resolveIdentity 移除永不触发的单数 ''role'' 回退（authz guard 只写复数 ''roles''）\n- requestExternal 不再对已解析身份二次 resolveIdentity\n\n测试：KB service spec 9/9（含 3 条启动自检）、voice-agent pytest 17/17；API typecheck 通过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ae0a6fe209f26332eda1fd8955ca42643c48c7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/2ae0a6fe209f26332eda1fd8955ca42643c48c7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/8c741016abc0d00a9d7fbbadfccc56308bc653e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/8c741016abc0d00a9d7fbbadfccc56308bc653e5","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDhjNzQxMDE2YWJjMGQwMGE5ZDdmYmJhZGZjY2M1NjMwOGJjNjUzZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/ea2f98f437d39db98bcfd98c82dda5f7b3604afe","sha":"ea2f98f437d39db98bcfd98c82dda5f7b3604afe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/ea2f98f437d39db98bcfd98c82dda5f7b3604afe"}],"sha":"8c741016abc0d00a9d7fbbadfccc56308bc653e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/8c741016abc0d00a9d7fbbadfccc56308bc653e5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/ea2f98f437d39db98bcfd98c82dda5f7b3604afe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:41:41Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:41:41Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"docs(authz): 补齐 P2(ai-call) 工单完成状态\n\nCALL-01~05,07 已完成，CALL-06 阻塞于 ai-knowledge 的 KB-08——之前提交只改代码，\n从未回写这份跨系统契约文档，状态一直停留在最初的 Draft。逐工单加「状态」行\n（含 commit hash 和范围收窄说明），总控表加完成/阻塞标记，头部加进度摘要。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"85883f084460d83f8c6d5adef11febdaecc1234f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/85883f084460d83f8c6d5adef11febdaecc1234f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/ea2f98f437d39db98bcfd98c82dda5f7b3604afe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/ea2f98f437d39db98bcfd98c82dda5f7b3604afe","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGVhMmY5OGY0MzdkMzlkYjk4YmNmZDk4YzgyZGRhNWY3YjM2MDRhZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/492cc7d83133f2de8f650874c80ec703581068ff","sha":"492cc7d83133f2de8f650874c80ec703581068ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/492cc7d83133f2de8f650874c80ec703581068ff"}],"sha":"ea2f98f437d39db98bcfd98c82dda5f7b3604afe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/ea2f98f437d39db98bcfd98c82dda5f7b3604afe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/492cc7d83133f2de8f650874c80ec703581068ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:32:10Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:32:10Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"test(authz): 回归锁定 auth cookie 的 CSRF 属性 (CALL-07)\n\nCALL-07 要求生产环境 SameSite 改 Lax。核实发现该修复已在 CALL-01 采用\n@xiaoli-byte/authz/jwt 的 buildAccessCookieOptions/buildRefreshCookieOptions\n时顺带完成——两者在 dev/prod 下均默认 sameSite=\"lax\" + httpOnly=true（包自身\n文档注释确认：此前 ai-call 生产环境用的是 SameSite=None 且无 CSRF 防护）。\n\n之前没有测试锁定这一属性，故本次新增 auth.controller.spec.ts：login/refresh\n设置的两个 cookie 均为 SameSite=Lax + HttpOnly；logout 清除 cookie 时属性一致\n（避免清除失败）。防止未来改动无意中放宽回 \"none\" 或去掉 httpOnly。\n\n更新 auth.controller.ts 顶部注释，明确此修复已闭环并指向回归测试。\n\n验证：lint(tsc)=0；API 146 测试全过（新增 3 个）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42c44a70a84a56c78ce0fa37751414de1149d61d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/42c44a70a84a56c78ce0fa37751414de1149d61d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/492cc7d83133f2de8f650874c80ec703581068ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/492cc7d83133f2de8f650874c80ec703581068ff","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDQ5MmNjN2Q4MzEzM2YyZGU4ZjY1MDg3NGM4MGVjNzAzNTgxMDY4ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/00d0a5ce4e48d2250b894eed77bad646c8a4d1c0","sha":"00d0a5ce4e48d2250b894eed77bad646c8a4d1c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/00d0a5ce4e48d2250b894eed77bad646c8a4d1c0"}],"sha":"492cc7d83133f2de8f650874c80ec703581068ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/492cc7d83133f2de8f650874c80ec703581068ff"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/00d0a5ce4e48d2250b894eed77bad646c8a4d1c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:28:49Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:28:49Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(authz): 接入 ResourceGrant 数据级 ACL，OutboundTask 收紧为 owner+授权可见 (CALL-05)\n\n在 CALL-03 租户强制过滤之上再收一层：OutboundTask 列表/详情默认只对创建者、\n被显式 ResourceGrant 授权的用户/角色、以及 admin/super_admin 可见。\n\n范围收窄说明：backlog 原描述「坐席仅见自己或本部门任务」需要 department 概念，\n但当前 User 无部门字段、OutboundTask 也无 owner 字段——不当产品语义决策留给此\n工单单方面拍板，故与用户对齐为最小闭环：加 ownerId + 显式授权，不做部门维度；\nCampaign 的 ACL 接入按 backlog「按需」标注，本轮不做。\n\n- schema.prisma：OutboundTask 加可空 owner_id；新增 ResourceGrant 模型\n  （resource_grants 表，对齐 @xiaoli-byte/authz 的 acl/ 模块假定结构）。\n  纯增量迁移，无需三步走。ResourceGrant 加入 CALL-03 的 TENANT_MODELS。\n- task-acl.ts：可见性判定的纯函数（isTaskAclBypass/taskGrantWhere/\n  taskVisibilityWhere/hasViewPerm），复用 @xiaoli-byte/authz/acl 的 AclPerm。\n  历史/系统创建任务（owner_id 为空）按迁移前行为对租户内 task:read 持有者可见，\n  只有新建任务的创建者被收紧。\n- tasks.service.ts：create() 从 CLS 写入 ownerId；list() 按可见性过滤；新增\n  assertTaskVisible()（非授权时 404 而非 403，避免枚举）。get()/getContext() 等\n  内部读取路径不变，只有 controller 的 GET /tasks/:id 用户端点收紧。\n- 新增单测：task-acl.spec.ts（12 个纯函数测试）+ tasks.service.spec.ts 5 个\n  ACL 集成测试（owner 可见、陌生人 404、显式授权放行、admin 跳过 ACL 查询、\n  历史任务对所有人可见）。\n\n验证：lint(tsc)=0；API 143 测试全过；dashboard 61 测试全过。迁移未在真实库\n验证（本机无 Postgres/Docker 未启动）——上线前需一次 `migrate deploy` 演练。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2301fdc067a93120078222ad4faef11a2b4186d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/2301fdc067a93120078222ad4faef11a2b4186d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/00d0a5ce4e48d2250b894eed77bad646c8a4d1c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/00d0a5ce4e48d2250b894eed77bad646c8a4d1c0","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDAwZDBhNWNlNGU0OGQyMjUwYjg5NGVlZDc3YmFkNjQ2YzhhNGQxYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/a87144cab25d8579ae662ceaff5027a98df6fe88","sha":"a87144cab25d8579ae662ceaff5027a98df6fe88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/a87144cab25d8579ae662ceaff5027a98df6fe88"}],"sha":"00d0a5ce4e48d2250b894eed77bad646c8a4d1c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/00d0a5ce4e48d2250b894eed77bad646c8a4d1c0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/a87144cab25d8579ae662ceaff5027a98df6fe88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:12:34Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:12:34Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(authz): 权限码去贴标签，6 模块持有自有 3 段码 (CALL-04)\n\ncampaigns/quality/compliance/analytics/tenants/platform 此前借用\ntask:*/call:read/scenario:*/system:role:* 等其它模块权限码「贴标签」，\n现各自持有 call:{module}:{action} 3 段码（符合 authz-architecture §4）。\n\n- shared/auth.ts：新增 call:{campaign,quality,compliance,analytics,tenant,\n  platform}:* 权限码；operator/viewer 模板加入业务模块读写码，保持与此前\n  等价的可见范围；tenant/platform 收紧为管理员专属（admin 经 ALL_PERMISSIONS）。\n- 6 controllers：@Permissions 换成各自模块码。platform 全部端点（跨租户\n  可观测性/成本/组织/模板）收紧为 call:platform:*，修正此前 call:read 贴标签\n  导致的 operator/viewer 越权访问。\n- product-module-permissions.spec.ts：新增 6 模块端点码断言 + operator/viewer/\n  admin 可见范围断言。\n- decorators.ts：更新注释——task/flow 等仍是 2 段码，PermissionKey cast 保留。\n\nseed 与角色映射为数据驱动（Object.values(PERMISSIONS) + ROLE_TEMPLATES），\n重跑 prisma:seed 幂等补齐新权限行与角色授权，无需 schema 迁移。\n\n验证：lint(tsc)=0；API 126 测试全过；dashboard 61 测试全过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a9c94882b9d30bb676eeb622b2fd80ab28b7712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/6a9c94882b9d30bb676eeb622b2fd80ab28b7712"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/a87144cab25d8579ae662ceaff5027a98df6fe88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/a87144cab25d8579ae662ceaff5027a98df6fe88","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGE4NzE0NGNhYjI1ZDg1NzlhZTY2MmNlYWZmNTAyN2E5OGRmNmZlODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/5fb261d41024ac00891e3e973cd2912349d7da57","sha":"5fb261d41024ac00891e3e973cd2912349d7da57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5fb261d41024ac00891e3e973cd2912349d7da57"}],"sha":"a87144cab25d8579ae662ceaff5027a98df6fe88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/a87144cab25d8579ae662ceaff5027a98df6fe88"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5fb261d41024ac00891e3e973cd2912349d7da57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:00:54Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:00:54Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(authz): CLS 租户注入 + Prisma 强制过滤 (CALL-03)\n\n在 Prisma 层对 15 张业务表的所有读写强制注入 tenantId（来源为 CLS，由\n@xiaoli-byte/authz 的 JwtAuthGuard 写入），实现真正的租户隔离。\n\n- tenant-extension.ts：Client Extension（$allOperations）自动注入/过滤 tenantId；\n  非租户表放行、系统旁路放行、无租户上下文 fail-closed 抛 ForbiddenException。\n  读/条件写合并 where.tenantId（依赖 Prisma7 extendedWhereUnique GA），\n  create/createMany/upsert 补 tenantId。\n- system-context.ts：runAsSystem 逃生舱 + CLS key 常量。\n- prisma.service/module：工厂 provider 在 PrismaService token 下返回 $extends\n  后的扩展 client，调用点零改动。\n- outbox.worker / task-scheduler：每次 tick 包 runAsSystem。\n- service-auth.guard：服务令牌校验通过后标记系统上下文，集中覆盖\n  @Public+ServiceAuthGuard 跨租户端点（context/provider-events/retrieve/runtime 等）。\n- tenant-extension.spec.ts：14 个单测覆盖注入/create/upsert/唯一键合并/\n  fail-closed/旁路/非租户表/15 表清单。\n\n验证：lint(tsc)=0；API 全套 117 测试全过。真实库 A/B 隔离对拍待本地 Postgres。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b33890d1c51a0a6448126d5a449c452d216b5dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/0b33890d1c51a0a6448126d5a449c452d216b5dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/5fb261d41024ac00891e3e973cd2912349d7da57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/5fb261d41024ac00891e3e973cd2912349d7da57","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDVmYjI2MWQ0MTAyNGFjMDA4OTFlM2U5NzNjZDI5MTIzNDlkN2RhNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/f83c7d4becde60ee5ee1939474eb034e4decdec8","sha":"f83c7d4becde60ee5ee1939474eb034e4decdec8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/f83c7d4becde60ee5ee1939474eb034e4decdec8"}],"sha":"5fb261d41024ac00891e3e973cd2912349d7da57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5fb261d41024ac00891e3e973cd2912349d7da57"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/f83c7d4becde60ee5ee1939474eb034e4decdec8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T21:13:17Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T21:13:17Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat: 新增平台管理全量功能模块\n\n实现了模板克隆、数据洞察、演示引导、组织管理等完整平台能力，包括前后端接口、页面组件、测试用例与工具类","tree":{"sha":"f280c49cd23f42b2215f5b4e78dc35ebf2cf9764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/f280c49cd23f42b2215f5b4e78dc35ebf2cf9764"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/f83c7d4becde60ee5ee1939474eb034e4decdec8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/f83c7d4becde60ee5ee1939474eb034e4decdec8","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKGY4M2M3ZDRiZWNkZTYwZWU1ZWUxOTM5NDc0ZWIwMzRlNGRlY2RlYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/4b6fdca11d951752e48df464e885267e444d1c87","sha":"4b6fdca11d951752e48df464e885267e444d1c87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/4b6fdca11d951752e48df464e885267e444d1c87"}],"sha":"f83c7d4becde60ee5ee1939474eb034e4decdec8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/f83c7d4becde60ee5ee1939474eb034e4decdec8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/4b6fdca11d951752e48df464e885267e444d1c87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T20:39:21Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T20:39:21Z","email":"15719466147@163.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat(auth): 用 @xiaoli-byte/authz 替换本地鉴权实现 (CALL-01)\n\n按 docs/authz-implementation-backlog.md 的 CALL-01 工单，引入共享鉴权包\n@xiaoli-byte/authz，移除本地 auth 实现：\n\n- app.module 注册包的全局 Guard（AuthzModule.forRoot）+ nestjs-cls 租户上下文，\n  删除本地 APP_GUARD(JwtAuthGuard/PermissionsGuard) 注册\n- 删除 auth/ 下本地 jwt.strategy、jwt-auth.guard、permissions.guard、roles.guard\n  及 decorators/ 目录；auth/decorators.ts 从包再导出 Public/CurrentUser/RequirePermissions\n- auth.service 改用包的 JWT 签发/校验；controllers 改用 AuthClaims + buildUserProfile\n- system.service 在角色增删改后刷新 role→permission 内存映射\n  (role-permission-map.store/refresher)\n- package.json 移除 @nestjs/jwt、@nestjs/passport、passport(-jwt)，\n  新增 @xiaoli-byte/authz、nestjs-cls；新增 .npmrc 指向 GitHub Packages\n\n权限码仍为 2 段式，装饰器暂留类型 cast，待 CALL-04 收敛为 call:{module}:{action}。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20ca9a7c21ff9f508eb0df88e9046745286e012e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/20ca9a7c21ff9f508eb0df88e9046745286e012e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/4b6fdca11d951752e48df464e885267e444d1c87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/4b6fdca11d951752e48df464e885267e444d1c87","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDRiNmZkY2ExMWQ5NTE3NTJlNDhkZjQ2NGU4ODUyNjdlNDQ0ZDFjODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/7cb75a75e9b9c7f961866e6c037679168b09596d","sha":"7cb75a75e9b9c7f961866e6c037679168b09596d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/7cb75a75e9b9c7f961866e6c037679168b09596d"}],"sha":"4b6fdca11d951752e48df464e885267e444d1c87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/4b6fdca11d951752e48df464e885267e444d1c87"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/7cb75a75e9b9c7f961866e6c037679168b09596d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T12:06:59Z","email":"351527421@qq.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T12:06:59Z","email":"351527421@qq.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"docs(homepage): plan public landing implementation","tree":{"sha":"5e84ede43812ca1d23586a61b914bc976230530e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/5e84ede43812ca1d23586a61b914bc976230530e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/7cb75a75e9b9c7f961866e6c037679168b09596d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/co