"0bed7e8adcae5904961085abe515cab9432ba155","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/0bed7e8adcae5904961085abe515cab9432ba155"}],"sha":"581e98942c291f467a8d8ac95ab8d0f3d8dacbcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/581e98942c291f467a8d8ac95ab8d0f3d8dacbcc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/0bed7e8adcae5904961085abe515cab9432ba155/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T18:08:45Z","email":"351527421@qq.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T18:08:45Z","email":"351527421@qq.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat: 新增租户管理、指标监控模块并重构任务调度架构\n\n此提交实现了多租户基础平台能力，新增：\n1. 租户管理全流程API与数据库表结构\n2. 系统指标监控服务与端点\n3. 独立的任务调度工作进程\n4. 通话提供商事件回调接口\n\n同时调整配置：\n- 新增通话录音公共URL环境变量\n- 拆分 outbox 和 scheduler 工作进程配置\n- 为 outbox 模块添加指标监控依赖","tree":{"sha":"e970ed3caef8072f19ff1bd536b1fba84c58c471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/e970ed3caef8072f19ff1bd536b1fba84c58c471"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/0bed7e8adcae5904961085abe515cab9432ba155","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/0bed7e8adcae5904961085abe515cab9432ba155","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDBiZWQ3ZThhZGNhZTU5MDQ5NjEwODVhYmU1MTVjYWI5NDMyYmExNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/5e8cc19623f699fe56d50cebf8219d2b509a24a7","sha":"5e8cc19623f699fe56d50cebf8219d2b509a24a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5e8cc19623f699fe56d50cebf8219d2b509a24a7"}],"sha":"0bed7e8adcae5904961085abe515cab9432ba155","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/0bed7e8adcae5904961085abe515cab9432ba155"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5e8cc19623f699fe56d50cebf8219d2b509a24a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T17:08:26Z","email":"351527421@qq.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T17:08:26Z","email":"351527421@qq.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"feat: add campaign management, analytics, quality and compliance modules\n\n这是一次大型功能迭代，新增了以下核心能力：\n1.  外呼活动全生命周期管理：创建、查询、状态更新、批量导入名单\n2.  通话质检分析：自动质检、结果修正、质检列表查询\n3.  数据统计分析：外呼效果概览、漏斗分析、失败原因统计\n4.  合规中心：外呼策略配置、操作审计日志\n5.  CRM外呼动作支持：新增crm类型外呼动作，支持售后工单等业务流程集成\n6.  任务关联外呼活动字段：支持按活动维度统计和管理任务\n7.  服务认证增强：生产环境强制校验服务调用token\n8.  新增独立worker进程配置，拆分任务调度和outbox处理逻辑\n9.  完善的单元测试覆盖所有新增模块和核心流程","tree":{"sha":"9efe98feb2ae0484f524ddec295dc6a4fccbe2bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/9efe98feb2ae0484f524ddec295dc6a4fccbe2bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/5e8cc19623f699fe56d50cebf8219d2b509a24a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/5e8cc19623f699fe56d50cebf8219d2b509a24a7","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDVlOGNjMTk2MjNmNjk5ZmU1NmQ1MGNlYmY4MjE5ZDJiNTA5YTI0YTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/47d24703c1cc18081cd89f63848c9163e2a9f8bf","sha":"47d24703c1cc18081cd89f63848c9163e2a9f8bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/47d24703c1cc18081cd89f63848c9163e2a9f8bf"}],"sha":"5e8cc19623f699fe56d50cebf8219d2b509a24a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/5e8cc19623f699fe56d50cebf8219d2b509a24a7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/47d24703c1cc18081cd89f63848c9163e2a9f8bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T14:04:32Z","email":"351527421@qq.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T14:04:32Z","email":"351527421@qq.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"refactor(dashboard): 重构侧边栏布局并提取公共样式\n\n1.  为 outbox  worker 添加批处理失败日志捕获与单元测试\n2.  重构 dashboard 侧边栏样式为 scss module，拆分全局样式到独立文件\n3.  清理 globals.css 冗余代码，统一引入设计token与基础样式\n4.  修复 freeswitch acl 配置重复条目问题","tree":{"sha":"3a66f901c428c83f39fc41489ad71243df88b6eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/3a66f901c428c83f39fc41489ad71243df88b6eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/commits/47d24703c1cc18081cd89f63848c9163e2a9f8bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/47d24703c1cc18081cd89f63848c9163e2a9f8bf","node_id":"C_kwDOTPe6zNoAKDQ3ZDI0NzAzYzFjYzE4MDgxY2Q4OWY2Mzg0OGM5MTYzZTJhOWY4YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commit/986a4a2be69e8919d53fd694b631dbc0c174199d","sha":"986a4a2be69e8919d53fd694b631dbc0c174199d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/986a4a2be69e8919d53fd694b631dbc0c174199d"}],"sha":"47d24703c1cc18081cd89f63848c9163e2a9f8bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/47d24703c1cc18081cd89f63848c9163e2a9f8bf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/commits/986a4a2be69e8919d53fd694b631dbc0c174199d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T11:44:31Z","email":"351527421@qq.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T11:44:31Z","email":"351527421@qq.com","name":"TheSoulOfCommunism"},"message":"refactor: 统一项目样式使用CSS Module，替换硬编码类名\n\n- 将所有全局/遗留硬编码类名替换为对应SCSS Module的类\n- 重构流程构建器的节点样式映射，使用统一的accent类管理\n- 提取并重构任务流程模板卡片组件，复用代码\n- 修复freeswitch ACL配置重复条目问题\n- 新增大量业务组件和页面的SCSS Module样式","tree":{"sha":"e7d7153a0c9631d3b178401e2a7b15a79098fbd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoli-byte/ai-call/git/trees/e7d7153a0c9631d3b178401e2a7b15a79098fbd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos