bio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obed-Ababio/sankofa-ehr/commits/d6ab240eb41a503239d97e78ff7fdbc46254686c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:11:48Z","email":"ababioobed98@gmail.com","name":"Obed Ababio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:11:48Z","email":"ababioobed98@gmail.com","name":"Obed Ababio"},"message":"fix(queues): disable visit queue numbers — front desk hit 403 on check-in\n\nLive role-based workflow testing: generating the queue number saves the\nvisit, whose validator lists encounters — requiring Get Encounters, a\nprivilege Front Desk deliberately lacks (clinical-data exclusion, Test\nGate 1). The queue entry itself needs no such privilege, so queue\nnumbers are off (visitQueueNumberAttributeUuid: null) rather than\nweakening the boundary. create-dev-users.sh now also creates Provider\nrecords for admin and clinician — the drug-order workspace crashes for\nany prescriber without one.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UYShKeRjPgU5eCMCQ6FMYP","tree":{"sha":"7ec4d1559e4cb2e930200ce7c865417d93f42e56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obed-Ababio/sankofa-ehr/git/trees/7ec4d1559e4cb2e930200ce7c865417d93f42e56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obed-Ababio/sankofa-ehr/git/commits/d6ab240eb41a503239d97e78ff7fdbc46254686c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43188128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/followers","foll