ormulary. 16 unmapped BP/BPC galenicals flagged for clinician\nreview in docs/clinical/ghana-formulary.md.\n\ne2e: formulary spec (REST count + staples + order basket search); suite\nmade deterministic (workers=1, queue-entry cleanup helper, poll after UI\nsaves, queue fields filled at visit start). Admin gets a self-provisioned\nprovider record — the drug-order workspace crashes without one.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UYShKeRjPgU5eCMCQ6FMYP","tree":{"sha":"1c517e29f0f213829343545972cc9ae6c9442495","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obed-Ababio/sankofa-ehr/git/trees/1c517e29f0f213829343545972cc9ae6c9442495"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obed-Ababio/sankofa-ehr/git/commits/10176daca02a4ec5c90cb34334b99d86ddac20c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43188128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Obed-Ababio","id":43188128,"login":"Obed-Ababio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMTg4MTI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obed-Ababio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Obed-Ababio/sankofa-ehr/commit/10176daca02a4ec5c90cb34334b99d86ddac20c3","node_id":"C_kwDOTPn6fdoAKDEwMTc2ZGFjYTAyYTRlYzVjOTB