l":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28607748?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FullStackChef","id":28607748,"login":"FullStackChef","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjA3NzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/cdc1e5b54ad2036ec7f1481cab1a936fa555e30e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T21:56:04Z","email":"brett@fieldstate.io","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T21:56:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(cost)!: migrate the cost family onto @workspec/schema-core + .workspec/ (U3, #85) (#98)\n\nBREAKING: unifies the cost family on the canonical artifact format. Every cost\nartifact now lives at `.workspec/<dir>/<slug>.yaml` (inventories/spends/\nattributions/tagplans), the envelope is built with schema-core''s `defineArtifact`\n(`metadata: {slug?}` only), identity is the filename slug, and the old\n`metadata.id` is dropped. The old `metadata.name` moves to `spec.name?`.\n\n- cost-schema: `defineArtifact(Kind, spec)` for Inventory/Spend/Attribution/\n  TagPlan; `TYPE_DIRECTORIES`/`typeDirectoryFor`; base constants + `Slug` +\n  JSON-schema gen from schema-core; the cross-field `.superRefine`s chain onto\n  the envelope (still enforced); byte-stable serializers preserved (determinism +\n  escaping verified under hostile input); the suffix/glob/`is*File` discovery\n  machinery retired. zod 3→4. Internal ids (resource/rule/`resourceId`) untouched.\n- cost-studio: `fs-repository` rewritten to the `.workspec/` directory-walk\n  (mirroring trace-studio) — slug identity, path-contained reads; CLI `stocktake`/\n  `plan` write to `.workspec/<dir>/<slug>.yaml`; `--name` now validated as a Slug.\n- cost-provider / -azure / -engine: `metadata.id`/`name` → `slug`/`spec.name`;\n  the azure \"derived id\" construction removed (identity is the filename slug now).\n- cost-ui, apps/mf-host cost seed, `examples/fieldstate-azure-costs`, and the\n  .NET aspire cost fixture reshaped to the new envelope. apps/site is left on the\n  published registry pins (decoupled) until republish.\n\nAll six packages bumped to 0.1.0-alpha.6 (lockstep). Whole workspace green — root\ntypecheck/build/test + `dotnet test` (real-CLI cost test) all pass. Opus-reviewed:\nserializer determinism, metadata→spec + id→slug completeness, loader no-data-loss,\nand byte-identical JSON-schema drift all confirmed; only non-blocking nits (one\ntracked as follow-up). The migration install was kept minimal-churn so unrelated\npackages'' jest-dom type resolution wasn''t perturbed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8714801e4359a373065125ced195a9d78107e39d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/8714801e4359a373065125ced195a9d78107e39d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/cdc1e5b54ad2036ec7f1481cab1a936fa555e30e","verification":{"payload":"tree 8714801e4359a373065125ced195a9d78107e39d\nparent cff2380195da5362a1b3bec7118e0a4829e1d997\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784498164 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784498164 +1200\n\nfeat(co