npackages'' jest-dom type resolution wasn''t perturbed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXUf0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsKwQAE5ZNQiswIPLvfRI/aT2s54j\nw/Ynaenj6Z7TFfUMsM1cb+jrQt623QcF6H6+b8IQQbGtPg1sQ71Sor/nW9qg6Hcw\nWoxETLk4rvYos5ru/v9jUgW/B018i9GDzIwEu1LzcOyVfWuh7O1g2XkaZsKfszlh\neWVox2UtERJb4hiohhwYF0fPlmagxKb5vbfAB0LIt5O5puyXXvNEToMMAXVMPcqE\nhvje4A1IvTX0N10wCsDWa8E/Kd7htkG05AXQb6aKDlbC2ai2WYktgn85EjGfZpET\n2TI0aZYaTJboCuHCv6sOi5e5WNstQDuNQWeZL+ZFWtUBRVse4ZNIqZSfAeScevlZ\nbWIpyqBHemNkPFNHilQgnnxYInIrtxmMu01eytLXCEXak3qzjda7UbpTYnkaBolX\nC6B/ydfvIpDN90VPqK0jiHsr3vx1VvcFt2ZvNXti/cppqOJimIpOxaO1poa+DUjy\npJUevgzuMEwflHoA0GBpuHlHlzJ6ZpDfilP59twy8+lOqx2Q0gp5e768OGIFb0tv\nkt4p05qdN9jG1jdcyvrZOO0UEXuIk6LSnt3U8hTAVT9jcPTfTW+dpLUH4nJP/wdi\nbNlq1ym8iegP0k9cSS5z7AXxH6IsYc+1/CNrrq056F4SFPFQjNfXvjl73q3Pxmo+\nOKuJdKALkz5kRekjwoi/\n=2XPP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-19T21:56:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commit/cdc1e5b54ad2036ec7f1481cab1a936fa555e30e","node_id":"C_kwDOTPvB8toAKGNkYzFlNWI1NGFkMjAzNmVjN2YxNDgxY2FiMWE5MzZmYTU1NWUzMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commit/cff2380195da5362a1b3bec7118e0a4829e1d997","sha":"cff2380195da5362a1b3bec7118e0a4829e1d997","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/cff2380195da5362a1b3bec7118e0a4829e1d997"}],"sha":"cdc1e5b54ad2036ec7f1481cab1a936fa555e30e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/cdc1e5b54ad2036ec7f1481cab1a936fa555e30e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28607748?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FullStackChef","id":28607748,"login":"FullStackChef","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjA3NzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/cff2380195da5362a1b3bec7118e0a4829e1d997/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T10:22:50Z","email":"brett@fieldstate.io","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T10:22:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(traceability): Run review view — failures foregrounded (T7, #75) (#97)\n\nEnables the last disabled tab and renders the latest run with failures\nforegrounded (spec §5). Completes #75 alongside the merged junit emitter, and\nmakes all four Traceability Workbench views live (Requirements · Matrix ·\nFeature detail · Run review).\n\n- `RunReviewView` — the run-metadata header (id · ts · sha? · ci? · emitter +\n  the repo tally), then scenario sections in fixed order: Failures first and\n  most prominent, then Skipped, then Unproven, then a collapsed Passing list.\n  Each row shows the scenario + its \"Feature › Rule\" context + evidence, reusing\n  the shared proof pills/colors. A view-layer projection over `model.scenarios`\n  — never re-derives the meters.\n- Explicit states: no run ingested → \"no evidence yet\"; all-passing → a positive\n  \"nothing to foreground\" banner (not three empty sections). Latest-run-only\n  (spec §9.4) — no fabricated history.\n- Exposed as an MF remote; zero local design tokens. A dev-only `dev-model.ts`\n  superset seeds the story (fail+skip+unproven+pass) without perturbing the\n  shared fixture. 83 tests green.\n\nAdversarially reviewed: the failures-foregrounded ordering, zero-tokens,\nrender-not-rederive, the explicit states, the metadata header (sha/ci gated),\nand latest-only all confirmed. Three low/cosmetic notes tracked as follow-up.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e23b8dc053936a804e6fed5a41a8ef981d1c61ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/e23b8dc053936a804e6fed5a41a8ef981d1c61ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/cff2380195da5362a1b3bec7118e0a4829e1d997","verification":{"payload":"tree e23b8dc053936a804e6fed5a41a8ef981d1c61ed\nparent 08b82773de447cd10e184051bb209979682335a3\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784456570 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784456570 +1200\n\nfeat(traceability): Run review view — failures foregrounded (T7, #75) (#97)\n\nEnables the last disabled tab and renders the latest run with failures\nforegrounded (spec §5). Completes #75 alongside the merged junit emitter, and\nmakes all four Traceability Workbench views live (Requirements · Matrix ·\nFeature detail · Run review).\n\n- `RunReviewView` — the run-metadata header (id · ts · sha? · ci? · emitter +\n  the repo tally), then scenario sections in fixed order: Failures first and\n  most prominent, then Skipped, then Unproven, then a collapsed Passing list.\n  Each row shows the scenario + its \"Feature › Rule\" context + evidence, reusing\n  the shared proof pills/colors. A view-layer projection over `model.scenarios`\n  — never re-derives the meters.\n- Explicit states: no run ingested → \"no evidence yet\"; all-passing → a positive\n  \"nothing to foreground\" banner (not three empty sections). Latest-run-only\n  (spec §9.4) — no fabricated history.\n- Exposed as an MF remote; zero local design tokens. A dev-only `dev-model.ts`\n  superset seeds the story (fail+skip+unproven+pass) without perturbing the\n  shared fixture. 83 tests green.\n\nAdversarially reviewed: the failures-foregrounded ordering, zero-tokens,\nrender-not-rederive, the explicit states, the metadata header (sha/ci gated),\nand latest-only all confirmed. Three low/cosmetic notes tracked as follow-up.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXKV6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsaQQAFsLDroIDIyS0UeBQD5ap5mz\noazNANNNqlWUiWkoO51aFfAI74YyC+oB3Afy2J55aYM5cSaPkwa1ucU9FRMocqB2\npHT4EVphcVVS2kyjpKnOH8s5Bx4v5NH21+ELdTPfZN1bj0VybWIzawu5VpikD4An\nKbEkZXXZgij5gmWEaG+uzgyPK8PEAFtdqFKTGKQVHU2oeuqQiCaFn1AQTHKWZ6QK\nd1E2oIsQRoFoSepHphx9mN2Yl3JLnyKPZVwOa2Ded8QJEGTUxu1bg711I+UTw/Z0\nFP423pyNouFZQCXUMuyS628xUdxYhzNua+UtGSzOTa6wQia3UerOJWPhFSRRllIh\nJuNHBWqemkPzMjHs+ttCDPzVnCVMuX50LQsJUoRPFZX6uM28jZULs/ge3iQwXbtP\nsTcYXWU8mLgc+tnxLY2bg+eGLtHFWn6g95k9Me4lIaDfwek9qdn