hub.com/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commit/f7e567a4c6c4331af648514ed3af24bb1c5e68da","sha":"f7e567a4c6c4331af648514ed3af24bb1c5e68da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/f7e567a4c6c4331af648514ed3af24bb1c5e68da"}],"sha":"6b0171bbc5e3f64e777597c67d02c404ac541f4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/6b0171bbc5e3f64e777597c67d02c404ac541f4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28607748?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FullStackChef","id":28607748,"login":"FullStackChef","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjA3NzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/f7e567a4c6c4331af648514ed3af24bb1c5e68da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T23:14:05Z","email":"brett@fieldstate.io","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T23:14:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(traceability): @workspec/schema-core shared artifact primitives (U0, #82) (#87)\n\nFoundational package for the artifact-format unification. Holds the canonical\ncross-module primitives every schema family will build on:\n\n- `defineArtifact(kind, spec)` — the K8s-style envelope builder\n  (`apiVersion: workspec.io/v1alpha1` / `kind` literal / `metadata` / `spec`),\n  left non-`.strict()` to match the existing cost/decision envelopes.\n- Shared `Actor` kind (`spec: { name, description?, tags?, links? }`),\n  reconciling c4''s `title` → canonical `name` with `name` required.\n- `WORKSPEC_DIR` (`.workspec`) + `TYPE_DIRECTORIES` / `typeDirectoryFor`.\n- `links` field + cardinality, slug + slug-from-path helpers, path-ref pattern\n  — copied from c4-schema (not imported) so this package has zero `@workspec`\n  runtime deps; it is the base every family depends on.\n- JSON-Schema generation + byte-exact drift test; `actor.schema.json` served\n  from `https://schema.workspec.io/v1alpha1/`.\n\n`metadata` keys identity on `slug` (the canonical `.workspec/<kind>/<slug>.yaml`\nidentity), not the `id` cost/decision currently use — their adoption of this\nhelper is part of the U2/U3 migration to slug identity, by design.\n\nAdds `schema-core` to the front of the release publish array (ahead of the\nfamilies that will depend on it) and its generated `json-schema/` to\n`.prettierignore`. 53/53 tests green (incl. drift + Actor fixtures).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7486a88d2ff3fc7a9979021bf51a0ca06e44d20b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/7486a88d2ff3fc7a9979021bf51a0ca06e44d20b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/f7e567a4c6c4331af648514ed3af24bb1c5e68da","verification":{"payload":"tree 7486a88d2ff3fc7a9979021bf51a0ca06e44d20b\nparent 182288f718647dee7da1d42d2fd8a7bd3fa440fd\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784416445 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784416445 +1200\n\nfeat(traceability): @workspec/schema-core shared artifact primitives (U0, #82) (#87)\n\nFoundational package for the artifact-format unification. Holds the canonical\ncross-module primitives every schema family will build on:\n\n- `defineArtifact(kind, spec)` — the K8s-style envelope builder\n  (`apiVersion: workspec.io/v1alpha1` / `kind` literal / `metadata` / `spec`),\n  left non-`.strict()` to match the existing cost/decision envelopes.\n- Shared `Actor` kind (`spec: { name, description?, tags?, links? }`),\n  reconciling c4''s `title` → canonical `name` with `name` required.\n- `WORKSPEC_DIR` (`.workspec`) + `TYPE_DIRECTORIES` / `typeDirectoryFor`.\n- `links` field + cardinality, slug + slug-from-path helpers, path-ref pattern\n  — copied from c4-schema (not imported) so this package has zero `@workspec`\n  runtime deps; it is the base every family depends on.\n- JSON-Schema generation + byte-exact drift test; `actor.schema.json` served\n  from `https://schema.workspec.io/v1alpha1/`.\n\n`metadata` keys identity on `slug` (the canonical `.workspec/<kind>/<slug>.yaml`\nidentity), not the `id` cost/decision currently use — their adoption of this\nhelper is part of the U2/U3 migration to slug identity, by design.\n\nAdds `schema-core` to the front of the release publish array (ahead of the\nfamilies that will depend on it) and its generated `json-schema/` to\n`.prettierignore`. 53/53 tests green (incl. drift + Actor fixtures).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXAi9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8JwQABv8+kTfuhaO7dbneXcLnaOo\nUMbpckmmGRADcixwo3NBCygBBIXE4wHYS6uXwPwoqdXbZ7wsMn8Qw3q9r+Pv95Jc\nlbHWc/RuHXzt7sRU61r8HqL7cdgwM/mw5RMcoxIUvrzp/Njw9OFsiOe5A2S3bd18\nnqKBnAJkxN8kxBO0lIWkB0IlhFz7cn6EBtFdLpNw1iV0oGzK/0lV0WcPvlrQa74+\n+tMr8o2Qx9j2369OQbUIWzo6BDn9us0NSx+Yx2TmFe/qjmeEHBbgmhKvdIqjSIWx\nepvLM2BYiIz1vq/NraLZ1t9+DDrLoaIKgOKWi2sSpO0WIlruH5n4oIvAD9LM1onZ\ngf59DQQ62X7wEzVOoWECGTyo4IXQ0Z4ugmgv03XqNcBM4YjMRX1SfGOgQ/52H80g\nJgKGcWqWEKbO1momyeQqbQvSinEnd5hroAi24BY4aO907Vn3CsZ3KWeElAZ9zRfo\nmjm+0ySSBYqGFFqeANkwj0Ia/JypXORoNlKg/o2uI3uf6yO9Gy34IbVMqGW6w3h1\nPTT67tVx0xP1z