//api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FullStackChef","id":28607748,"login":"FullStackChef","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjA3NzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/182288f718647dee7da1d42d2fd8a7bd3fa440fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T12:36:36Z","email":"brett@fieldstate.io","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T12:36:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(traceability): validated v0 spec — Option B, four-kind model (#81)\n\nReplaces the draft spec with the validated v0: Option B confirmed (all artifact\nkinds file-native/open-source), the full four-kind model inline (actor, feature,\nuser-requirement, system-requirement + ingested evidence), and two corrections\nfrom review:\n- the file IS the scenario (one Gherkin scenario per system-requirement file,\n  no nested scenarios[]),\n- slug = scenario name = identity (no opaque/author-assigned ids).\nAdds the derivation table (incl. orphan userReq — the key finding Option B\nenables) and the intra-tree-fails / cross-layer-inert ref resolution rule.\n\nThis is the shape T1 (req-schema) freezes. Supersedes the scope-open-questions\ndoc (#80, closed — Option B).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63b8ad2024dd7c2de3daba739ab27c4384dc088f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/63b8ad2024dd7c2de3daba739ab27c4384dc088f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/182288f718647dee7da1d42d2fd8a7bd3fa440fd","verification":{"payload":"tree 63b8ad2024dd7c2de3daba739ab27c4384dc088f\nparent f6f47f5fdfc208d8fc589de3ff45942edfb3c35b\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784378196 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784378196 +1200\n\ndocs(traceability): validated v0 spec — Option B, four-kind model (#81)\n\nReplaces the draft spec with the validated v0: Option B confirmed (all artifact\nkinds file-native/open-source), the full four-kind model inline (actor, feature,\nuser-requirement, system-requirement + ingested evidence), and two corrections\nfrom review:\n- the file IS the scenario (one Gherkin scenario per system-requirement file,\n  no nested scenarios[]),\n- slug = scenario name = identity (no opaque/author-assigned ids).\nAdds the derivation table (incl. orphan userReq — the key finding Option B\nenables) and the intra-tree-fails / cross-layer-inert ref resolution rule.\n\nThis is the shape T1 (req-schema) freezes. Supersedes the scope-open-questions\ndoc (#80, closed — Option B).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW3NUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/AkQABEZ6h+Af7/8KIn2qe+uA7dW\n9mNenej0vEXllvb7l0NLixbjSttalGoNTIJqUh0bg6CJ1y9d2WfTU0Pm6t8chxQc\n7Fbn3kh1jjWCx3ara98GqIk+pJfdRekDbDUPAy/5CtX+Z8CjI4nSp91XgZ4YlixF\n3txGnG3IjCGO2MTpg6NJes/Gp3/mu7pbqQP3DMsgCoS7BtQI3g6oZHaCTUK2au04\nUXzoSnWk8W+abH9470FB5icTUPnawkg5j/t1tMOhFzSOwGobTi6GPjSxm/hinyiG\ncP2qbTrEMoEGYgN6N0trN+325yrTFfvbTcUfFwzNg3lfguw2y1yrvgGon3s1uVf1\nKMvTjAJGuWkAdeFGnZVnu9W7/F1z6GiAMtj/sLD0B6qun2XttgztYiwRaBeF1E5s\nW1+ZcgdEBl30jtoABQ86DnBef7ggK69XAVaRB1jIjn65YNog9oAVjbH9hl2zRzm2\ndlS9Oes7mefDXX/1WUkpH6bSTOqLBXLNdmpEu