/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FullStackChef","id":28607748,"login":"FullStackChef","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjA3NzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/f6f47f5fdfc208d8fc589de3ff45942edfb3c35b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T04:09:50Z","email":"brett@fieldstate.io","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T04:09:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(traceability): bootstrap five package skeletons (T0, #68) (#79)\n\nBootstraps the Traceability Workbench module (docs/traceability/spec.md §7):\nfive empty-but-buildable package skeletons, each mirroring its cost-* sibling —\nreq-schema, trace-model, trace-emitters, trace-ui, trace-studio (bin:\nworkspec-trace). No feature logic; schemas/engine/emitters/views/CLI land in\nT1–T8.\n\nrelease.yml is intentionally NOT wired yet — deferred to T8 (go-live) so a\nmid-build tag can never publish empty skeletons. pnpm workspace globs\npackages/* so no workspace edit is needed. Versions 0.1.0-alpha.5 (match the\nfamily). Adversarially reviewed: all gates (install/build/typecheck/test/lint)\ngreen, release.yml untouched, LICENSE byte-identical.\n\nCloses #68\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ec8c741dfeac9c1d6124b8a4c5e4656ecdc1af0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/8ec8c741dfeac9c1d6124b8a4c5e4656ecdc1af0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/f6f47f5fdfc208d8fc589de3ff45942edfb3c35b","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ec8c741dfeac9c1d6124b8a4c5e4656ecdc1af0\nparent 97855957ee101542e152b4b5988b13b0646f92da\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784347790 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784347790 +1200\n\nfeat(traceability): bootstrap five package skeletons (T0, #68) (#79)\n\nBootstraps the Traceability Workbench module (docs/traceability/spec.md §7):\nfive empty-but-buildable package skeletons, each mirroring its cost-* sibling —\nreq-schema, trace-model, trace-emitters, trace-ui, trace-studio (bin:\nworkspec-trace). No feature logic; schemas/engine/emitters/views/CLI land in\nT1–T8.\n\nrelease.yml is intentionally NOT wired yet — deferred to T8 (go-live) so a\nmid-build tag can never publish empty skeletons. pnpm workspace globs\npackages/* so no workspace edit is needed. Versions 0.1.0-alpha.5 (match the\nfamily). Adversarially reviewed: all gates (install/build/typecheck/test/lint)\ngreen, release.yml untouched, LICENSE byte-identical.\n\nCloses #68\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWvyOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANL0QACPqEZ0JcB8n3j+1thMqzgst\nTMwpzYx66t1x+zYLgOZahqxsxK07VunDW60OX9sIk4o/U32Gi4lEsBVRmpSP026c\n/iG+m3/21BXJHvWuXcQMC/7TpO229p5BHSTTCe6zKN0zk1he5MhjVr4Hi5ug0Bp9\nm+Auwct/tx5hVsS2sNfQXk1aicCETnkmp1ep24sjOoFuxdyrw4UjdIuYiiXCrvwx\n7S7mJtLfaOyv3FnL5Ao0DaSRq34mH1koxj/WpJUWCNUEragl1IKrUS7HkbGeWZ5m\npuWKZrcCTK/RP9aQ2Yy4UxmOkpdjO0NBjat3wrC74sGnn1+Nly+MP28rzrD7iRgo\nq98YX1Kt+pjxCxS0Troh9R4d7iwyRgZs9sqKLnpwlEpbqhcwmAd0cz7agOq8zGzl\nLZ0KiSiXUWtbBfpB7dpVW62+ye+wqTvOzwOKT+yrP3y2Mr2SUGhQ3/qRqKvyBwS4\nMzbysK1oO