thub.com/users/FullStackChef/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FullStackChef","id":28607748,"login":"FullStackChef","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjA3NzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/97855957ee101542e152b4b5988b13b0646f92da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T23:17:25Z","email":"brett@fieldstate.io","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T23:17:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(traceability): commit the v0 spec + design handoff (#67)\n\nAdds the Traceability Workbench v0 spec (docs/traceability/spec.md) and the\nauthoritative Claude Design handoff (docs/design/Traceability Workbench.dc.html,\npulled via the Design MCP) as the visual source of record for implementers.\nThe design export is byte-authoritative — added docs/design to .prettierignore\nso it is never reformatted.\n\nThis module is the test surface (proving requirements are met via emit/ingest\nevidence + an RTM), not the superseded link-graph lens draft.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9444b5eb4184e7f1245ee4281ea0a1f4c5dc66a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/9444b5