mitter":{"date":"2026-07-17T11:56:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(site): consume published alpha.5 packages; retire cost workspace exception (#65)\n\nNow that the whole family is published at 0.1.0-alpha.5, point apps/site at the\nregistry for everything:\n- Bump decision-* (alpha.1) and c4-* (alpha.2) pins to 0.1.0-alpha.5.\n- Move @workspec/cost-schema/-engine/-ui out of devDependencies (workspace:*)\n  into dependencies at 0.1.0-alpha.5, retiring the temporary cost workspace\n  exception (drift-log entry 1) exactly as PR #27 retired the c4 one.\n- Remove the exception''s machinery: the _LOUD_NOTICE block, the tsconfig.json\n  project references, and the vite/package.json exception comments.\n- Resolve docs/cost/drift-log.md entry 1 (Resolved 2026-07-17).\n\nThe site now builds against the PUBLISHED @workspec/* packages for all three\nfamilies — which also confirms the alpha.5 cost family is consumable from the\nregistry (unlike the stale alpha.0). Verified: site typecheck + test (41) +\nbuild green; cost resolves from registry, no workspace: links remain.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"89dd1341cbf214e56a8d280142ac273e8529d596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/89dd1341cbf214e56a8d280142ac273e8529d596"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/d7607076786b1a8adc6122625d3973e384386f86","verification":{"payload":"tree 89dd1341cbf214e56a8d280142ac273e8529d596\nparent 09e022e49702541b276cf1c3950a0f2f795c7d25\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784289380 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784289380 +1200\n\nchore(site): consume published alpha.5 packages; retire cost workspace exception (#65)\n\nNow that the whole family is published at 0.1.0-alpha.5, point apps/site at the\nregistry for everything:\n- Bump decision-* (alpha.1) and c4-* (alpha.2) pins to 0.1.0-alpha.5.\n- Move @workspec/cost-schema/-engine/-ui out of devDependencies (workspace:*)\n  into dependencies at 0.1.0-alpha.5, retiring the temporary cost workspace\n  exception (drift-log entry 1) exactly as PR #27 retired the c4 one.\n- Remove the exception''s machinery: the _LOUD_NOTICE block, the tsconfig.json\n  project references, and the vite/package.json exception comments.\n- Resolve docs/cost/drift-log.md entry 1 (Resolved 2026-07-17).\n\nThe site now builds against the PUBLISHED @workspec/* packages for all three\nfamilies — which also confirms the alpha.5 cost family is consumable from the\nregistry (unlike the stale alpha.0). Verified: site typecheck + test (41) +\nbuild green; cost resolves from registry, no workspace: links remain.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWhhkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMdEQABLA3MfI91VTPN9vOEv41bOM\nQyEPvniKaMzeThpAIlH8V73Ffn0nY37ePRbbDb/kMF5kkUkvOMcUYixPVv89k7+T\n983JO7jFp696fU75aJn/AkQdig47yLAvbc/Cu02hNnBbzbg5ZLRY3HFo/SHeF3Nd\nwA9TFVA7X3O5upFV5BhEpHY38Iz6YrEMW8pY32g8Jtg0OrDsgyjgSpV9ugWORLg7\nqSPapO8zufWGcNl0EER1nwdB1/GbCxdYbyjy9/4IeV6nfZxU+5t4zWsUel5Cw9Xx\nlxg+5b60F+43QUwDA6rSCUUUhWwvW+ctMH+XB3cW1CaIEmyDWsgcZohaHrl65fsZ\nJrHxe4mwetSyRtP0H8C4C6fAZPW458iZl7TR30238q7NizQl3sHs9E3QVUbtlppO\nvZgOMMZHBKSEksfRooVq2X+Wcd3z4/TBDVUE4yOLGD/SxcyBfo0Dx1KnNlHriXER\noikUVx1+sNPEz92fWj+Ahj/uZ6CvGZm4havlNdtp5GZf2m2Ww4dxCuJau5btwOHe\nOOTOvrnzHy+8sfYX34q6gcf3AK0Q9KlPASnAUhH4B0qbjoKRa9cat+Vv+jR0xMNA\naDdZM6vktox1ZDVJ+Ja4FrpChjwnBcUmvDR4QwYYZbyPKWhTQUsQgRDgQDkNIYhA\n4TBz211roWyPsV2lwqUN\n=6aCL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T11:56:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a