m/users/FullStackChef/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FullStackChef","id":28607748,"login":"FullStackChef","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjA3NzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/73c328289de22a2ccd1673455f6618eac9a42327/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T20:59:37Z","email":"brett@fieldstate.io","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T20:59:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(releasing): match the real OIDC release flow + document first-publish bootstrap (#63)\n\nRELEASING.md described an NPM_TOKEN secret + ''pnpm -r publish'', but release.yml\nuses npm trusted publishing (OIDC, no token) + per-package ''pnpm pack → npm\npublish''. Rewrite the npm sections to match, cover all three families\n(decision/c4/cost, not just the four decision packages), and add a\n''First publish of a new package'' section for the trusted-publishing bootstrap\n(OIDC can''t create a new package name; the first publish must be a manual\ntoken-auth publish, then register the trusted publisher) — the exact failure\nthe cost family hit. Stress ''always rebuild before packing'' (dist/ is gitignored).\nNuGet section kept (already accurate) with a note that new IDs may need the same\nfirst-push bootstrap.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd5f52c30b9fc5d4ca33043ddae02ee63107b496","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/cd5f52c30b9fc5d4ca33043ddae02ee63107b496"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/73c328289de22a2ccd1673455f6618eac9a42327","verification":{"payload":"tree cd5f52c30b9fc5d4ca33043ddae02ee63107b496\nparent 60ea5453ec8cafc645564b013d3e99887e7bf7ae\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784062777 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784062777 +1200\n\ndocs(releasing): match the real OIDC release flow + document first-publish bootstrap (#63)\n\nRELEASING.md described an NPM_TOKEN secret + ''pnpm -r publish'', but release.yml\nuses npm trusted publishing (OIDC, no token) + per-package ''pnpm pack → npm\npublish''. Rewrite the npm sections to match, cover all three families\n(decision/c4/cost, not just the four decision packages), and add a\n''First publish of a new package'' section for the trusted-publishing bootstrap\n(OIDC can''t create a new package name; the first publish must be a manual\ntoken-auth publish, then register the trusted publisher) — the exact failure\nthe cost family hit. Stress ''always rebuild before packing'' (dist/ is gitignored).\nNuGet section kept (already accurate) with a note that new IDs may need the same\nfirst-push bootstrap.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVqM5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAno0QALHjboBtfzSxPHXxdaCel3MI\nDVHkwbuikLdBSFc9FjgGcHVgfHL24pUJRKLUBJACs1K++Lxyo52EHG8v4FufttG1\nSng/XFbMWG99Jt4ORE+xiufTDaSss3TIouAXOeIvUHSfy+fnClEe9xamBUyyR8P6\nb5UnlZbw5SbRkvQ7F6k8yzeqHvxtCX+jqwEjzxG5vBpnCQ/Vrq7R44m5FwwsblM7\nWjmEH5MqlxfEasoeowq9jJH3kVbqwusk5fVdJad1u+Ib9oI2kl3EeZXSMZRoQrff\nSYcr3ypejPwBiYhm4YKYeKU/qnZh8VTfLDjpuUvzHr5ObGpKPF4RbqvQN0qSfNXH\nBnQd+WISggMjJ1J+ZLPlT6jM4Vr1yXzfbYYpt/XwfrSgZpFlAh0+8mw/oWoO2W3W\nOMQqHhNH8vCgUpqQowtiG20Y+mex5JdJJqucKm7JBcEEjLsR3fkdTZgXYuSB2aK1\nx5h1myZhOFBX+yDd0TdfPbmbcJ3iYzqToFOqkjWEiX/gsKF3Qhv8ppfTmFY8sRfs\nM7YjA0n7ncdfGxhelZgYh7qaXEBlUj8yhxBri