ullStackChef/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FullStackChef","id":28607748,"login":"FullStackChef","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjA3NzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/60ea5453ec8cafc645564b013d3e99887e7bf7ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T20:56:31Z","email":"brett@fieldstate.io","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T20:56:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(cost): bump the cost family to 0.1.0-alpha.1 for a clean republish (#62)\n\nThe first manual cost publish (0.1.0-alpha.0) packed a stale dist and shipped\nwithout current public API (createMemoryRepository, CostApp, attribute, …),\nleaving those six packages broken on npm. Bump all six to 0.1.0-alpha.1 so a\nrelease tag republishes them via the CI workflow (fresh pnpm -r build → pack →\nOIDC publish, now that cost trusted publishers are registered).\n\nVerified locally that a fresh build + pnpm pack of all six produces tarballs\nat 0.1.0-alpha.1 with the previously-missing exports present and @workspec/*\ndeps rewritten to ^0.1.0-alpha.1 (no workspace: leaks).\n\nFollow-up after the tag publishes: flip apps/site''s cost-* pins from workspace:*\nto 0.1.0-alpha.1 (deferred half of #59).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58646c0c553d761d7579e86dc0354d7d008dcf2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/58646c0c553d761d7579e86dc0354d7d008dcf2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/60ea5453ec8cafc645564b013d3e99887e7bf7ae","verification":{"payload":"tree 58646c0c553d761d7579e86dc0354d7d008dcf2d\nparent 5575ca0fbc4274b3597995a54c470df7c415340b\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784062591 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784062591 +1200\n\nchore(cost): bump the cost family to 0.1.0-alpha.1 for a clean republish (#62)\n\nThe first manual cost publish (0.1.0-alpha.0) packed a stale dist and shipped\nwithout current public API (createMemoryRepository, CostApp, attribute, …),\nleaving those six packages broken on npm. Bump all six to 0.1.0-alpha.1 so a\nrelease tag republishes them via the CI workflow (fresh pnpm -r build → pack →\nOIDC publish, now that cost trusted publishers are registered).\n\nVerified locally that a fresh build + pnpm pack of all six produces tarballs\nat 0.1.0-alpha.1 with the previously-missing exports present and @workspec/*\ndeps rewritten to ^0.1.0-alpha.1 (no workspace: leaks).\n\nFollow-up after the tag publishes: flip apps/site''s cost-* pins from workspace:*\nto 0.1.0-alpha.1 (deferred half of #59).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVqJ/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABFEQAExLvUuCG6CisHABHDRelsdG\nyf3yB0W6nuoR3L6Gdka8TmQpGkNJ2S/5xs+soVuoxGaALPbtoa2Fc+9FW7M33Ipw\nai+zULmEENI/Qyp1T8NXt3cmqqxDWdtQFFXldgGXOGDkyQVCu0Fl14x45RoeOvLz\nrMiIL0nwoHEZgLoMXZi49cJwJo+qzR2/l8YG7lzrFHidK8gbx7QlfRznqbeYSKrN\n2luFHjRx8TJiuRE4szr3zjuPq078GUxCEm6WX5Zj2KUywM3Ze+GHSI2/vPE1Aeip\ncDHGcZTLryYgxacYJtg3udw28tEFaJgZacNgzZ+5n5YU9UCoADB6xPeYXsGg1WWj\nDNIk/T/HmcAASyDsyvQ95dTNCjoPw3Rwd0rO9Hfm3I4IOIrlXIkerwSFH+I2xiga\nJ932teW8cNoaqEBkIys978DQ0Roez56MJiWRRpevBBDmzxw8StqzKV9OvDTIO08