tps://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FullStackChef","id":28607748,"login":"FullStackChef","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjA3NzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/5575ca0fbc4274b3597995a54c470df7c415340b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T20:34:00Z","email":"brett@fieldstate.io","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T20:34:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(studio): stop unclassified 500s leaking the absolute served path (#61)\n\n* fix(studio): stop unclassified 500s leaking the absolute served path\n\nAll three Studio servers echoed the raw error message in their unclassified 500\nfallback (res.status(500).json({ error: (error as Error).message })), leaking\nthe absolute served-root path for fs errors like EISDIR (a ref resolving to a\ndirectory), ENAMETOOLONG, EACCES. Add a sendInternalError helper that returns a\ngeneric { error: ''internal error'' } to the client while logging the real error\n(and ref) server-side, and route every unclassified 500 through it in\ndecision-studio, cost-studio, and c4-studio. Typed 400/404/422 responses are\nunchanged. Surfaced during the #52 Opus review; c4-studio had the identical\npattern and is fixed here too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(studio): keep client ref out of the console.error format string\n\nCodeQL flagged the new sendInternalError logging as a tainted format string\n(high): the client-supplied ref was interpolated into console.error''s format\nargument in all three servers (log injection, CWE-117). Pass ref as a separate\nconsole.error argument with a static format string instead — server-side\nlogging is preserved, no user input reaches the format string.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f376caec3b2971c5911caed927d9fb86da9f2db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/0f376caec3b2971c5911caed927d9fb86da9f2db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/5575ca0fbc4274b3597995a54c470df7c415340b","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f376caec3b2971c5911caed927d9fb86da9f2db\nparent b312b9b11c8402efdfb8a2953f5cf01ef280c3a9\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784061240 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784061240 +1200\n\nfix(studio): stop unclassified 500s leaking the absolute served path (#61)\n\n* fix(studio): stop unclassified 500s leaking the absolute served path\n\nAll three Studio servers echoed the raw error message in their unclassified 500\nfallback (res.status(500).json({ error: (error as Error).message })), leaking\nthe absolute served-root path for fs errors like EISDIR (a ref resolving to a\ndirectory), ENAMETOOLONG, EACCES. Add a sendInternalError helper that returns a\ngeneric { error: ''internal error'' } to the client while logging the real error\n(and ref) server-side, and route every unclassified 500 through it in\ndecision-studio, cost-studio, and c4-studio. Typed 400/404/422 responses are\nunchanged. Surfaced during the #52 Opus review; c4-studio had the identical\npattern and is fixed here too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(studio): keep client ref out of the console.error format string\n\nCodeQL flagged the new sendInternalError logging as a tainted format string\n(high): the client-supplied ref was interpolated into console.error''s format\nargument in all three servers (log injection, CWE-117). Pass ref as a separate\nconsole.error argument with a static format string instead — server-side\nlogging is preserved, no user input reaches the format string.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVp04CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACTAQAK2KfcYkP3CMgOXAxvISsA8J\nz8WXdCQqGB+Ol3pkLKjyPwoPK88a/uZ4yNnzx08INp0NicoazN87Jvgnc+ZuUlxf\nXb97USNLQEgMMQ+6BFXdxCsoPsjDPAQRwSyU0uDiumpD3PjN6vL3BHNWqC4pENrS\n7NK9yudSOoIelQ2xC6Db+kK0WGYiA98wXQKwg9Tu6m/rziLTRv2nK+jKNfKlbMcr\nx1TD7QrAi8av/zmFShZ6yS6OyHY+2oJe6j9nCHOT56ni8uL4YgibjRRiHptmDKv/\nwU//KjPVfeHOJ8FfqyJCQ26hAHZygTUIFbv2q0U0C4l5kByOKXkRIt3AGbBig0ye\niVainAM2iENsA5hvilfGo7l6Ij1/4tnczDG5+6rtooQIREjLnvHdv5GTlZxAh71b\nYg/8Xa0ZiNOnEQOKImZdm+iAraPH1lD3k+wsUWS8+Wz1C4I4xKbAQthw1oXv6o3x\nB6xnC8rYgnUnnlsee/Rj5Anh3lCyH1VjgsyycQCI/S7/RbhN/34rsvY8L5XYw836\ny9mAiAB0ERn7aews154uL2vNXQlSXecujMOE/P8xXz2BTmaUooTJDSFP/EKYdwS0\nHnIfAPpqparHh9QZKE2k1U1HD22Y8L7uOuOGQDjvGqNo2i4p12RC9J0JWVX0MmrK\nnj1lQJhEwmSl/VkqKj3v\n=o7Qv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-14T20:34:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://git