d{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FullStackChef","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/b312b9b11c8402efdfb8a2953f5cf01ef280c3a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T20:22:12Z","email":"brett@fieldstate.io","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T20:22:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(cost-provider-azure): bound per-subscription spend fan-out (#51 follow-up) (#60)\n\nspend.ts fanned out per-subscription Cost Management queries with an unbounded\nPromise.all, amplifying 429 throttling under many subscriptions. Add a\ndependency-free order-preserving mapWithConcurrency pool (default cap 4,\noverridable via FetchSpendOptions.maxConcurrency) and route the fan-out through\nit. Reject-on-first-failure and merged/sorted output are preserved; a positive\noversized/Infinity limit runs unbounded, NaN/<=0 clamp to serial.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"169a59e0a1ee814860fd92cc4643ce099d5f7e60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/169a59e0a1ee814860fd92cc4643ce099d5f7e60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/b312b9b11c8402efdfb8a2953f5cf01ef280c3a9","verification":{"payload":"tree 169a59e0a1ee814860fd92cc4643ce099d5f7e60\nparent 89d5c40874b99fbd55ea1d3246f9c0778053735d\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784060532 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784060532 +1200\n\nfix(cost-provider-azure): bound per-subscription spend fan-out (#51 follow-up) (#60)\n\nspend.ts fanned out per-subscription Cost Management queries with an unbounded\nPromise.all, amplifying 429 throttling under many subscriptions. Add a\ndependency-free order-preserving mapWithConcurrency pool (default cap 4,\noverridable via FetchSpendOptions.maxConcurrency) and route the fan-out through\nit. Reject-on-first-failure and merged/sorted output are preserved; a positive\noversized/Infinity limit runs unbounded, NaN/<=0 clamp to serial.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVpp0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsB8QAET2l4my8jlVTts7G+xIlA4G\nMdDG55j0db7ooc+tR2fYQ5Pqz+WPV4LQpG1Fn/V2bSIQkvC4zS2Sa9a2i1WohvQY\n5tlvA5kgLYWMBm+9sEA30TAUBksH8Q/X9Qh1tPlH/P5s+10zq3Llz5b8krF6KjwE\nOySKQLGlkVqBk39uodaS9PSCiXWgpSipB5bh/W0ePr5yobuCjXq43hCI0BfD5VLb\nRMAxR/AI4fjay2z1T3pbV6lmIGGwyF26Pn+Tn18aDyYlRBwzTinzxq1xBAJ2167A\n2fMoWYynw23aHetZUP5pz38jE3gQjJGkN4skzhRBALBdW9YBqz8DZ6SEu2rygEiG\nc896Re3/Kvhd+EPFNajAoxgWKuANNRi3BdOMHIseoWn+i+d4st+UTOXU4r/DN8ID\nTwJ+iaSCyZb6pj1pFhqvckbOjGtwrNGJjbKN490gIaVxlTAohemc9YN1B1i1eyIu\n/zzzjS73YcnQ2EdpwPxgcR8gYeJNMeehKAGbjDv4ser5/5nTuiLoNm8TrgGV4vzN\nTBYmkuTSp7gECsCtP97mFa4Ehz6qbbVCr96cNnEQfa39KHn/WZ9WeLAllqKqMmNO\noEx5rRmh+RuWKyWdMsQxnavyUwShLZlBXj2eea8a+65fHzo2bq+ToGXBFg30DER8\nfxbhDqhQ6v96DMUcuEFR\n=kdMg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-14T20:22:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi