Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T20:05:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(site): pin decisions to the published 0.1.0-alpha.1 (#59)\n\nBump the site''s decision-* pins alpha.0 → alpha.1 so the live demo consumes\nthe published density/theming/nav work instead of the older alpha.0.\n\nCost stays workspace-linked: the first manual cost publish (0.1.0-alpha.0)\nshipped a stale build missing current exports (createMemoryRepository,\nCostApp, …), so the site can''t consume it yet. The devDependencies note is\nupdated to reflect that; flip to a registry pin once cost is republished\nfrom a fresh build.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d678b3a5db9ae763272a42bff31181b8778f3543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/d678b3a5db9ae763272a42bff31181b8778f3543"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/89d5c40874b99fbd55ea1d3246f9c0778053735d","verification":{"payload":"tree d678b3a5db9ae763272a42bff31181b8778f3543\nparent cfa4c1e7679a3377df371a6775309f949fa6ecd3\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784059517 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784059517 +1200\n\nchore(site): pin decisions to the published 0.1.0-alpha.1 (#59)\n\nBump the site''s decision-* pins alpha.0 → alpha.1 so the live demo consumes\nthe published density/theming/nav work instead of the older alpha.0.\n\nCost stays workspace-linked: the first manual cost publish (0.1.0-alpha.0)\nshipped a stale build missing current exports (createMemoryRepository,\nCostApp, …), so the site can''t consume it yet. The devDependencies note is\nupdated to reflect that; flip to a registry pin once cost is republished\nfrom a fresh build.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVpZ9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABXsQAEHgBxoVcIcfdOc82XcKfgsT\nGQ1rtvYZ29A0JG4FewgZg