moving it (to\nmatch every sibling package, which declare none) before the family''s first\nnpm publish, since the manifest freezes at publish time.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81e74a541b25753522409210e7fb6de2f371cfb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/81e74a541b25753522409210e7fb6de2f371cfb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/cfa4c1e7679a3377df371a6775309f949fa6ecd3","verification":{"payload":"tree 81e74a541b25753522409210e7fb6de2f371cfb3\nparent f9c42ac0e73239bf3d75d0f698469bc98a208468\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784027618 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784027618 +1200\n\nchore(cost-provider-azure): drop stray engines field before first publish (#58)\n\ncost-provider-azure was the only cost/c4 package declaring engines, and its\nvalue (''>=22'') was both the loose range #53 flagged and a dev-toolchain\nconstraint that doesn''t belong on a runtime library manifest. Removing it (to\nmatch every sibling package, which declare none) before the family''s first\nnpm publish, since the manifest freezes at publish time.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVhniCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3TEQAGyAqwCMKkYpqNlD06Hl3dEo\nkbPX0fgYbf6+QHHWz5Qn3lUgLA3Hc/3OoCsoysnZu5hnmGuQjnOqnyhe9JCp3HTu\nXxXVBkcqzYUs6ljQBXtpxSo0No3RVQNdghOZUavJS9iZio4tx5V9pO5U95Ip//8i\nluSOV8M458i/uSnnfM+ZJwR7lHIr2cb6632sOm6aUwzbpHbLEkxn17bWbJGlYhnP\nlK6qLxRQ6NBUCwo1phN+qnzENcIT+1dk8YxXjw+vUNMHBMnIUspZXqNByt9Hv9YO\nTFnmpONNwho3IigYwMNN3DzoqytOMmD1otmBZYrcCeDYCHTApeNCoDBX9wW8JjRD\njhzOTryk3KI121Oj9+wMNIuvNaZh0ziNQN9x9ZQA+IX9+vhvAGBZUYGU03BKDF9C\nIlCVlpXyIXz3N3yUaWUCHFc6RyqWNVWS9fyPG5dKLrrZMtpVLalFeWRO7VTJRUVq\ni4UgPLAaQNkLr++RJlPjoRJ0BtKh8w+jKaH7fdn3lnTur/IRCoMJ9Rec+n+joeP5\nrJ22e8OIjF1aAK+XkWEeQ+NJlKsBs8kAmJjQM9tCr6+TugofX1tDQEthWCSRkLyJ\nvDDEnnP1m0ScNEJIn7t2VIHewmy