r_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/799474ed7e765ca61ea54ba97bf1b450bd1c26ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T08:01:47Z","email":"brett@fieldstate.io","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T08:01:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(studio): constrain refs to the served root on Windows (#52) (#56)\n\nFsRepository.resolve() trusted absolute refs, so a Windows drive-letter\n(C:\\...) or UNC (\\\\server\\share) ref passed the guard and was returned\nunchanged, letting a PUT write outside the served root. Add a pure\nresolveWithinRoot() that resolves against root and verifies containment via\nrelative(); harden the request guard against backslash/drive-letter refs;\nmap rejections to 400 (previously PUT errors were unconditionally 500).\nApplied symmetrically to decision-studio and cost-studio.\n\nCloses #52\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a34d72ab2b46f7a62fe4185947763d7c3c15125b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/a34d72ab2b46f7a62fe4185947763d7c3c15125b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/799474ed7e765ca61ea54ba97bf1b450bd1c26ac","verification":{"payload":"tree a34d72ab2b46f7a62fe4185947763d7c3c15125b\nparent ab04d9350e6cf9f95f4255e2d9e6ec1510c78419\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784016107 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784016107 +1200\n\nfix(studio): constrain refs to the served root on Windows (#52) (#56)\n\nFsRepository.resolve() trusted absolute refs, so a Windows drive-letter\n(C:\\...) or UNC (\\\\server\\share) ref passed the guard and was returned\nunchanged, letting a PUT write outside the served root. Add a pure\nresolveWithinRoot() that resolves against root and verifies containment via\nrelative(); harden the request guard against backslash/drive-letter refs;\nmap rejections to 400 (previously PUT errors were unconditionally 500).\nApplied symmetrically to decision-studio and cost-studio.\n\nCloses #52\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVezrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAH3YQABPtBtV1C6ZceO89evy9v7IW\na/XibOXTefizLRt7uffln6DP6VjB6lXU56OvPHkiqyjXKO1XoZXeZbv3iW9Pismh\nRWqNfg1s+8Mr5bM7RLvlWQ4bsf9+NqgMqazJWrEvbtmQAd6fcORg6WvpVg+YTcPa\ngkwIQJDxScGU8WKkMf7vzZBbu0uG0ktRXy8TtoQXclw9OJLMbX+aI0BaS6SX7/6Y\ngxBgrh2rxi29jJYovfJ6Doq9lBDZFMmwEdH2MjMWdCT+3DCI2kw8Re2ikc4aDBul\nk1iHR1WHNjHYpQC8aHclob031XFttzQzhJih5VqhK/3fiovmtYG0odkXvRRp6Qxf\n2XStVoVbLk0Sn11xkZg5Ss/uYq9xaFsWhK2NZWOxpltTirc0qikULEMPAm6OHs+A\njoTTStLr3iijSVlSsN27U+y9WAhdhjRj5CavgBNk4BmytyqK+jYlrGeDP2akQzw6\nVtbh8fy01RkX3yfZ/TxiFOK1EjtXz0WfmUbGdSlqFW6EyUvR2acyrd6Wv1ee3jtT\nLtO9x8dmivrmluaZZRRWeqswUgcnLKB2amvRuw/eDvtyq/NuhniSAUgVrNYd1KJi\n6yBnSrQUy3mTYf+hCArryqYus3TLqKBCCLISBrDJhpGDkeFUtLRbSLxxw5cyXPnY\nPoHjaCrtBuYnuAKXaOub\n=3nBV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-14T08:01:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gi