l":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(cost-provider-azure): honor Cost Management retry-after headers (#51) (#55)\n\nwithRetry() read only the generic retry-after header before backoff. Add a\nretryDelayFromHeaders() helper that honors, in precedence order, the\ncostmanagement-qpu, consumption, then generic retry-after headers (first\npresent-and-parseable wins; a 0 delay is valid; unparseable falls through),\nthen exponential backoff. Adds precedence tests incl. 0-value and HTTP-date.\n\nCloses #51\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8112ecfffc729121bcd32714ecbc23f881e50b26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/8112ecfffc729121bcd32714ecbc23f881e50b26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/ab04d9350e6cf9f95f4255e2d9e6ec1510c78419","verification":{"payload":"tree 8112ecfffc729121bcd32714ecbc23f881e50b26\nparent 5b240904fe25139d336bdd686e2d096b1844741e\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@fieldstate.io> 1784016103 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784016103 +1200\n\nfix(cost-provider-azure): honor Cost Management retry-after headers (#51) (#55)\n\nwithRetry() read only the generic retry-after header before backoff. Add a\nretryDelayFromHeaders() helper that honors, in precedence order, the\ncostmanagement-qpu, consumption, then generic retry-after headers (first\npresent-and-parseable wins; a 0 delay is valid; unparseable falls through),\nthen exponential backoff. Adds precedence tests incl. 0-value and HTTP-date.\n\nCloses #51\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVeznCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQvkQAHtoJyfzTZJ9zmcfhdX6QOsD\nU1UVz4RfHrnmeccojaGPWLidxooQLp18HcFXqzLFUlvb3VAoSJhUwmPzmXpJhccm\nsGsNJcRAr1TNMqvYVUFvqCIz7PNRiMytIo4lNrWsNhc4Twz8+d5hAuX7J16OiKf+\nfp9JwlQDkeoJgLOVavt2TzlM5sSDWUI6G68FXNRGPkT3ilNq9x8fXysXkF90ihon\nzLb/Ffg9h7Wlousp4nNLLmkSwMJ