lease wiring, docs (#39)\n\n- Promote the three byte-identical private CLI-runner/diagnostic copies\n  (aspire-hosting-c4/decisions/cost) into one canonical public API in\n  aspire-hosting-core: Aspire.Hosting.Workspec.WorkspecCliRunner +\n  WorkspecCliDiagnostic. Fixes the inherited Markdown table-cell escaper to be\n  null-safe and newline-escaping (previously pipe-only, NRE on a null field).\n  Runner tests consolidated into one Core-scoped suite; cost''s report-payload\n  parsing and Markdown formatting stay module-specific.\n- NuGet packaging for all four packages: PackageIds Workspec.Aspire.Hosting.*\n  (the Aspire. prefix is reserved on nuget.org — verified empirically),\n  assemblies stay Aspire.Hosting.Workspec.*, Apache-2.0 license, embedded\n  README, 0.1.0-alpha.0. Tests/e2e-fixture stay IsPackable=false.\n- Wire a nuget-publish job into release.yml (NuGet.org Trusted Publishing/OIDC,\n  same tag trigger as the npm job) — inert behind a repo variable until the\n  one-time nuget.org policy setup is done; documented in\n  docs/decisions/RELEASING.md.\n- ci.yml: build packages/cost-studio alongside c4-studio/decision-studio so\n  WorkspecCostRealCliTests exercises the real CLI in CI instead of self-skipping.\n- Docs: root README module table/section, docs/aspire-hosting/ index, sweep of\n  the four integration docs and aspire-hosting/README.md for A6 changes.\n\n139/139 aspire-hosting tests green (down from 147 — de-duplication, not lost\ncoverage: every removed runner test maps to a consolidated or relocated one).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a9e2667b1b0572ecadc2e0e48f18f4d4a445ade","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/7a9e2667b1b0572ecadc2e0e48f18f4d4a445ade"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/c511e3d29c9bb965cdeb5a5491e4feeccd9efcb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at