nz","name":"Brett Smith"},"message":"feat(aspire-hosting): A3 — c4 integration: resource, health, graph sync, ATS exports (#36)\n\nTwo empirical findings recorded for posterity:\n- DistributedApplicationTestingBuilder cannot run from a bare xunit assembly;\n  it requires a real AppHost entry-point project (Aspire.AppHost.Sdk + DCP\n  wiring), hence the minimal aspire-hosting-e2e-fixture-apphost project.\n- ATS TypeScript codegen is blocked locally: aspire CLI 13.3.0 pins its\n  internal restore to Aspire.Hosting 13.3.0, conflicting with our 13.4.6\n  reference (NU1605). Documented in docs/aspire-hosting/c4-integration.md;\n  fix is a newer aspire CLI. Analyzer-enforced [AspireExport] coverage runs\n  in CI regardless.\n\nReview fix: graph-sync outcomes now publish to the workspec.sync snapshot\nproperty instead of overriding lifecycle State (custom State nulls health\naggregation and breaks WaitFor/WaitForResourceHealthyAsync); plus CLI run\ntimeout with process-tree kill, shared bounded health-check HttpClient,\nguarded validate JSON parse, full Markdown-cell escaping, and lockfile\nimporter for examples/aspire-apphost.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"afd1930f91a85df2aad554b6958456a07d89e0d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/afd1930f91a85df2aad554b6958456a07d89e0d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/5d4e5686671735f912d451192c8697857a0c8d38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commit/5d4e5686671735f912d451192c8697857a0c8d38","node_id":"C_kwDOTPvB8toAKDVkNGU1Njg2NjcxNzM1ZjkxMmQ0NTExOTJjODY5Nzg1N2EwYzhkMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commit/9a9bd828ef2361681653a1341abfc5a174e4cc76","sha":"9a9bd828ef2361681653a1341abfc5a174e4cc76","url":"https://api.githu