workspec-studio/git/commits/db1d50d8b9278173b479bf67648ad35f8d1c1a02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commit/db1d50d8b9278173b479bf67648ad35f8d1c1a02","node_id":"C_kwDOTPvB8toAKGRiMWQ1MGQ4YjkyNzgxNzNiNDc5YmY2NzY0OGFkMzVmOGQxYzFhMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commit/76a31c0a5f9c6cdbec8568384f38eb48c2ee0711","sha":"76a31c0a5f9c6cdbec8568384f38eb48c2ee0711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/76a31c0a5f9c6cdbec8568384f38eb48c2ee0711"}],"sha":"db1d50d8b9278173b479bf67648ad35f8d1c1a02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/db1d50d8b9278173b479bf67648ad35f8d1c1a02"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/60c11533d73d3f00e36765658572564765cebcb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T22:02:27Z","email":"brett@pukekos.co.nz","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T22:02:27Z","email":"brett@pukekos.co.nz","name":"Brett Smith"},"message":"fix(cost-ui): C5 review fixes — split order, report sort, composer projection, a11y\n\nFixes an adversarial review pass on the C5 Attribution Workbench + Reports\nslice:\n\n- Split ratios now render ratio-descending (matching cost-engine''s\n  serializeSplitValue) at all three sites — rail chip, table cell, cascade —\n  via one shared `sortedSplitEntries` helper. On-disk artifacts serialize\n  splits alphabetically by value, so the previous source-order rendering\n  read every split backwards (verified against the real demo estate:\n  \"product split 60/40\", not 40/60).\n- Reports'' spend-by-dimension rows now sort by amount descending with\n  `unattributed` pinned last regardless of amount, instead of rollup\n  insertion order.\n- The triage composer''s projection now counts only the cluster''s resources\n  currently unattributed on the primary dimension — the same set the\n  cluster chips count — instead of every resource in the resource group,\n  which double-counted resources a pinned override or earlier rule already\n  claimed (demo estate''s rg-legacy-misc: matches 12 · $1,159/mo · coverage\n  81.2% → 90.0%, previously a self-contradictory 13 · $1,469).\n- Resource rows gain role=\"button\"/tabIndex/Enter+Space keydown/\n  aria-expanded; filter and cluster chips gain aria-pressed.\n- Rail reorder/remove and composer \"Add as rN\" buttons disable while a\n  writeAttribution mutation is in flight (guard only, no optimistic update).\n- Reports'' capex/opex stat now sums the actual opex bucket rather than\n  \"everything non-capex,\" rendering any other costType/unattributed spend\n  into the ratio bar''s remainder instead of silently folding it into opex.\n- Package metadata rewritten to describe the real C5 surface.\n\nAdds packages/cost-ui/src/format.test.ts and extends the attribution-\nworkbench, cost-report, and demo-estate smoke tests to lock all of the\nabove, including two new demo-estate assertions that reproduce the review''s\nexact repro numbers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd87b6520dcfaba864a617f08a313bd998cef833","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/cd87b6520dcfaba864a617f08a313bd998cef833"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/60c11533d73d3f00e36765658572564765cebcb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commit/60c11533d73d3f00e36765658572564765cebcb1","node_id":"C_kwDOTPvB8toAKDYwYzExNTMzZDczZDNmMDBlMzY3NjU2NTg1NzI1NjQ3NjVjZWJjYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commit/d5d240a7aa17cc37ef12d2e46104f5f8175769f8","sha":"d5d240a7aa17cc37ef12d2e46104f5f8175769f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/d5d240a7aa17cc37ef12d2e46104f5f8175769f8"}],"sha":"60c11533d73d3f00e36765658572564765cebcb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/60c11533d73d3f00e36765658572564765cebcb1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/d5d240a7aa17cc37ef12d2e46104f5f8175769f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T21:27:13Z","email":"brett@pukekos.co.nz","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T21:27:13Z","email":"brett@pukekos.co.nz","name":"Brett Smith"},"message":"feat(cost-studio): C5b — workspec-cost serve + browser shell\n\nAdds the `serve` command (Express host over FsRepository, hosting the\n@workspec/cost-ui views) and its Vite-built browser client, mirroring\n@workspec/decision-studio''s server/serve/client shape across all four cost\nartifact kinds.\n\nCloses #19\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5caae1dbc5aa6c97a443f3b8f78fa2ab91be9d10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/trees/5caae1dbc5aa6c97a443f3b8f78fa2ab91be9d10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/git/commits/d5d240a7aa17cc37ef12d2e46104f5f8175769f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commit/d5d240a7aa17cc37ef12d2e46104f5f8175769f8","node_id":"C_kwDOTPvB8toAKGQ1ZDI0MGE3YWExN2NjMzdlZjEyZDJlNDYxMDRmNWY4MTc1NzY5Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commit/4f7297524be2bea5eab7b809ab333bff80c32724","sha":"4f7297524be2bea5eab7b809ab333bff80c32724","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-studio/commits/4f7297524be2bea5eab7b809ab333bff80c32724"}],"sha":"d5d240a7aa17cc37ef12d2e4610