arxC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/farxC","id":83882306,"login":"farxC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODgyMzA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/550500d0d6dac6154edb740e6b8e906ea7fabbc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T00:12:47Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T00:12:47Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"message":"feat(exercises): add grip/angle/equipment variations\n\nExercises can now have variations of themselves (e.g. incline vs. flat\nbench) — each with its own independent history, PRs, and config, one\nmarked as the parent''s default. Schema v18->v19 adds parent_exercise_id\nand is_default_variation, enforced by a partial unique index so only\none variation per parent can be default. Covers picking a variation\nwhile building a session, resolving a routine''s default variation at\nsession start, and correcting which variation was used after a\nsession is saved (migrating logged sets to the new exercise). Export\nformat bumped to v7.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b78c2c77492fb6e815466e07882af3e0c9964ac9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/trees/b78c2c77492fb6e815466e07882af3e0c9964ac