mmitter":{"date":"2026-07-24T03:03:40Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"message":"docs: add product roadmap (short/medium/long-term)\n\nCaptures the near-term plan (exercise editing + propagation, modality\ngeneralization, richer analytics, smart export/import, UX/design-system\nfoundation), medium-term theming/personalization, and long-term\nbackend sync + AI recommendations — grounded in the current codebase\nstate explored this session.","tree":{"sha":"751087750f48ab2d3d355a50816d029d98146501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/trees/751087750f48ab2d3d355a50816d029d98146501"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/commits/41cdce37568c0fd10e02786345920703ec64588c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83882306?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/farxC","id":83882306,"login":"farxC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODgyMzA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/farxC/open-training/commit/41cdce37568c0fd10e02786345920703ec64588c","node_id":"C_kwDOTP0lv9oAKDQxY2RjZTM3NTY4YzBmZDEwZTAyNzg2MzQ1OTIwNzAzZWM2NDU4OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/farxC/open-training/commit/4bf6f744178377a07d6a2f03c6590cd91fedfa7a","sha":"4bf6f744178377a07d6a2f03c6590cd91fedfa7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/4bf6f744178377a07d6a2f03c6590cd91fedfa7a"}],"sha":"41cdce37568c0fd10e02786345920703ec64588c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/41cdce37568c0fd10e02786345920703ec64588c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83882306?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/farxC","id":83882306,"login":"farxC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODgyMzA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/4bf6f744178377a07d6a2f03c6590cd91fedfa7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T02:48:28Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T02:48:28Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"message":"feat(exercises): add per-exercise physical configuration\n\nExercises now carry a required physical config (resistance curve, load\ntype, pulley type, laterality, range of motion, bench angle) with an\napp-wide default, editable per exercise and overridable per session\nvia a new bench-angle-aware editor and a 2D resistance-curve chart.\nSchema v15/v16 adds exercise_config + session_exercise_config; export\nformat bumps to v5 to carry the new fields.\n\nAlso includes an unrelated seed-data fix bundled into the same\nmigration file: renames the built-in \"Tricep Dip\" seed to \"Dips\" for\npre-existing installs (schema v17).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"074a973f84d42248430198b3fd46567b5d2b6e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/trees/074a973f84d42248430198b3fd46567b5d2b6e07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/commits/4bf6f744178377a07d6a2f03c6590cd91fedfa7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83882306?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/farxC","id":83882306,"login":"farxC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODgyMzA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/farxC/open-training/commit/4bf6f744178377a07d6a2f03c6590cd91fedfa7a","node_id":"C_kwDOTP0lv9oAKDRiZjZmNzQ0MTc4Mzc3YTA3ZDZhMmYwM2M2NTkwY2Q5MWZlZGZhN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/farxC/open-training/commit/05dec4b95dc9d3e6009c99d4367530ee04a588ef","sha":"05dec4b95dc9d3e6009c99d4367530ee04a588ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/05dec4b95dc9d3e6009c99d4367530ee04a588ef"}],"sha":"4bf6f744178377a07d6a2f03c6590cd91fedfa7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/4bf6f744178377a07d6a2f03c6590cd91fedfa7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83882306?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/farxC","id":83882306,"login":"farxC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODgyMzA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/05dec4b95dc9d3e6009c99d4367530ee04a588ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T00:59:36Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T00:59:36Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"message":"feat(components): adopt react-native-sortables for exercise drag-reorder\n\nEven after fixing the hand-rolled DraggableList''s Android bug and\ntuning its spring animation, the drag/settle feel never matched what\nreact-native-sortables gives out of the box on the same reanimated +\ngesture-handler stack — confirmed via a live Playwright spike, which\nalso verified it handles the same TextInput and web onLayout edge\ncases DraggableList had to work around by hand.\n\nAdd a new, parallel SortableExerciseList component (DraggableList is\nleft untouched and unused, not refactored) and switch all 4 call\nsites to it. Its render info splits the old single `dragHandle` node\ninto `dragHandleIcon` + `DragHandle` (the wrapping component), so\nconsumers can make the whole row header draggable instead of just the\nsmall grip icon.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f15edde1519e3f28943e325c2fe2e3ce18c9ca01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/trees/f15edde1519e3f28943e325c2fe2e3ce18c9ca01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/commits/05dec4b95dc9d3e6009c99d4367530ee04a588ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83882306?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/farxC","id":83882306,"login":"farxC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODgyMzA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/farxC/open-training/commit/05dec4b95dc9d3e6009c99d4367530ee04a588ef","node_id":"C_kwDOTP0lv9oAKDA1ZGVjNGI5NWRjOWQzZTYwMDljOTlkNDM2NzUzMGVlMDRhNTg4ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/farxC/open-training/commit/705890d4cc02cc9a9f23282359bb38c9712dcb61","sha":"705890d4cc02cc9a9f23282359bb38c9712dcb61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/705890d4cc02cc9a9f23282359bb38c9712dcb61"}],"sha":"05dec4b95dc9d3e6009c99d4367530ee04a588ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/05dec4b95dc9d3e6009c99d4367530ee04a588ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83882306?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/farxC","id":83882306,"login":"farxC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODgyMzA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/705890d4cc02cc9a9f23282359bb38c9712dcb61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T00:59:22Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T00:59:22Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"message":"fix(components): fix Android touch overlap and drag animation in DraggableList\n\nRows were absolutely positioned with height tracked in a separate React\nstate, so Android''s touch clipping plus JS/UI-thread drift made rows\noverlap and stop receiving touches once cards grew (e.g. adding sets).\nSwitch to normal-flow layout with translateY-only animation, gate the\npan gesture behind a long-press so it stops fighting the parent\nScrollView, and use a spring (instead of duration-based timing) for the\nreorder/settle animation so repeated re-targeting during a drag doesn''t\nlook like an abrupt direction snap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18b72c4aebf7e65931aef0b041624d5a3569f2e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/trees/18b72c4aebf7e65931aef0b041624d5a3569f2e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/commits/705890d4cc02cc9a9f23282359bb38c9712dcb61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83882306?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/farxC","id":83882306,"login":"farxC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODgyMzA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/farxC/open-training/commit/705890d4cc02cc9a9f23282359bb38c9712dcb61","node_id":"C_kwDOTP0lv9oAKDcwNTg5MGQ0Y2MwMmNjOWE5ZjIzMjgyMzU5YmIzOGM5NzEyZGNiNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/farxC/open-training/commit/3d19a48e864ea15b6fb7db320e1847f0e01b300a","sha":"3d19a48e864ea15b6fb7db320e1847f0e01b300a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/3d19a48e864ea15b6fb7db320e1847f0e01b300a"}],"sha":"705890d4cc02cc9a9f23282359bb38