its/80de80b298897b14868d0f73a32bd3246beae53a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83882306?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/farxC","id":83882306,"login":"farxC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODgyMzA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/e2099a9b8f5df08e783630f09ea59431f70c7fab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T01:17:01Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T01:17:01Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"message":"docs: add Task 2b to migration testing plan (jest-expo/sql.js env fix)\n\nTask 2''s implementer hit a real blocker: jest-expo''s preset (via\nreact-native/jest/setup.js) sets global.window = global on every test\nfile regardless of testEnvironment, which makes sql.js''s Emscripten\nglue code misdetect a browser context and fail opening the in-memory\ndatabase. Root-caused and the fix (split jest.config.js into a\nmulti-project config, isolating DB tests from the jest-expo preset)\nwas verified empirically: the new db-project test passes and all 17\nexisting suites (236 tests) still pass under the app project.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha