":{"date":"2026-07-15T00:56:46Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T00:56:46Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"message":"feat(session): resume an in-progress new-session draft instead of restarting\n\nA leftover session from a previous \"New session\" attempt that got\ndismissed without hitting Cancelar/Descartar (e.g. a modal swipe-down)\nstayed alive in SessionRecorderContext, but reopening /session/new always\nrestarted from the modality picker and silently reused its (possibly\ndifferent) modality/data underneath. Now it resumes directly into the\ndetails step, seeded from the actual session record.","tree":{"sha":"54c9e1dda9c84b0ad5afd80e7bfea4ecffef46b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/trees/54c9e1dda9c84b0ad5afd80e7bfea4ecffef46b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/commits/c8f7b2d61ac14c4364573f84dc310efd14da1f50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83882306?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/farxC","id":83882306,"login":"farxC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODgyMzA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC","user_view_type":"public"},"h