in":"farxC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODgyMzA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/farxC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/commits/42327ec01659275a84260f1baa54478c30d8b066/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T03:57:05Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T03:57:05Z","email":"rafaelflamengo07@outlook.com","name":"farxC"},"message":"fix(analytics): initialize Skia''s CanvasKit WASM runtime on web\n\nVolumeChart (Victory Native + react-native-skia) never called\nLoadSkiaWeb(), so Skia.web.ts built its API against an undefined\nglobal.CanvasKit. The empty-state early return in VolumeChart masked\nthis until a session existed and the chart actually tried to draw,\nmatching the reported symptom: web-only, only once sessions exist.\n\ncanvaskit.wasm is committed into public/ (same pattern as the\nexisting public/sql-wasm.wasm) and ensureSkiaReady() gates app\nreadiness on web the same way initDatabase() already does, staying\na no-op on native where Skia needs no async init.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81d68359e8b9c7900478aa0e8958d93830669605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/trees/81d68359e8b9c7900478aa0e8958d93830669605"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farxC/open-training/git/commits/42327ec01659275a84260f1baa54478c30d8b066","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/