:"stevesioli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzEzMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/commits/76a1ae496bcb58fa9ccdf37749038a3e087d31e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:33:04Z","email":"steve.m@sioli.com","name":"Steve Sioli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:33:04Z","email":"steve.m@sioli.com","name":"Steve Sioli"},"message":"build: wire remote-before-shell ordering and static-host deploy configs\n\nturbo.json now declares shell#build as explicitly depending on all\nfive mfe-*#build tasks (Turborepo can''t infer this automatically since\nthe shell loads remotes at runtime, not via a package.json\ndependency), and gives each mfe-*#build task an output declaration\ncovering the files it writes into the shell''s public/remotes/<slug>\ndirectory outside its own package folder.\n\nAlso adds:\n\n- netlify.toml — one-command Netlify build/publish config.\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml — lint/type-check/build on every PR.\n- .github/workflows/deploy-gh-pages.yml — example GitHub Pages deploy\n  (disabled by default), including the VITE_BASE_PATH override needed\n  for a project page''s subpath.\n\nThe site has no client-side router (single page, anchor navigation),\nso no SPA fallback/redirect rules are needed on any host.","tree":{"sha":"bfede6d423c293e5f4c00e5f61b851d5533c3419","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/git/trees/bfede6d423c293e5f4c00e5f61b851d5533c3419"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/git/com