ar\n(email/LinkedIn/location — home address and phone number intentionally\nomitted from the public page), and four animated impact stats pulled\nfrom the resume''s Key Engineering Impact bullets (~40% less redundant\nfront-end work, ~80% faster page performance, 15+ years of platform\nexperience, 275+ global brand sites). Uses Reveal/StaggerGroup from\n@resume/ui for entrance motion and the extracted headshot as an\nAvatar with initials fallback.","tree":{"sha":"7e20a44668806da605440ca0090185127e9c2ec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/git/trees/7e20a44668806da605440ca0090185127e9c2ec2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/git/commits/ce3581b5e14508f19f9a3f6f5e51c56ca196a07c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3331339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stevesioli","id":3331339,"login":"stevesioli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzEzMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stevesioli/portfolio/commit/ce3581b5e14508f19f9a3f6f5e51c56ca196a07c","node_id":"C_kwDOTQCvC9oAKGNlMzU4MWI1ZTE0NTA4ZjE5ZjlhM2Y2ZjVlNTFjNTZjYTE5NmEwN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stevesioli/portfolio/commit/398d98de1ad1ece207bc48b33decfbfd59aeb3b0","sha":"398d98de1ad1ece207bc48b33decfbfd59aeb3b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/commits/398d98de1ad1ece207bc48b33decfbfd59aeb3b0"}],"sha":"ce3581b5e14508f19f9a3f6f5e51c56ca196a07c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/commits/ce3581b5e14508f19f9a3f6f5e51c56ca196a07c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3331339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stevesioli","id":3331339,"login":"stevesioli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzEzMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/commits/398d98de1ad1ece207bc48b33decfbfd59aeb3b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:28:28Z","email":"steve.m@sioli.com","name":"Steve Sioli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:28:28Z","email":"steve.m@sioli.com","name":"Steve Sioli"},"message":"feat(mfe): scaffold all five micro-frontend apps\n\nGenerate the independent Vite + React 19 + Module Federation project\nfor each resume section (mfe-hero, mfe-experience, mfe-skills,\nmfe-education, mfe-contact): package.json, vite.config.ts (federation\nexposes + shared React singleton + build output routed into the\nshell''s public/remotes/<slug>), tsconfig, eslint config, and a\nstandalone dev-main.tsx harness so each remote can be developed and\npreviewed with ''pnpm --filter <name> dev'' in total isolation.\n\nAlso, two portability fixes surfaced while wiring this up:\n\n- apps/shell/index.html now sets <base href=\"%BASE_URL%\"> and uses\n  base-relative asset URLs, so images/PDFs referenced from any\n  federated remote resolve correctly whether the site is deployed at\n  a domain root or a hosting subpath.\n- packages/ui/src/styles/theme.css adds explicit Tailwind v4 @source\n  directives for the shared component/theme/motion folders. Tailwind\n  v4 ignores node_modules during its automatic template scan, and\n  @resume/ui is consumed as a symlinked pnpm workspace package, so\n  without this every app''s Tailwind build would silently drop the\n  utility classes used inside the shared UI components.","tree":{"sha":"beb017d4f8b75b17fabf4492237477b69828258c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/git/trees/beb017d4f8b75b17fabf4492237477b69828258c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/git/commits/398d98de1ad1ece207bc48b33decfbfd59aeb3b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3331339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stevesioli","id":3331339,"login":"stevesioli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzEzMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stevesioli/portfolio/commit/398d98de1ad1ece207bc48b33decfbfd59aeb3b0","node_id":"C_kwDOTQCvC9oAKDM5OGQ5OGRlMWFkMWVjZTIwN2JjNDhiMzNkZWNmYmZkNTlhZWIzYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stevesioli/portfolio/commit/ee2035425110a7374607c2eb43f97f27f256908c","sha":"ee2035425110a7374607c2eb43f97f27f256908c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/commits/ee2035425110a7374607c2eb43f97f27f256908c"}],"sha":"398d98de1ad1ece207bc48b33decfbfd59aeb3b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/commits/398d98de1ad1ece207bc48b33decfbfd59aeb3b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3331339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stevesioli","id":3331339,"login":"stevesioli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzEzMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/commits/ee2035425110a7374607c2eb43f97f27f256908c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:23:19Z","email":"steve.m@sioli.com","name":"Steve Sioli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:23:19Z","email":"steve.m@sioli.com","name":"Steve Sioli"},"message":"feat(shell): scaffold host application\n\nAdd the shell — the app that stitches every micro-frontend together at\nruntime via Module Federation (@module-federation/vite):\n\n- vite.config.ts declares the five remotes (mfeHero, mfeExperience,\n  mfeSkills, mfeEducation, mfeContact) as bare-specifier imports\n  resolved against public/remotes/<slug>/remoteEntry.js, with react/\n  react-dom shared as singletons. VITE_BASE_PATH controls both Vite''s\n  base and the remote entry URLs so the same build works at a domain\n  root or a hosting subpath (e.g. a GitHub Pages project page).\n- Navbar with scrollspy, theme toggle, résumé download, and a mobile\n  Sheet menu; Footer; a Section layout wrapper shared by every\n  non-hero remote so spacing/typography stay consistent without\n  duplicating chrome across five independent builds.\n- RemoteBoundary (Suspense + error boundary) around each federated\n  import so one remote failing to load can''t take down the page.\n- Self-hosted variable fonts (Inter, Fraunces, JetBrains Mono) via\n  fontsource — no third-party font requests at runtime.\n- The original resume PDF is served at /resume/steve-sioli-resume.pdf\n  for the header''s download button.","tree":{"sha":"984ae9b48451e61cf18e43eae9f18a9f1bded025","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/git/trees/984ae9b48451e61cf18e43eae9f18a9f1bded025"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/git/commits/ee2035425110a7374607c2eb43f97f27f256908c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3331339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https: