i.github.com/users/stevesioli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevesioli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/commits/92d15d62e377dd4b2874169a0a7fbc997f2539a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:18:40Z","email":"steve.m@sioli.com","name":"Steve Sioli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:18:40Z","email":"steve.m@sioli.com","name":"Steve Sioli"},"message":"feat(ui): add shared shadcn-based design system package\n\nIntroduce @resume/ui, the design system consumed by the shell and every\nfederated micro-frontend:\n\n- Tailwind v4 CSS-first theme (oklch tokens) implementing a dark,\n  editorial/minimal palette with a warm copper accent, plus a light\n  mode counterpart and a .dark class strategy.\n- Hand-rolled shadcn/ui primitives on Radix (button, card, badge,\n  separator, avatar, tooltip, sheet, input, textarea, label).\n- ThemeProvider/useTheme/ThemeToggle for the light/dark toggle.\n- Reveal and StaggerGroup/StaggerItem motion primitives built on the\n  motion package for consistent scroll-triggered animation across\n  every remote.\n- Shared TypeScript data contracts (ExperienceEntry, SkillCategory,\n  ImpactStat, etc.) used by the resume content remotes.","tree":{"sha":"f69fd98091f2d1379882a326b899b4f87da67481","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/git/trees/f69fd98091f2d1379882a326b899b4f87da67481"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevesioli/portfolio/git/commits/92d15d62e377dd4b2874169a0a7fbc997f2539a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3331339?v=4"