nts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertoMarcojr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertoMarcojr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertoMarcojr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertoMarcojr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Y22CD006/Teams/commits/3bec06aa7ddb3a22eacbc3e3110f0c3e27f5ef7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T05:13:11Z","email":"yendukuippudu@gmail.com","name":"robertoMarcojr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T05:13:11Z","email":"yendukuippudu@gmail.com","name":"robertoMarcojr"},"message":"Merge branch ''Raju'' into hari - keep Redux architecture as primary, integrate Raju''s Pusher real-time chat, profile name fields, update-profile flow, and query-provider\n\nConflicts resolved:\n- lib/pusher.ts: took Raju''s singleton pattern + getPusherClient()\n- app/api/messages/route.ts: merged both - our POST response format + Raju''s GET + pusher broadcasting\n- app/api/auth/me/route.ts: kept our field selection + added Raju''s phoneNumber\n- app/layout.tsx: kept ReduxProvider, added QueryProvider inside\n- components/dashboard/dashboard.tsx: kept our Redux-driven implementation\n- components/layout/sidebar-nav.tsx: kept ours with Loader2 import\n- package.json: kept both @reduxjs/toolkit and @tanstack/react-query\n- app/page.tsx: kept our simple <Dashboard /> without dbUser prop\n- hooks/use-chat.ts: stripped isThread from Message type (doesn''t exist in our types)\n- app/(auth)/login, signup: took Raju''s refactored data parsing + signup redirect to /login","tree":{"sha":"6448e2b76c30be90a7fb1b3ab8824465873bbe3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Y22CD006/Teams/git/trees/6448e2b76c30be90a7fb1b3ab8824465873bbe3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Y22CD006/Teams/git/commits/3bec06aa7ddb3a22eacbc3e3110f0c3e27f5ef7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned"