ity, plan-change mail","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbjR3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABW4QAEd8Es7KbzFLJW0ceHFtY8/9\n+kfpTyPEFPWlfTqrWNm/OCyoYeV62KpYzDIN4x25350iDqqJGEjsrhavgPYlle11\n1c7iBkrsVzKhyeM+Zq2cMlSXwSgmZixCAdysqqc0mtHituxXzSYRPObPXb7OMH6W\nA+o2nyPCgSxuio5JkLQ5OOA6vGgGrSv0izWWWGdcUEmRV7xWt/sc03v+Dnb14+zR\nQE48xippm1BipBfo94NRiyAjbai0Y3h6teYbStTjb0aQi082C+78F/QB3Kf35R+3\ncF2MAAwmvjp9SfPkNbO2jNKkr07PoMm206vpnE9EY45NxJsgNrBZ7LF1OBJCTTYN\n4pKLjTJuhzuB2pe12NP2NK6kNlTqvEIN6ngOHA9Vxmpmr0Oy4M+oA2h/mTLSvosg\nnj7RhfHozSCaZt+kGnt3OQiMKM1kcy45kgzdH9De6fGZ4dscMv7ZP9RadhGtpoZT\nMgKMJHJODkCG5PxVRvzMEoxTvStnWfKxeZiwSr2yIc78phprluzlHmSXtdkIKP9L\n1QectXldGPCHo0kmUCROfUsnnJZiFTEjNXOBM93+yzxzCh3zyKEdTapVchuJPcuE\n0nRAoqK7jByoMRhqadajPqxgwf96tbIj8fM38WDMx0fhvwr2kDkQ3zyHtzMQ5U0o\nUN7V8R9AFpqg7SVHhz62\n=K4Lv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T18:01:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/3b439b593bfb7c7bdbda4b6538ea5690a05c6d16","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDNiNDM5YjU5M2JmYjdjN2JkYmRhNGI2NTM4ZWE1NjkwYTA1YzZkMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/ad2c9e7ccc0eeeeeafdd6d6bedbeb1338c8ef9dd","sha":"ad2c9e7ccc0eeeeeafdd6d6bedbeb1338c8ef9dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/ad2c9e7ccc0eeeeeafdd6d6bedbeb1338c8ef9dd"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/a53ee6a4fef0dd4783e65e93fecb81aa20c61196","sha":"a53ee6a4fef0dd4783e65e93fecb81aa20c61196","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/a53ee6a4fef0dd4783e65e93fecb81aa20c61196"}],"sha":"3b439b593bfb7c7bdbda4b6538ea5690a05c6d16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/3b439b593bfb7c7bdbda4b6538ea5690a05c6d16"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/a53ee6a4fef0dd4783e65e93fecb81aa20c61196/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T17:18:37Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T17:18:37Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(content): make the write gate fail closed without deadlocking\n\nrequireVerifiedEmail failed open on a missing org_users row, an absent\ntenant D1 binding, and any D1 error. Closing it as reviewed would have\nshipped a deadlock: POST /:slug/editions was the only route that\nrepaired a missing row (via ensureOrgUser), and it sat *behind* the\ngate. A tenant with no row would 503 in the middleware, so the handler\nnever ran, so the row was never created, so the next request 503''d\nagain — permanently, with no user-facing recovery. The other five\nguarded routes never repaired anything at all.\n\nMoves ensureOrgUser out of editions.ts into middleware.ts and runs it\ninside the gate, before the verification decision, so all six guarded\nroutes repair a missing row instead of one. The gate then fails CLOSED\nwith 503 VERIFICATION_UNAVAILABLE when the flag genuinely cannot be\nread: missing binding, D1 error, or a row still absent after backfill.\n\nFailing closed costs nothing the caller had. Every guarded handler\ncalls getTenantDb itself and throws when the binding is missing, so a\nrequest the gate turns away was already going to fail downstream — the\nchange is 503 instead of 500, not access instead of no access. 503\nrather than 403 keeps \"we could not check\" distinct from \"you are\nunverified\", so a publisher is never told to go verify an address when\nnothing is wrong with it.\n\nensureOrgUser no longer swallows its errors. Previously a failed\nbackfill was logged and execution continued into an edition INSERT that\nthen violated the created_by foreign key, surfacing as an opaque 500.\n\nDrops the now-redundant ensureOrgUser call from the editions handler —\nthe middleware guarantees the row before created_by is used.\n\nAdds a VERIFICATION_UNAVAILABLE branch to the portal''s sentinel\ntranslation so the 503 reads as retryable rather than leaking the\nsentinel or implying an unverified address.","tree":{"sha":"ce33be50bed71c23501b7980a09c3f195e11e31b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/ce33be50bed71c23501b7980a09c3f195e11e31b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/a53ee6a4fef0dd4783e65e93fecb81aa20c61196","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/a53ee6a4fef0dd4783e65e93fecb81aa20c61196","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGE1M2VlNmE0ZmVmMGRkNDc4M2U2NWU5M2ZlY2I4MWFhMjBjNjExOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/91c6fabee2a3e5d7c3f9ad9b37b98d3181396d1f","sha":"91c6fabee2a3e5d7c3f9ad9b37b98d3181396d1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/91c6fabee2a3e5d7c3f9ad9b37b98d3181396d1f"}],"sha":"a53ee6a4fef0dd4783e65e93fecb81aa20c61196","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/a53ee6a4fef0dd4783e65e93fecb81aa20c61196"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107689613?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vincenzo-Verma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vincenzo-Verma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vincenzo-Verma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vincenzo-Verma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vincenzo-Verma","id":107689613,"login":"Vincenzo-Verma","node_id":"U_kgDOBms2jQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vincenzo-Verma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vincenzo-Verma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vincenzo-Verma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vincenzo-Verma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vincenzo-Verma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vincenzo-Verma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/ad2c9e7ccc0eeeeeafdd6d6bedbeb1338c8ef9dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T16:34:06Z","email":"utk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"Utkrisht Verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T16:34:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #22 from utility-crm/ci/npm-cache\n\nci: cache npm dependencies in workflows","tree":{"sha":"7ee6e95f75c367d825bf940e61d3c2f0f194c638","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/7ee6e95f75c367d825bf940e61d3c2f0f194c638"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/ad2c9e7ccc0eeeeeafdd6d6bedbeb1338c8ef9dd","verification":{"payload":"tree 7ee6e95f75c367d825bf940e61d3c2f0f194c638\nparent 64354c3da2d2bd47c5f1a6b9fff00f4e98970a9a\nparent 335a0bd2c85213c2c9a671cea12697643977ca0f\nauthor Utkrisht Verma <utk.rs.verma@gmail.com> 1785602046 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785602046 +0530\n\nMerge pull request #22 from utility-crm/ci/npm-cache\n\nci: cache npm dependencies in workflows","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbh/+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAV74QAKkey7ofw8ZBol2kiT4wMa5i\nG+ULg23iPxnjMvut0cM38EJ1IIKfFE3422pWOeC5hps2Ut0+Dgit/GYbHTsAqlQp\nzhHDwR2/r/XeOIyfGbNEOSZsm8NxMEOZqm1fEOEmso9qzJ3vZs/pGHWaoisq8Ovn\nVuT2sPq/r413d+QsV766zrsV3LD+Zw8kN3JDImWjcpC1H5QtL9FCInoh48iZyJ8U\nTCjat63ADyFwNimm+xwOrFB5+qnoSpOY3NO0ca8wBtn4BMJRuI33BCVut3irc0zD\n1Po2YW5tlXO9ElJ78UqdExXhpDZLOT8CksYRmI68q+JIVPLzl0/p2/dWfgSVkGcR\nHMsJ2unRg3H6IjqUPvZqjNRHL5rmWStcbUWFw6Yqp0NKzXcC/XgJqQILkskRIIE2\nqbB/ajGYtc3AzGWORyTWA6wU5dGGqjo4DM6G2BbGgRcpfQK5cAdwzKJethq9Ntj0\n1Ae9bLue/2v72YafNxv28MLZZniwZX59h3ruZK37/m1r7d0rOD2vxu4QxKmJiyfJ\nHBm9WrZqHtMYmTY9ag1ast1DjJMaQ1mQZDFMQlKmW/EaAiT5sDygP0IgQJCSvg7B\nIyyPBOAzha+olEHrDdUcgHX3NurJxNjNAe0bA9p1r2nIiCRFf5HYMsprL/vED7yn\nvNEKcexR0/fpPe+8giLT\n=ifIy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T16:34:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/ad2c9e7ccc0eeeeeafdd6d6bedbeb1338c8ef9dd","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGFkMmM5ZTdjY2MwZWVlZWVhZmRkNmQ2YmVkYmViMTMzOGM4ZWY5ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/64354c3da2d2bd47c5f1a6b9fff00f4e98970a9a","sha":"64354c3da2d2bd47c5f1a6b9fff00f4e98970a9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/64354c3da2d2bd47c5f1a6b9fff00f4e98970a9a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/335a0bd2c85213c2c9a671cea12697643977ca0f","sha":"335a0bd2c85213c2c9a671cea12697643977ca0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/335a0bd2c85213c2c9a671cea12697643977ca0f"}],"sha":"ad2c9e7ccc0eeeeeafdd6d6bedbeb1338c8ef9dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/ad2c9e7ccc0eeeeeafdd6d6bedbeb1338c8ef9dd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/335a0bd2c85213c2c9a671cea12697643977ca0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T16:30:44Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T16:30:44Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"ci: cache npm dependencies in workflows\n\nAll ten jobs already run on blacksmith-4vcpu-ubuntu-2404, but no\nsetup-node block asked for dependency caching, so every one of the\neight `npm ci` steps did a cold install from the registry on each run.\nsetup-node only touches the cache backend when `cache:` is set — the\nrunner migration alone does not enable it.\n\nAdds `cache: ''npm''` to the eight setup-node blocks that are followed by\n`npm ci`. The root package-lock.json is the hash key; no\ncache-dependency-path is needed because the npm workspaces install is\ndriven from that single lockfile.\n\ndeploy.yml''s validate-bindings job is deliberately left uncached: it\nruns `node scripts/validate-bindings.js` with no install step, so there\nwould be nothing to restore.\n\nBiggest win is deploy-workers, a six-way matrix that was doing six\nindependent cold installs of the full workspace tree per deploy.","tree":{"sha":"7ee6e95f75c367d825bf940e61d3c2f0f194c638","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/7ee6e95f75c367d825bf940e61d3c2f0f194c638"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/335a0bd2c85213c2c9a671cea12697643977ca0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/335a0bd2c85213c2c9a671cea12697643977ca0f","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDMzNWEwYmQyYzg1MjEzYzJjOWE2NzFjZWExMjY5NzY0Mzk3N2NhMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/64354c3da2d2bd47c5f1a6b9fff00f4e98970a9a","sha":"64354c3da2d2bd47c5f1a6b9fff00f4e98970a9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/64354c3da2d2bd47c5f1a6b9fff00f4e98970a9a"}],"sha":"335a0bd2c85213c2c9a671cea12697643977ca0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/335a0bd2c85213c2c9a671cea12697643977ca0f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/91c6fabee2a3e5d7c3f9ad9b37b98d3181396d1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T15:56:57Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T15:56:57Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(crm): use new-password autocomplete during initial superadmin setup\n\nThe password field was hardcoded autoComplete=\"current-password\", so on the\ninitial-setup path (isSetup false, submits to /setup) password managers offered\nto autofill a saved credential instead of generating a new one.","tree":{"sha":"78aee904775b47cb131a