"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/2da78680387b00dd63c6ff53f67a48d9de279010","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDJkYTc4NjgwMzg3YjAwZGQ2M2M2ZmY1M2Y2N2E0OGQ5ZGUyNzkwMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/d6785befa6a0bdb45c85df9c5a73902e7df7d530","sha":"d6785befa6a0bdb45c85df9c5a73902e7df7d530","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/d6785befa6a0bdb45c85df9c5a73902e7df7d530"}],"sha":"2da78680387b00dd63c6ff53f67a48d9de279010","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/2da78680387b00dd63c6ff53f67a48d9de279010"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/cf23fd26c2ca7ad644952e31e0c7cd60da618986/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T15:56:03Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T15:56:03Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(crm): address tenant-subscription review findings\n\n- Convert datetime-local values to explicit UTC instants before POST/PATCH.\n  The widget emits a bare wall-clock string parsed as the operator''s local\n  time, while the worker pins bare values to UTC, so 14:00 IST was stored\n  as 14:00Z. Seed the extend field with the inverse conversion.\n- Render manual-window timestamps with timeZone: ''UTC'' so the display\n  matches the \"UTC\" label instead of showing local time under it.\n- encodeURIComponent the slug in the three tenant-subscription API methods.\n- Show the load error before the \"Tenant not found\" fallback; a failed\n  request left tenant null and misreported network/auth failures.\n- Replace native prompt()/confirm() with in-app dialogs: a datetime-local\n  extend modal and ConfirmModal for deactivation.\n- Modal a11y: role=\"dialog\", aria-modal, aria-label, focus-on-open, and\n  Escape-to-close that is suppressed while a request is in flight.\n- Drop the stale INTERNAL_SECRET binding from the admin worker Env; the\n  internal billing-tenant routes it gated no longer exist.","tree":{"sha":"71afd9000ad7b63bfaabf2c766e097855f8076b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/71afd9000ad7b63bfaabf2c766e097855f8076b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/cf23fd26c2ca7ad644952e31e0c7cd60da618986","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/cf23fd26c2ca7ad644952e31e0c7cd60da618986","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGNmMjNmZDI2YzJjYTdhZDY0NDk1MmUzMWUwYzdjZDYwZGE2MTg5ODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/262ed1eac4329f932d8c22f8306e0a1b545089f0","sha":"262ed1eac4329f932d8c22f8306e0a1b545089f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/262ed1eac4329f932d8c22f8306e0a1b545089f0"}],"sha":"cf23fd26c2ca7ad644952e31e0c7cd60da618986","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/cf23fd26c2ca7ad644952e31e0c7cd60da618986"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/262ed1eac4329f932d8c22f8306e0a1b545089f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T13:05:39Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T13:07:31Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"feat(admin): publisher subscription control with manual grants\n\nSuperadmin can now grant, extend, and deactivate publisher subscriptions\nto the platform with explicit UTC windows — for publications paying offline\n(cheque, bank transfer, enterprise contract) or on a pilot.\n\n- workers/admin/src/tenant-subs.ts: GET/POST/PATCH /:slug routes, guarded\n  by adminAuth + requireSuperadmin. POST validates plan against platform_tiers\n  and rejects 409 if razorpay_sub_id is set. PATCH shifts end_at or drops to\n  Free immediately. Both write audit.\n- workers/admin/src/index.ts: wire tenantSubsRouter, call sweepExpiredTenantGrants\n  from scheduled() on existing 5-minute cron.\n- migrations/control/0014_tenant_manual_subs.sql: manual_until, manual_since,\n  manual_granted_by, manual_note on tenants + index for sweep.\n- frontend/crm: TenantSubscriptionPage.tsx reached from tenant detail Plan &\n  Billing card, three crmApi methods, datetime-local inputs labelled UTC.\n\nReader subscriptions remain publisher-only. Deleted misaimed superadmin routes:\n- workers/admin/src/subscriptions.ts (whole file)\n- frontend/crm/src/pages/SubscriptionManagePage.tsx (whole file)\n- BILLING_TENANT service binding from workers/admin/wrangler.jsonc\n- Internal routes from workers/billing-tenant/src/admin-grants.ts\n\nSweep verified against real SQLite: expired manual grant downgraded, future/\nmandate/no-grant rows untouched. Typecheck clean in all three workspaces.","tree":{"sha":"24433aed63d7316793bc2ce365002298240bc49a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/24433aed63d7316793bc2ce365002298240bc49a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/262ed1eac4329f932d8c22f8306e0a1b545089f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/262ed1eac4329f932d8c22f8306e0a1b545089f0","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDI2MmVkMWVhYzQzMjlmOTMyZDhjMjJmODMwNmUwYTFiNTQ1MDg5ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/d6785befa6a0bdb45c85df9c5a73902e7df7d530","sha":"d6785befa6a0bdb45c85df9c5a73902e7df7d530","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/d6785befa6a0bdb45c85df9c5a73902e7df7d530"}],"sha":"262ed1eac4329f932d8c22f8306e0a1b545089f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/262ed1eac4329f932d8c22f8306e0a1b545089f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119118769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esoteric-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esoteric-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esoteric-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esoteric-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/esoteric-dev","id":119118769,"login":"esoteric-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOBxmbsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esoteric-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esoteric-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esoteric-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esoteric-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.githu