KyJdoAKDlhZGMzMWQ3ZjJkNjFhMDRmNWZlNmU3Y2E0YTU2YmRmODdjZjVlMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/e6db3ee95369879685024ecc7b06b2ca80b58020","sha":"e6db3ee95369879685024ecc7b06b2ca80b58020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/e6db3ee95369879685024ecc7b06b2ca80b58020"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/de6ccbc25dd2624649cb76972c43aab5af8d9136","sha":"de6ccbc25dd2624649cb76972c43aab5af8d9136","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/de6ccbc25dd2624649cb76972c43aab5af8d9136"}],"sha":"9adc31d7f2d61a04f5fe6e7ca4a56bdf87cf5e06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/9adc31d7f2d61a04f5fe6e7ca4a56bdf87cf5e06"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/de6ccbc25dd2624649cb76972c43aab5af8d9136/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T15:30:15Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T15:30:15Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"ci: fail closed on ledger lookup errors, drop unprovable 0003 baseline\n\nThree fixes to the migration ledger work:\n\nLedger lookups failed open. `|| echo \"\"` turned a network, auth, or SQL error\ninto \"migration not applied\", which re-runs non-idempotent DDL against a\ndatabase that already has it. All three lookups (both workflow loops and\nmigrate-all-tenants.sh) now abort instead: the control job and the script exit 1,\nthe tenant loop sets TENANT_FAILED and breaks so the summary reports it. Only a\nsuccessful query returning no row means \"not applied\". 2>/dev/null is gone so\nwrangler''s own error is visible.\n\nThe temp file in migrate-all-tenants.sh leaked whenever the apply failed, since\nset -e skips the following rm. Added a trap on EXIT.\n\n0003_restructure_epapers.sql was baselined on the presence of the epapers table,\nbut 0001_init.sql already creates that table, so the guard was true on every\ndatabase and proved nothing. 0003 has no durable invariant to test — its only\nschema effect is CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS epapers, a no-op after 0001, and its\ncolumn drops are commented out. Removed the entry rather than guess. Both apply\nloops skip *0003_* as legacy, so nothing reads it.\n\nVerified with the repo''s own migrations against real sqlite (fresh 0 rows, full\n12, partial 8, idempotent on re-run, control still 8, partial DB applies only\nthe four outstanding migrations then no-ops) plus a stubbed wrangler proving no\napply happens after a failed lookup and that the temp file is removed when the\napply fails.","tree":{"sha":"ad52ca3b30b5eac567a6f38d44d07f2dc164268a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/ad52ca3b30b5eac567a6f38d44d07f2dc164268a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/de6ccbc25dd2624649cb76972c43aab5af8d9136","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/de6ccbc25dd2624649cb76972c43aab5af8d9136","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGRlNmNjYmMyNWRkMjYyNDY0OWNiNzY5NzJjNDNhYWI1YWY4ZDkxMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/11399b8bbf4e014a3c4b3f1a391161584e3a993e","sha":"11399b8bbf4e014a3c4b3f1a391161584e3a993e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/11399b8bbf4e014a3c4b3f1a391161584e3a993e"}],"sha":"de6ccbc25dd2624649cb76972c43aab5af8d9136","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/de6ccbc25dd2624649cb76972c43aab5af8d9136"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/11399b8bbf4e014a3c4b3f1a391161584e3a993e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T15:05:39Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T15:05:39Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"ci: baseline _migrations from live schema before ledger-based migration\n\nExisting control and tenant databases were migrated before the _migrations\nledger existed, so their ledger is empty. Skipping purely on the ledger would\nre-apply every historical file, and the non-idempotent ones (bare ADD COLUMN\nin control 0002/0003/0004/0010 and tenant 0004/0005/0006/0008/0009/0010) would\nerror and fail the job.\n\nscripts/baseline/{control,tenant}.sql create the ledger and record a migration\nonly when the schema object it introduces is actually present, checked against\nsqlite_master (whose stored DDL text is rewritten by ADD COLUMN and RENAME TO,\nso no PRAGMA support is needed). Nothing is marked complete on faith and a\nfresh database records nothing at all. Tenant 0003_restructure_epapers.sql is\nrecorded as the historical boundary whenever the epapers table exists, matching\nthe legacy skip in the apply loops.\n\nThe baselines are idempotent, so both workflow jobs and migrate-all-tenants.sh\nrun them in place of the previous bare CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS bootstrap,\nwith no one-shot flag or manual step. Ledger-based execution for migrations not\ncovered by the baseline is unchanged.\n\nVerified against real sqlite with the repo''s own migrations: fresh DBs record 0\nrows, fully migrated DBs record 8 (control) and 13 (tenant), partially migrated\nDBs record exactly the applied prefix, re-running the baseline adds no\nduplicates, and a partial DB plus baseline applies only the four outstanding\nmigrations and is a no-op on the next run.","tree":{"sha":"e9c0a014719d214629fd62be96db84f9bd28633c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/e9c0a014719d214629fd62be96db84f9bd28633c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/11399b8bbf4e014a3c4b3f1a391161584e3a993e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/11399b8bbf4e014a3c4b3f1a391161584e3a993e","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDExMzk5YjhiYmY0ZTAxNGEzYzRiM2YxYTM5MTE2MTU4NGUzYTk5M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/f0bf4a842c015077022c8f45ddf75f39c6cd0b58","sha":"f0bf4a842c015077022c8f45ddf75f39c6cd0b58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/f0bf4a842c015077022c8f45ddf75f39c6cd0b58"}],"sha":"11399b8bbf4e014a3c4b3f1a391161584e3a993e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/11399b8bbf4e014a3c4b3f1a391161584e3a993e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/f0bf4a842c015077022c8f45ddf75f39c6cd0b58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T14:56:17Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T14:56:17Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"ci: use _migrations ledger in migration workflow instead of stderr matching\n\nBoth the control and tenant apply loops now bootstrap a _migrations table,\nskip files already recorded there, and apply the migration SQL plus its\nledger INSERT in a single wrangler --file call. D1 runs a multi-statement\nfile as one transaction, so a failed or partially applied file is never\nmarked complete. Drops the duplicate-column/already-exists stderr string\nmatching, matching scripts/migrate-all-tenants.sh.","tree":{"sha":"9cad118744a3a9f6d3b48d228392c36f7dace4e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/9cad118744a3a9f6d3b48d228392c36f7dace4e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/f0bf4a842c015077022c8f45ddf75f39c6cd0b58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/f0bf4a842c015077022c8f45ddf75f39c6cd0b58","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGYwYmY0YTg0MmMwMTUwNzcwMjJjOGY0NWRkZjc1ZjM5YzZjZDBiNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/202694597bd2f49f2e667ab641e6cb5e7c92ae90","sha":"202694597bd2f49f2e667ab641e6cb5e7c92ae90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/202694597bd2f49f2e667ab641e6cb5e7c92ae90"}],"sha":"f0bf4a842c015077022c8f45ddf75f39c6cd0b58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/f0bf4a842c015077022c8f45ddf75f39c6cd0b58"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/202694597bd2f49f2e667ab641e6cb5e7c92ae90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T14:16:01Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T14:16:01Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix: address auth-mail review findings\n\nBackend\n- billing-tenant: drop the email_verified gate on subscribe. Reader\n  verification is soft by design — nothing may block subscribing.\n- sms-billing: bind amount_paise in the persist/finalize UPDATEs (it was\n  set but never bound) and abort before advancing the cycle marker when\n  the reservation row is missing.\n- auth/profile: getTenantDb throws on a missing binding, so catch it and\n  return 409 \"still provisioning\" instead of falling through to a 500.\n- auth/verify-email: canonicalise (trim + lowercase) the email before\n  throttling, tenant lookup and owner read.\n- content/reader: send reset mail via waitUntil so response time no\n  longer leaks whether the address exists; drop the fail-fast on\n  PUBLIC_API_BASE (mail is soft and degrades on its own) and remove the\n  orphaned GET /:slug/verify-email handler whose JWT aud is never minted.\n- content: sweep consumed/expired auth_tokens in the scheduled job.\n- auth-mail: don''t read the Resend error body into the log line.\n\nMigrations / CI\n- 0012 (control + tenant): index auth_tokens(expires_at) for the sweep.\n- migrate-all-tenants.sh: skip legacy 0003 files and apply each migration\n  with its ledger insert in one wrangler call, so a crash can''t leave the\n  schema applied but the ledger stale.\n- apply-migrations.yml: tolerate \"already exists\" / \"duplicate column\"\n  on re-runs in both the control and tenant loops; still hard-fail on\n  anything else. Neither loop keeps a ledger, so a re-run hit them both.\n\nFrontend\n- ProvisioningScreen: only claim a verification mail was sent for\n  email+password signups. Google and phone identities are verified by\n  Firebase and are never mailed.\n- ReaderAccount: only show \"sent\" when the resend actually succeeded, and\n  clear the busy flag on failure.\n- AuthResetPage / AuthVerifyPage: label htmlFor -> input id.\n\nRepo\n- Untrack the eight accidental .claude/worktrees gitlinks and ignore the\n  directory.","tree":{"sha":"50be132836e51bbd5e9f7ccf4d4c84954f53d6e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/50be132836e51bbd5e9f7ccf4d4c84954f53d6e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/202694597bd2f49f2e667ab641e6cb5e7c92ae90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/202694597bd2f49f2e667ab641e6cb5e7c92ae90","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDIwMjY5NDU5N2JkMmY0OWYyZTY2N2FiNjQxZTZjYjVlN2M5MmFlOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/93bcc389bf2bc0da4759165cb6030ab1fc3f769e","sha":"93bcc389bf2bc0da4759165cb6030ab1fc3f769e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/93bcc389bf2bc0da4759165cb6030ab1fc3f769e"}],"sha":"202694597bd2f49f2e667ab641e6cb5e7c92ae90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/202694597bd2f49f2e667ab641e6cb5e7c92ae90"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/93bcc389bf2bc0da4759165cb6030ab1fc3f769e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:24:44Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:24:44Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"Merge remote-tracking branch ''origin/main'' into feat/support-engine\n\n# Conflicts:\n#\tworkers/content/src/reader.ts","tree":{"sha":"55d8458b53f36802b89fc9304cd19973dd429908","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/55d8458b53f36802b89fc9304cd19973dd429908"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/93bcc389bf2bc0da4759165cb6030ab1fc3f769e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/93bcc389bf2bc0da4759165cb6030ab1fc3f769e","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDkzYmNjMzg5YmYyYmMwZGE0NzU5MTY1Y2I2MDMwYWIxZmMzZjc2OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/e85eb0c5ea94c340366dc321abf70a42f84c75f0","sha":"e85eb0c5ea94c340366dc321abf70a42f84c75f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/e85eb0c5ea94c340366dc321abf70a42f84c75f0"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/e6db3ee95369879685024ecc7b06b2ca80b58020","sha":"e6db3ee95369879685024ecc7b06b2ca80b58020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/e6db3ee95369879685024ecc7b06b2ca80b58020"}],"sha":"93bcc389bf2bc0da4759165cb6030ab1fc3f769e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/93bcc389bf2bc0da4759165cb6030ab1fc3f769e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/e85eb0c5ea94c340366dc321abf70a42f84c75f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:13:55Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:15:13Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(reader): normalize datetime in /me sub check, guard email_verified reads for pre-0011 tenants\n\n- /me subscription query: datetime(current_end) > CURRENT_TIMESTAMP (ISO\n  string vs SQLite datetime compared wrong, per known repo pitfall)\n- guard SELECT email_verified in /me and verify-email/send with .catch(() => null)\n  so a tenant DB predating migration 0011 (no email_verified column) still\n  serves the account page and just omits the verify banner","tree":{"sha":"55d8458b53f36802b89fc9304cd19973dd429908","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/55d8458b53f36802b89fc9304cd19973dd429908"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/e85eb0c5ea94c340366dc321abf70a42f84c75f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/e85eb0c5ea94c340366dc321abf70a42f84c75f0","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGU4NWViMGM1ZWE5NGMzNDAzNjZkYzMyMWFiZjcwYTQyZjg0Yzc1ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/8ad5d1ae28797748383e97b12a1d9d66122cba08","sha":"8ad5d1ae28797748383e97b12a1d9d66122cba08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/8ad5d1ae28797748383e97b12a1d9d66122cba08"}],"sha":"e85eb0c5ea94c340366dc321abf70a42f84c75f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/e85eb0c5ea94c340366dc321abf70a42f84c75f0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/8ad5d1ae28797748383e97b12a1d9d66122cba08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T08:07:15Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:15:13Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"chore: resolve merge conflict in reader.ts (keep auth-mail refactor)","tree":{"sha":"8168c624d423ec99ed1117b6d4d5a589e21bea7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/8168c624d423ec99ed1117b6d4d5a589e21bea7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/8ad5d1ae28797748383e97b12a1d9d66122cba08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/8ad5d1ae28797748383e97b12a1d9d66122cba08","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDhhZDVkMWFlMjg3OTc3NDgzODNlOTdiMTJhMWQ5ZDY2MTIyY2JhMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/c3bc70214b4506a99d789d7ba57c99bb69d4693a","sha":"c3bc70214b4506a99d789d7ba57c99bb69d4693a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/c3bc70214b4506a99d789d7ba57c99bb69d4693a"}],"sha":"8ad5d1ae28797748383e97b12a1d9d66122cba08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/8ad5d1ae28797748383e97b12a1d9d66122cba08"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/c3bc70214b4506a99d789d7ba57c99bb69d4693a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T08:05:23Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:15:13Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"ci: validate tenant DB bindings are consistent across all workers\n\nAdds scripts/validate-bindings.js which cross-checks that every per-tenant\n_DB binding injected by inject-binding.js is present in all three wrangler\nconfigs (content, billing-tenant, auth). A binding missing from any one\nworker causes silent runtime errors for that tenant — this is exactly what\ncaused the speaktheworld 401 (the auth worker was skipped during injection).\n\nThe check is wired in two places:\n- provision-tenant.yml: runs immediately after inject-binding.js and again\n  inside the commit-push retry loop, blocking deployment if injection was\n  incomplete.\n- deploy.yml: a pre-flight validate-bindings job that all worker deployments\n  depend on, catching any manual edits that break parity.","tree":{"sha":"980e33915486d3cbafb92249916ec4e8a917c944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/980e33915486d3cbafb92249916ec4e8a917c944"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/c3bc70214b4506a99d789d7ba57c99bb69d4693a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/c3bc70214b4506a99d789d7ba57c99bb69d4693a","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGMzYmM3MDIxNGI0NTA2YTk5ZDc4OWQ3YmE1N2M5OWJiNjlkNDY5M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/84fc1070a0cf4312a5a58fed04c3a80d1fd3bbca","sha":"84fc1070a0cf4312a5a58fed04c3a80d1fd3bbca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/84fc1070a0cf4312a5a58fed04c3a80d1fd3bbca"}],"sha":"c3bc70214b4506a99d789d7ba57c99bb69d4693a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/c3bc70214b4506a99d789d7ba57c99bb69d4693a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/84fc1070a0cf4312a5a58fed04c3a80d1fd3bbca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:13:23Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:15:13Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(content): normalize ISO timestamp for SQLite datetime comparison in subscription check\n\ndatetime() cannot parse milliseconds+Z suffix; substr(current_end,1,19) strips them.\nAlso add scripts/migrate-all-tenants.sh for future tenant DB migrations.","tree":{"sha":"567b1aa6e4d5f