le.\nFails open on storage error so real signups are never blocked.\nAdd RATE_LIMITED to shared ErrorCode enum.","tree":{"sha":"e47ebf3e35b39eedefbbfae8c3031f4f815edc02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/e47ebf3e35b39eedefbbfae8c3031f4f815edc02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/db962ff14ecedc35c1f3ad22e4839cc822bb9747","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/db962ff14ecedc35c1f3ad22e4839cc822bb9747","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGRiOTYyZmYxNGVjZWRjMzVjMWYzYWQyMmU0ODM5Y2M4MjJiYjk3NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/ab5912ecee552269d705d068e918704801e4f093","sha":"ab5912ecee552269d705d068e918704801e4f093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/ab5912ecee552269d705d068e918704801e4f093"}],"sha":"db962ff14ecedc35c1f3ad22e4839cc822bb9747","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/db962ff14ecedc35c1f3ad22e4839cc822bb9747"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/ab5912ecee552269d705d068e918704801e4f093/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T10:32:57Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:15:13Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(reader-auth): address second review round\n\n- signup: fix tenant_settings column (name -> org_name) that threw post-insert,\n  causing orphan reader + misleading 404 + ''already registered'' on retry\n- signup: require PUBLIC_API_BASE before INSERT (500 config error) instead of\n  creating an unverifiable reader with no verification link\n- signup: drop escapeHtml from plain-text email subject (kept for HTML body)\n- verify-email: add idempotent ALTER TABLE to backfill email_verified on\n  pre-0011 tenants before the UPDATE","tree":{"sha":"f3fc53dcca625e35ff00e215222d5be771519d93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/f3fc53dcca625e35ff00e215222d5be771519d93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/ab5912ecee552269d705d068e918704801e4f093","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/ab5912ecee552269d705d068e918704801e4f093","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGFiNTkxMmVjZWU1NTIyNjlkNzA1ZDA2OGU5MTg3MDQ4MDFlNGYwOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/198ffe415eaa81f02d85714a6c12b1a8ce6933f8","sha":"198ffe415eaa81f02d85714a6c12b1a8ce6933f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/198ffe415eaa81f02d85714a6c12b1a8ce6933f8"}],"sha":"ab5912ecee552269d705d068e918704801e4f093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/ab5912ecee552269d705d068e918704801e4f093"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/198ffe415eaa81f02d85714a6c12b1a8ce6933f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T10:00:51Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:15:13Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(reader-auth): address PR review findings\n\n- email.ts: align signature with billing-tenant (object param, fromName/replyTo/tags),\n  add AbortController timeout (10s), sanitize error log (status only, no body),\n  add escapeHtml helper\n- reader.ts: fix tenant_settings query id ''1'' -> ''singleton'', require PUBLIC_API_BASE\n  before constructing verify URL (fail silent when unconfigured), use waitUntil for\n  non-blocking email send, escape name/pubName in HTML body\n- billing-tenant: fail closed on missing reader row (null -> 403), add idempotent\n  ALTER TABLE to backfill email_verified on pre-0011 tenants before querying it","tree":{"sha":"b7ab59a51e5a63ee9f4dbf7551cc115b6da08250","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/b7ab59a51e5a63ee9f4dbf7551cc115b6da08250"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/198ffe415eaa81f02d85714a6c12b1a8ce6933f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/198ffe415eaa81f02d85714a6c12b1a8ce6933f8","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDE5OGZmZTQxNWVhYTgxZjAyZDg1NzE0YTZjMTJiMWE4Y2U2OTMzZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/5dca67befc2a3b2e869fb60adb9b4727323ece42","sha":"5dca67befc2a3b2e869fb60adb9b4727323ece42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/5dca67befc2a3b2e869fb60adb9b4727323ece42"}],"sha":"198ffe415eaa81f02d85714a6c12b1a8ce6933f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/198ffe415eaa81f02d85714a6c12b1a8ce6933f8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/5dca67befc2a3b2e869fb60adb9b4727323ece42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T09:26:28Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:15:13Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(reader-auth): guard null Firebase auth + send verification email on signup\n\n- ReaderAuthDialog: guard auth null before signInWithPopup; show clear error\n  instead of crashing when VITE_FIREBASE_* env vars are missing at build time\n- content worker: send verification email via Resend on email/password signup;\n  add GET /:slug/verify-email endpoint to set email_verified=1\n- billing-tenant: block /reader/subscribe if email_verified=0 with 403","tree":{"sha":"99b368accb4938ba3f6d114d3b