09:02Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"ci: validate tenant DB bindings are consistent across all workers\n\nAdds scripts/validate-bindings.js which cross-checks that every per-tenant\n_DB binding injected by inject-binding.js is present in all three wrangler\nconfigs (content, billing-tenant, auth). A binding missing from any one\nworker causes silent runtime errors for that tenant — this is exactly what\ncaused the speaktheworld 401 (the auth worker was skipped during injection).\n\nThe check is wired in two places:\n- provision-tenant.yml: runs immediately after inject-binding.js and again\n  inside the commit-push retry loop, blocking deployment if injection was\n  incomplete.\n- deploy.yml: a pre-flight validate-bindings job that all worker deployments\n  depend on, catching any manual edits that break parity.","tree":{"sha":"e1fd64e8029046403b4f58b471d5665d03aa05e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/e1fd64e8029046403b4f58b471d5665d03aa05e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/e6db3ee95369879685024ecc7b06b2ca80b58020","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/e6db3ee95369879685024ecc7b06b2ca80b58020","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGU2ZGIzZWU5NTM2OTg3OTY4NTAyNGVjYzdiMDZiMmNhODBiNTgwMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/ea5818dac186296a0e6ff6d027e02612b0a39589","sha":"ea5818dac186296a0e6ff6d027e02612b0a39589","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/ea5818dac186296a0e6ff6d027e02612b0a39589"}],"sha":"e6db3ee95369879685024ecc7b06b2ca80b58020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/e6db3ee95369879685024ecc7b06b2ca80b58020"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119118769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.githu