f2a779e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/7c720c77c083459f35587017e13ef68c63a7fad1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T10:32:57Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T10:32:57Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(reader-auth): address second review round\n\n- signup: fix tenant_settings column (name -> org_name) that threw post-insert,\n  causing orphan reader + misleading 404 + ''already registered'' on retry\n- signup: require PUBLIC_API_BASE before INSERT (500 config error) instead of\n  creating an unverifiable reader with no verification link\n- signup: drop escapeHtml from plain-text email subject (kept for HTML body)\n- verify-email: add idempotent ALTER TABLE to backfill email_verified on\n  pre-0011 tenants before the UPDATE","tree":{"sha":"f3fc53dcca625e35ff00e215222d5be771519d93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/f3fc53dcca625e35ff00e215222d5be771519d93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/7c720c77c083459f35587017e13ef68c63a7fad1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/7c720c77c083459f35587017e13ef68c63a7fad1","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDdjNzIwYzc3YzA4MzQ1OWYzNTU4NzAxN2UxM2VmNjhjNjNhN2ZhZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/3646cce0318d0775e57f3e52c973f6e15ba80c48","sha":"3646cce0318d0775e57f3e52c973f6e15ba80c48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/3646cce0318d0775e57f3e52c973f6e15ba80c48"}],"sha":"7c720c77c083459f35587017e13ef68c63a7fad1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/7c720c77c083459f35587017e13ef68c63a7fad1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/3646cce0318d0775e57f3e52c973f6e15ba80c48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T10:00:51Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T10:00:51Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(reader-auth): address PR review findings\n\n- email.ts: align signature with billing-tenant (object param, fromName/replyTo/tags),\n  add AbortController timeout (10s), sanitize error log (status only, no body),\n  add escapeHtml helper\n- reader.ts: fix tenant_settings query id ''1'' -> ''singleton'', require PUBLIC_API_BASE\n  before constructing verify URL (fail silent when unconfigured), use waitUntil for\n  non-blocking email send, escape name/pubName in HTML body\n- billing-tenant: fail closed on missing reader row (null -> 403), add idempotent\n  ALTER TABLE to backfill email_verified on pre-0011 tenants before querying it","tree":{"sha":"b7ab59a51e5a63ee9f4dbf7551cc115b6da08250","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/b7ab59a51e5a63ee9f4dbf7551cc115b6da08250"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/3646cce0318d0775e57f3e52c973f6e15ba80c48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/3646cce0318d0775e57f3e52c973f6e15ba80c48","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDM2NDZjY2UwMzE4ZDA3NzVlNTdmM2U1MmM5NzNmNmUxNWJhODBjNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/2d30310ed754138dc5b6272633382d0b936d4570","sha":"2d30310ed754138dc5b6272633382d0b936d4570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/2d30310ed754138dc5b6272633382d0b936d4570"}],"sha":"3646cce0318d0775e57f3e52c973f6e15ba80c48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/3646cce0318d0775e57f3e52c973f6e15ba80c48"},{"a