e":{"sha":"58bce529f058d6155d3bd53ef88bcb84b6967345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/58bce529f058d6155d3bd53ef88bcb84b6967345"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/e62dfd5376a0234e7898ccb9bbab40476d4877d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/e62dfd5376a0234e7898ccb9bbab40476d4877d0","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGU2MmRmZDUzNzZhMDIzNGU3ODk4Y2NiOWJiYWI0MDQ3NmQ0ODc3ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/d24e776c036b0d7690e19cfbcd7b8fc344dee3db","sha":"d24e776c036b0d7690e19cfbcd7b8fc344dee3db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/d24e776c036b0d7690e19cfbcd7b8fc344dee3db"}],"sha":"e62dfd5376a0234e7898ccb9bbab40476d4877d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/e62dfd5376a0234e7898ccb9bbab40476d4877d0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/d24e776c036b0d7690e19cfbcd7b8fc344dee3db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T12:47:55Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T12:47:55Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(review): address round-2 findings — signup race 409, migrate-owner upsert, FX timeouts/key, workflow hardening","tree":{"sha":"9a95abcdc3c6a9d97fa21a980da69bb9501c57b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/9a95abcdc3c6a9d97fa21a980da69bb9501c57b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/d24e776c036b0d7690e19cfbcd7b8fc344dee3db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/d24e776c036b0d7690e19cfbcd7b8fc344dee3db","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGQyNGU3NzZjMDM2YjBkNzY5MGUxOWNmYmNkN2I4ZmMzNDRkZWUzZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/ecae4719524413f085dc8c34ad8b7fb7b1ca6b23","sha":"ecae4719524413f085dc8c34ad8b7fb7b1ca6b23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/ecae4719524413f085dc8c34ad8b7fb7b1ca6b23"}],"sha":"d24e776c036b0d7690e19cfbcd7b8fc344dee3db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/d24e776c036b0d7690e19cfbcd7b8fc344dee3db"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/ecae4719524413f085dc8c34ad8b7fb7b1ca6b23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:26:55Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:26:55Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(auth,billing): address 7 code-review findings on PR #12\n\n1. reader-auth config check now FAILS CLOSED: operational D1 errors return 503\n   instead of falling through and allowing a disabled method; genuinely-missing\n   columns still yield safe defaults (SELECT * -> undefined, no throw).\n2. Billing signal moved off the forgeable public /audit/sms-send hook. Bill on a\n   new server-attributed ''auth.sms_billable'' event emitted only on a verified\n   reader phone-token exchange (slug from URL, not client body).\n3. profile add-phone no longer COALESCEs a mismatched uid: reject (409) when the\n   owner already has a different firebase_uid, so a linked phone can actually log in.\n4. SMS billing reserves the unique cycle key (INSERT OR IGNORE) BEFORE the Razorpay\n   call; only the winner creates an order; the reservation is released on order\n   failure. Closes the double-order race.\n5. Zero/sub-paise charges are recorded as a free period + advance the marker without\n   calling Razorpay, so a 0 rate can''t stall the window into a later catch-up charge.\n6. toBit coerces strictly to 0/1 (bools, 0/1, ''true''/''false''/''0''/''1''); unrecognized\n   values leave the flag unchanged — ''0''/''false'' no longer enable a method.\n7. Added idx_audit_billable(action, performed_by, created_at); the metering count no\n   longer full-scans audit_log per tenant.\n\nTypecheck clean: auth, content, billing-platform, admin, gateway.","tree":{"sha":"0736f5796229354cb044aeb3e7eac3eb2b0f8e63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/0736f5796229354cb044aeb3e7eac3eb2b0f8e63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/ecae4719524413f085dc8c34ad8b7fb7b1ca6b23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/ecae4719524413f085dc8c34ad8b7fb7b1ca6b23","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGVjYWU0NzE5NTI0NDEzZjA4NWRjOGMzNGFkOGI3ZmI3YjFjYTZiMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/cfece098ce6efd2fb6071360d952a85fea905b35","sha":"cfece098ce6efd2fb6071360d952a85fea905b35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/cfece098ce6efd2fb6071360d952a85fea905b35"}],"sha":"ecae4719524413f085dc8c34ad8b7fb7b1ca6b23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/ecae4719524413f085dc8c34ad8b7fb7b1ca6b23"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/cfece098ce6efd2fb6071360d952a85fea905b35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T12:09:34Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T12:09:34Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"feat(billing): metered SMS billing — $0.10/SMS, superadmin rate, monthly cron\n\nPass Firebase SMS cost through to publishers who enable reader phone (OTP) sign-in.\n\n- platform_config table (admin worker, runtime CREATE IF NOT EXISTS singleton):\n  sms_rate_usd (default 0.10) + usd_inr_fallback. Superadmin GET/PATCH at\n  /api/admin/platform-config, gated by DB-rechecked superadmin role (reuses the\n  tiers.ts pattern). Gateway now routes all /api/admin/* to admin.\n- sms-billing.ts (billing-platform): monthly cron sweep. Per active tenant, counts\n  READER-stage auth.sms_send_requested rows since tenants.sms_last_billed_at\n  (idempotent ALTER), converts count x rate x live USD->INR (exchangerate.host,\n  fallback to configured rate), creates a one-time Razorpay order, and records a\n  platform_billing_events row stamping count + exact FX rate + source.\n  Idempotency key sms-<tenantId>-<YYYY-MM> on the UNIQUE razorpay_event_id +\n  INSERT OR IGNORE + pre-check, so a re-run or overlapping cron can''t double-bill.\n  Per-tenant failures are isolated; the marker advances even on a 0-SMS cycle.\n- wrangler.jsonc: monthly cron ''7 3 1 * *''; scheduled handler added to export.\n- CRM SettingsPage: superadmin ''SMS Billing Rate'' card; crmApi.get/updatePlatformConfig.\n\nMetering scoped to reader-stage SMS (publisher''s own OTP isn''t billed to them).\nTypecheck clean: admin, billing-platform, gateway, crm.","tree":{"sha":"886363d8296186c851fc98c2248ad04aa5daf7d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/886363d8296186c851fc98c2248ad04aa5daf7d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/cfece098ce6efd2fb6071360d952a85fea905b35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/cfece098ce6efd2fb6071360d952a85fea905b35","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGNmZWNlMDk4Y2U2ZWZkMmZiNjA3MTM2MGQ5NTJhODVmZWE5MDViMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/bf2103ade47fc8776296cc193525c6dd6b5b6fa3","sha":"bf2103ade47fc8776296cc193525c6dd6b5b6fa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/bf2103ade47fc8776296cc193525c6dd6b5b6fa3"}],"sha":"cfece098ce6efd2fb6071360d952a85fea905b35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/cfece098ce6efd2fb6071360d952a85fea905b35"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/bf2103ade47fc8776296cc193525c6dd6b5b6fa3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:53:01Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:53:01Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"feat(auth): publisher self-service phone add + verify\n\nLet an authenticated publisher add and verify a phone number on their own\naccount via Firebase phone auth (SMS OTP proves control of the number).\n\n- auth/middleware.ts orgUserAuth now extracts userId from the JWT (was already\n  signed in, just not surfaced) — identifies which owner row to update.\n- New auth/profile.ts: GET /api/auth/profile (email/phone + verification state)\n  and POST /api/auth/add-phone (verifies Firebase token, links phone+firebase_uid).\n  Owner row resolved by tenant status: org_users (tenant DB) when active,\n  pending_owners (control DB) while provisioning — phone survives migration.\n  Rejects a number/uid already linked to another account (409).\n- Gateway needs no change: /api/auth/profile + /api/auth/add-phone already route\n  to AUTH_WORKER (not among the 3 admin-owned auth paths).\n- Portal SettingsPage: ''Your Profile'' card shows email/phone + verified badges;\n  Add-phone flow reuses PhoneAuthForm (stage=publisher). portalApi.getProfile/addPhone.\n\nTypecheck clean: auth, tenant-portal.","tree":{"sha":"1691467d27aab604318ee1550394a6bf96a0ab7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/1691467d27aab604318ee1550394a6bf96a0ab7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/bf2103ade47fc8776296cc193525c6dd6b5b6fa3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/bf2103ade47fc8776296cc193525c6dd6b5b6fa3","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGJmMjEwM2FkZTQ3ZmM4Nzc2Mjk2Y2MxOTM1MjVjNmRkNmI1YjZmYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/36f986a4cf28f77425c36bdc240ce377399ecdf4","sha":"36f986a4cf28f77425c36bdc240ce377399ecdf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/36f986a4cf28f77425c36bdc240ce377399ecdf4"}],"sha":"bf2103ade47fc8776296cc193525c6dd6b5b6fa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/bf2103ade47fc8776296cc193525c6dd6b5b6fa3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/36f986a4cf28f77425c36bdc240ce377399ecdf4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:20:09Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:20:09Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"feat(auth): publisher-configurable reader sign-in methods\n\nPublishers can now control which auth methods their readers see, via three\ntenant_settings flags (runtime-ALTER''d like the other settings columns; defaults\nOTP off / email on):\n- reader_auth_otp_enabled   — show SMS OTP\n- reader_auth_email_enabled — show email+password + Google\n- reader_auth_otp_only      — name+phone only, no email surface (implies OTP on)\n\n- settings.ts GET/PATCH read+persist the flags (0/1, COALESCE-preserving).\n- ReaderAuthDialog shows/hides Google, the method toggle, the email form, and the\n  login/signup link per config; OTP-only starts on the phone form.\n- Server-side enforcement (not just UI): reader-auth verify-firebase rejects a\n  phone token when OTP is off and an email/Google token when email is off;\n  content reader signup/login 403 when email is disabled. Defaults applied when\n  columns are absent so un-migrated tenants keep working.\n\nTypecheck clean: auth, content, tenant-portal.","tree":{"sha":"0d4e98f2adb03b0af973cffaab97d668ddd4e02a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/0d4e98f2adb03b0af973cffaab97d668ddd4e02a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/36f986a4cf28f77425c36bdc240ce377399ecdf4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/36f986a4cf28f77425c36bdc240ce377399ecdf4","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDM2Zjk4NmE0Y2YyOGY3NzQyNWMzNmJkYzI0MGNlMzc3Mzk5ZWNkZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/a01a1d7bf27886df149637538b08ecdeef736517","sha":"a01a1d7bf27886df149637538b08ecdeef736517","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/a01a1d7bf27886df149637538b08ecdeef736517"}],"sha":"36f986a4cf28f77425c36bdc240ce377399ecdf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/36f986a4cf28f77425c36bdc240ce377399ecdf4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/a01a1d7bf27886df149637538b08ecdeef736517/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:00:51Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:00:51Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(auth): Phase 2 — carry Firebase identity through activation, phone-only publisher login\n\n- migrate-owner (tenants.ts + content/internal.ts): forward and persist\n  firebase_uid/phone_number/email_verified/auth_provider onto org_users so\n  Google/phone owners can still log in after their tenant activates. Drop the\n  phantom pending_owners.role read (no such column; owner is always ''owner'').\n- verify-org (auth/firebase-auth.ts): look up tenant by phone when the token\n  carries no email claim — phone-only publishers were always 404ing.\n- SignupPage.tsx: stop sending the hardcoded firebase-phone@epaperspace.com\n  fallback email, which collided on the 2nd phone-only signup (it''s the tenant key).","tree":{"sha":"ed87408190b88c28376101845f78115e335c4d03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/ed87408190b88c28376101845f78115e335c4d03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/a01a1d7bf27886df149637538b08ecdeef736517","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/a01a1d7bf27886df149637538b08ecdeef736517","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGEwMWExZDdiZjI3ODg2ZGYxNDk2Mzc1MzhiMDhlY2RlZWY3MzY1MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/7831a6078caf2c40637c5e2008dd5480e914739d","sha":"7831a6078caf2c40637c5e2008dd5480e914739d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/7831a6078caf2c40637c5e2008dd5480e914739d"}],"sha":"a01a1d7bf27886df149637538b08ecdeef736517","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/a01a1d7bf27886df149637538b08ecdeef736517"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","re