zOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/3e9bdcccaecef1779b76d4bd1dff57f32ec51f05","sha":"3e9bdcccaecef1779b76d4bd1dff57f32ec51f05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/3e9bdcccaecef1779b76d4bd1dff57f32ec51f05"}],"sha":"7831a6078caf2c40637c5e2008dd5480e914739d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/7831a6078caf2c40637c5e2008dd5480e914739d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/3e9bdcccaecef1779b76d4bd1dff57f32ec51f05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T13:51:26Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T13:51:26Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(auth): address PR review — identity linking, auth-state guards, deploy ordering","tree":{"sha":"ed9f459dfe7c061c4ccc9e024c317ecc79969889","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/ed9f459dfe7c061c4ccc9e024c317ecc79969889"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/3e9bdcccaecef1779b76d4bd1dff57f32ec51f05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/3e9bdcccaecef1779b76d4bd1dff57f32ec51f05","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDNlOWJkY2NjYWVjZWYxNzc5Yjc2ZDRiZDFkZmY1N2YzMmVjNTFmMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/b47753b927e3e216a98f286b56b31feaa021e915","sha":"b47753b927e3e216a98f286b56b31feaa021e915","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/b47753b927e3e216a98f286b56b31feaa021e915"}],"sha":"3e9bdcccaecef1779b76d4bd1dff57f32ec51f05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/3e9bdcccaecef1779b76d4bd1dff57f32ec51f05"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/b47753b927e3e216a98f286b56b31feaa021e915/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T18:07:20Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T18:07:20Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"feat(auth): extract credential/token/firebase endpoints into dedicated epaper-auth worker\n\nIsolate the public auth attack surface (SMS pumping, token verification,\ncredential checks) into a new workers/auth so billing and content stay up\nand encapsulated if auth is DoS''d.\n\n- New epaper-auth worker owns /api/auth/* credential+token+firebase endpoints\n  (admin setup/login/me/admins, signup, org-login, verify-org, audit/sms-send)\n  plus reader /api/read/:slug/verify-firebase. Reads tenant DBs directly via\n  {SLUG}_DB bindings (getTenantDb), matching content/billing-tenant.\n- Provisioning-lifecycle endpoints (provision-status, reprovision,\n  verify-provisioning) stay on admin: coupled to PROVISION_WORKER + activation,\n  not sessions.\n- Gateway routes /api/auth/* to AUTH_WORKER except the 3 admin-owned paths, and\n  /api/read/*/verify-firebase to AUTH_WORKER.\n- Remove now-dead code from content (reader verify-firebase handler, internal\n  verify-owner/verify-firebase-owner) and admin (firebase-auth,\n  verifyFirebaseToken); migrate-owner kept on content.\n- inject/remove-binding.js, deploy matrix, and provision/deprovision workflows\n  updated to build+bind the auth worker.\n\nNote: epaper-auth requires ADMIN_JWT_SECRET and ORG_JWT_SECRET set via\nwrangler secret put before deploy (must match the other workers).","tree":{"sha":"3aa5f6baf7f65b641e4da576af776ec818788ef5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/3aa5f6baf7f65b641e4da576af776ec818788ef5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/b47753b927e3e216a98f286b56b31feaa021e915","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/b47753b927e3e216a98f286b56b31feaa021e915","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKGI0Nzc1M2I5MjdlM2UyMTZhOThmMjg2YjU2YjMxZmVhYTAyMWU5MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/9aca4ef2bd4038daade19cc0dd494a5b1159feca","sha":"9aca4ef2bd4038daade19cc0dd494a5b1159feca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/9aca4ef2bd4038daade19cc0dd494a5b1159feca"}],"sha":"b47753b927e3e216a98f286b56b31feaa021e915","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/b47753b927e3e216a98f286b56b31feaa021e915"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/9aca4ef2bd4038daade19cc0dd494a5b1159feca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T16:53:22Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T16:53:22Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(support): resolve type errors in support worker\n\n- add BILLING_API_URL?/SUPPORT_SMTP_API_KEY? to SupportEnv\n- type getOwnedTicket Context so .first<TicketRecord>() typechecks\n\nPart of Phase 0; these were left unstaged in the prior merge commit.","tree":{"sha":"2092c15e3b5d2272b40eba87fdae8da2c90b79b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/2092c15e3b5d2272b40eba87fdae8da2c90b79b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/9aca4ef2bd4038daade19cc0dd494a5b1159feca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/9aca4ef2bd4038daade19cc0dd494a5b1159feca","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDlhY2E0ZWYyYmQ0MDM4ZGFhZGUxOWNjMGRkNDk0YTViMTE1OWZlY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/13fad33e5b9442baec40c6c4