e":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(tenant-portal): polyfill Promise.withResolvers for Windows 7 browsers\n\npdfjs-dist v6 calls Promise.withResolvers (ES2024), which is missing on the\nnewest browsers that run on Windows 7 (Chrome 109, older Firefox). PDF upload\nthrew \"Promise.withResolvers is not a function\" there. Load a side-effect\npolyfill before pdfjs in both files that import it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32877600e8cfe55f236ee8fb859dd2224d0868a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/trees/32877600e8cfe55f236ee8fb859dd2224d0868a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/git/commits/508ec342b211cf537ef1ba0247c66a974cffc37a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/508ec342b211cf537ef1ba0247c66a974cffc37a","node_id":"C_kwDOTQKyJdoAKDUwOGVjMzQyYjIxMWNmNTM3ZWYxYmEwMjQ3YzY2YTk3NGNmZmMzN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commit/1e360521a8e9062209f9c0a14e1fbd06fc26cff5","sha":"1e360521a8e9062209f9c0a14e1fbd06fc26cff5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/1e360521a8e9062209f9c0a14e1fbd06fc26cff5"}],"sha":"508ec342b211cf537ef1ba0247c66a974cffc37a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/508ec342b211cf537ef1ba0247c66a974cffc37a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/utility-crm/epaper-crm/commits/471d1aa44b23ae70d72b7daf8872197caffefa94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T13:59:48Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T13:59:48Z","email":"usk.rs.verma@gmail.com","name":"vincenzo-verma"},"message":"fix(billing): show tax-inclusive price in reader subscription picker\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha"