Origin -> ALLOWED_ORIGINS env var)\n- Optimize Dockerfile for Render free tier (GC limits, globalization invariant)\n\nFrontend:\n- Wire coupon apply to real backend API (POST /api/v1/coupons/validate)\n- Add 404 error page component with routing\n- Wire newsletter subscription form\n- Add SEO meta tags to storefront (Open Graph, Twitter Card, description)\n\nInfra:\n- Fix .dockerignore to exclude .env*, tests/, frontend/, docs/\n- Add frontend/dist/ to .gitignore\n- Remove tracked dist/ build artifacts from git\n- Add Shared.Contracts to solution file","tree":{"sha":"650621c4b728fa185b4143f36298425d9b25cbb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/siranjeevis01/CommerceHub/git/trees/650621c4b728fa185b4143f36298425d9b25cbb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/siranjeevis01/CommerceHub/git/commits/357ac46e112dfd2695e60b90ed147ec344dd521a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151367211?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/siranjeevis01","id":151367211,"login":"siranjeevis01","node_id":"U_kgDOCQWuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/siranjeevis01/C