ckend (/identity/auth/login, register, logout, refresh-token)\n- Logout endpoint: added LogoutCommand + handler to invalidate refresh tokens\n- Authorization: added [Authorize] to 88 unprotected endpoints across Product, CMS, Vendor, Analytics, Notification, Inventory services\n\nPRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT:\n- Webpack publicPath: changed from hardcoded localhost to ''auto'' for all MFEs\n- Shell remotes: environment-based URLs (relative paths in prod, localhost in dev)\n- Dockerfile: now deploys all 4 MFEs (shell + admin/vendor/storefront subdirectories)\n- nginx.conf: created with API proxy, WebSocket proxy, SPA fallback, gzip compression\n- Added .gitkeep to all MFE assets directories\n- Created favicon.ico for shell\n\nBUG FIXES:\n- Vendor dashboard recentViews: fixed incorrect StockQuantity sum\n- MFE toastr: removed duplicate ToastrModule.forRoot() from remote MFE modules","tree":{"sha":"d4001bbd0840fa6b8eba2b93fddd60cf0f3a7820","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/siranjeevis01/CommerceHub/git/trees/d4001bbd0840fa6b8eba2b93fddd60cf0f3a7820"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/siranjeevis01/CommerceHub/git/commits/e32f4da2b60b62281bd20ce4f88e0c86abd30a5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151367211?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/siranjeevis01","id":151367211,"login":"siranjeevis01","node_id":"U_kgDOCQWuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/siranjeevis01