Vega Hidalgo"},"message":"expo-eas-aidlc 1.0.0 — spec-driven RN + Expo (EAS) plugin for Claude Code\n\nAI-DLC methodology (specs.md) adapted from the sibling rn-repack-aidlc\nplugin, replacing Re.Pack/Module Federation with Expo + EAS:\n\n- 8 agents (master, inception, construction, operations, fire-executor,\n  parity-analyst, code-auditor, module-analyst)\n- 15 commands incl. /expo-init (create-expo-app + expo-router + EAS\n  wiring) and /modularize (workspace feature-package analysis)\n- Standards templates for Expo: CNG (never hand-edit ios/android),\n  build-vs-OTA boundary (EAS Build per runtime version, EAS Update per\n  channel), Development → Preview → Production progression\n- Bundled i18n-doc-sync skill + hard guards (plugin doctor, EN/ES doc\n  sync, command coverage) wired to CI and pre-commit\n- Bilingual docs: README, USAGE, ARCHITECTURE, OTA (EAS Update guide)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb66d895ce19b79ce8e165278335e5989de9f8d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/expo-eas-aidlc/git/trees/eb66d895ce19b79ce8e165278335e5989de9f8d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/expo-eas-aidlc/git/commits/ab643c5e1eedab86b8674e982908f7fbf1f81342","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12928168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github