events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chan-c-gt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chan-c-gt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chan-c-gt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chan-c-gt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chan-c-gt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oscar-melendez77/PharmaWatch/commits/4965042a5d4d794c2b4bd7d030a34fe61e224694/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T01:07:40Z","email":"ojosue.morantes@gmail.com","name":"Oscar Melendez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T01:07:40Z","email":"ojosue.morantes@gmail.com","name":"Oscar Melendez"},"message":"Dossier polish: apply 5-lens adversarial review fixes\n\nOriginality/craft: drop emoji from source table (red ■ marks), make the index\nbar solid (no glassmorphism), reposition the rubber-stamp off the doc-number,\nre-skin the chat as a ruled correspondence transcript, typographic run-log marks.\nLegibility/a11y: darken --faint to pass AA, add missing .table-wrap (fixes mobile\noverflow), scroll-padding-top for the sticky bar, monograph responsive breakpoint,\ninitial-letter drop cap, fix key-figures dead gap.\nData-viz: cap heatmap red so cell numbers stay legible + fix its top-margin + row\norder to match Fig 1, friendly SHAP feature labels, all-ink AUC bars, value labels\non Figs 7/9, risk colour key + colour-blind outline on the scatter.\nCopy/credibility: honest sample-data framing, real personalization mechanism,\ncorrect ''drug/drug set'' vocabulary (not specimen/cohort), accurate matrix caption.\nData: plausible sample values (severity tracks danger, signature reactions per drug).","tree":{"sha":"a3e2c76a0ea8cd3e09db6396ad711b3a38c7d13c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oscar-melendez77/PharmaWatch/git/trees/a3e2c76a0ea8cd3e09db6396ad711b3a38c7d13c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oscar-melendez77/Ph