.github.com/users/chan-c-gt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chan-c-gt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chan-c-gt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chan-c-gt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oscar-melendez77/PharmaWatch/commits/1bc9c9da8b74879962f7bdbb8c02faa209f4e4da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T23:07:10Z","email":"ojosue.morantes@gmail.com","name":"Oscar Melendez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T23:07:10Z","email":"ojosue.morantes@gmail.com","name":"Oscar Melendez"},"message":"Add chat agent panel to the Pages dashboard\n\nThe static dashboard had graphs but no way to chat. Add an ''Ask the agent''\npanel that POSTs to the live /ask API (CORS is already open on the API): a\nconnect-your-API row (saved to localStorage, or auto-filled from meta\napi_base_url / ?api= query param), a compact profile (age/sex/alcohol/smoker)\nthat feeds personalization, and a chat log tied to the selected drug. Shows a\n''backend not connected'' state until an API URL is set, then lights up.\nexport_static.py now writes meta.api_base_url from the API_BASE_URL env.","tree":{"sha":"b58ae536c1dc82675854c61c03546613c6f2410f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oscar-melendez77/PharmaWatch/git/trees/b58ae536c1dc82675854c61c03546613c6f2410f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oscar-melendez77/PharmaWatch/git/commits/1bc9c9da8b74879962f7bdbb8c02faa209f4e4da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/293155173?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chan-c-gt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chan-c-gt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chan-c-gt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chan-c-g