":"hafeezaj.khan@gmail.com","name":"Mohammed Hafeez Ali Khan"},"message":"feat(recall): near-duplicate suppression; resize to 8GB + build swap; script/doc fixes\n\n- engine.recall: drop near-identical memories (token-Jaccard >=0.6) when selecting top-k, so a\n  diverse, useful set enters context instead of clones (e.g. 5x ''Deposition of witness X''); evals still 100/100\n- infra: 4GB OOM-thrashed during the Next.js build -> resize to ecs.u1-c1m4.large (2 vCPU/8 GB,\n  ~half original cost, builds reliably); bootstrap adds a 4GB swapfile as a safety net\n- demo scripts: fix accumulation beat to teach a NOVEL fact (Marcus Bell paralegal, not the\n  already-seeded Ortiz); soften ''six into context'' -> ''a few (deduplicated)''\n- sync size refs (2c/8g) across DEPLOY/SUBMISSION/proof-script/tech-arch/tfvars\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a88cd1b9a43cbb8fd04fdffa519a3351310db10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhafeezajh/privatedesk-alibaba/git/trees/0a88cd1b9a43cbb8fd04fdffa519a3351310db10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhafeezajh/privatedesk-alibaba/git/commits/ac7154e50bfc924d1976206fc8754c5894da0967","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10045302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohdhafeezaj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohdhafeezaj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohdhafeezaj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohdhafeezaj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mohdhafeezaj","id":10045302,"login":"mohdhafeezaj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDQ1MzAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohdhafeezaj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohdhafeezaj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moh