:"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/722686994c30a6cd7bd4b903429dac5a0702b42b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/f8a1bad1656de09679c10ac500bdabe4d0b461ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:34:56Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:34:56Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"feat: rediseña el editor de contratos (toolbar agrupada, lienzo tipo hoja y variables)\n\nTercera fase del overhaul. Reescribe RichTextEditor (compartido por plantillas y\ncontratos) acercándolo a Google Docs / Word Online sin perder funcionalidad.\n\n- Sistema de VARIABLES {{...}} (hallazgo crítico): nodo TipTap inline que se\n  renderiza como píldora no editable; botón \"Variable\" con catálogo buscable\n  (CONTRACT_VARIABLES: folio, proveedor, sociedad, apoderado, monto, vigencia…).\n- Toolbar STICKY agrupada: selects de estilo/tamaño con valor activo reflejado,\n  acciones secundarias (cita, código, tabla, línea, salto, limpiar) colapsadas en\n  un menú \"Más opciones\".\n- Lienzo tipo documento: el área editable es una \"hoja\" blanca centrada sobre\n  fondo gris (WYSIWYG real), no una caja plana.\n- Popover inline para enlace e imagen por URL (reemplaza window.prompt).\n- Estética más limpia en la toolbar (botones ghost, divisores sutiles) sobre la\n  base Neobrutalism.\n- Chip .clm-variable en tokens.css; sanitizer permite data-variable/page-break.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fbb64a39bf7032220395547ddb3f15fad8114c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/trees/1fbb64a39bf7032220395547ddb3f15fad8114c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/commits/f8a1bad1656de09679c10ac500bdabe4d0b461ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commit/f8a1bad1656de09679c10ac500bdabe4d0b461ae","node_id":"C_kwDOTQmPS9oAKGY4YTFiYWQxNjU2ZGUwOTY3OWMxMGFjNTAwYmRhYmU0ZDBiNDYxYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commit/27e38ff9422a593d58942d2b61398339ba17446a","sha":"27e38ff9422a593d58942d2b61398339ba17446a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/27e38ff9422a593d58942d2b61398339ba17446a"}],"sha":"f8a1bad1656de09679c10ac500bdabe4d0b461ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/f8a1bad1656de09679c10ac500bdabe4d0b461ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/27e38ff9422a593d58942d2b61398339ba17446a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:29:19Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:29:19Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"refactor: migra los 7 microfrontends a los primitivos canónicos de commons\n\nSegunda fase del overhaul de UX/UI. Elimina la duplicación masiva detectada en\nla auditoría y unifica el design system. Typecheck de los 7 MFs: EXIT 0.\n\nConsolidación de primitivos (−18 archivos locales duplicados)\n- Select (×6), Modal (×3), Textarea (×3), Label (×2), states/EmptyState y\n  confirm-dialog locales reemplazados por sus equivalentes de commons y borrados\n  tras confirmar 0 importadores.\n\nFixes transversales aplicados por MF\n- Tablas anchas (5+ col): wrappers overflow-hidden → overflow-x-auto + min-w-[640px]\n  para scroll en móvil en lugar de comprimirse.\n- Navegación \"Volver/Inicio\" unificada con <BackButton crossZone> de commons\n  (reemplaza la mezcla de <a href=\"/\">, ''←'' y ArrowLeft ad-hoc).\n- Grises de bajo contraste text-foreground/40-60 → text-muted-foreground.\n- Padding raíz responsive: p-6 → p-4 sm:p-6.\n\nSin cambios de lógica de negocio, RTK Query ni validaciones — solo imports y presentación.\n\nDeuda técnica anotada: falta un primitivo Switch y Tabs en commons; contratos-mf\nconserva su Label local (look uppercase) pendiente de unificar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48374f3e0261676704ff4af0f6f1cf1a07ba3ef6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/trees/48374f3e0261676704ff4af0f6f1cf1a07ba3ef6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/commits/27e38ff9422a593d58942d2b61398339ba17446a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commit/27e38ff9422a593d58942d2b61398339ba17446a","node_id":"C_kwDOTQmPS9oAKDI3ZTM4ZmY5NDIyYTU5M2Q1ODk0MmQyYjYxMzk4MzM5YmExNzQ0NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commit/528237f26a7bb363f17d7c059b34600b656866c0","sha":"528237f26a7bb363f17d7c059b34600b656866c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/528237f26a7bb363f17d7c059b34600b656866c0"}],"sha":"27e38ff9422a593d58942d2b61398339ba17446a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/27e38ff9422a593d58942d2b61398339ba17446a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/528237f26a7bb363f17d7c059b34600b656866c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:14:42Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:14:42Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"feat: fundación del design system, branding real y fix del flash de navegación\n\nPrimera fase del overhaul integral de UX/UI (auditoría previa de 7 dimensiones).\n\nDesign system (tokens)\n- Corrige el tamaño base (html 20px/body 30px → 16px) que agrandaba todo.\n- Añade acento secundario coral (#fb6a55), escala de grises semántica\n  (muted/muted-foreground), tokens de estado (destructive/success/warning/info)\n  y elevaciones (shadow-sm/lg). Conserva el Neobrutalism (bordes 2px, sombra dura).\n\nPrimitivos nuevos en commons (cierran duplicación y huecos vs SaaS)\n- Logo, Spinner, Button(isLoading + variante accent), Label, Textarea, Select,\n  Skeleton, Modal (focus-trap + restore), ConfirmDialog, states\n  (Empty/Loading/Error/NoPermission), BackButton, PageHeader, PageShell.\n\nNavegación (fix del flash login→dashboard al volver de un MF)\n- authSlice: flag `hydrated` + setHydrated; StoreProvider lo despacha siempre.\n- page.tsx muestra AuthSplash mientras hidrata, no el login.\n- useRole expone `ready`; PrivilegeGuard no muestra \"Sin permiso\" durante hidratación.\n\nBranding\n- Corrige el casing del logo (Logo.png → logo.png) que daría 404 en Linux/Vercel.\n- Distribuye logo.png + favicon (icon.png) a las 8 apps; componente <Logo/> compartido.\n- Reemplaza el placeholder \"A\" del login y el sidebar por la orca real.\n\nLogin / Dashboard / Sidebar\n- Login split-screen con logo grande como protagonista.\n- Sidebar con logo real + drawer responsive (hamburguesa en móvil).\n- Dashboard con padding responsive y limpieza de grises de bajo contraste.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81900cde79b0cdff2a012a407e8d71b7bc74e42d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/trees/81900cde79b0cdff2a012a407e8d71b7bc74e42d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/commits/528237f26a7bb363f17d7c059b34600b656866c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commit/528237f26a7bb363f17d7c059b34600b656866c0","node_id":"C_kwDOTQmPS9oAKDUyODIzN2YyNmE3YmIzNjNmMTdkN2MwNTliMzQ2MDBiNjU2ODY2YzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commit/c1e426413626c24c84c8c986e313488d6feee32c","sha":"c1e426413626c24c84c8c986e313488d6feee32c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/c1e426413626c24c84c8c986e313488d6feee32c"}],"sha":"528237f26a7bb363f17d7c059b34600b656866c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/528237f26a7bb363f17d7c059b34600b656866c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/c1e426413626c24c84c8c986e313488d6feee32c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T03:33:44Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T03:33:44Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"feat: rediseño de UI con sidebar, login split-screen y tipografía unificada\n\nMejoras de experiencia y consistencia del design system Neobrutalism, más\narreglos de arranque del backend y documentación para el equipo.\n\nUI / web-shell\n- Nuevo AppSidebar: navegación lateral profesional con secciones\n  (Módulos / Analítica / Sistema), iconos SVG y gating por privilegio.\n- RoleDashboard rediseñado: layout con sidebar + topbar, tarjetas de stats\n  y grid de módulos accesibles (reemplaza las cards sueltas de entrada).\n- RoleLogin rediseñado: split-screen con panel de marca y formulario.\n\nTipografía (design system)\n- Sweep font-mono -> font-sans en 73 componentes (.tsx) de todos los MFs;\n  se conserva mono solo en bloques de código/contrato (prose-clm, editor).\n- tokens.css: base de font-size y line-height para mejor legibilidad.\n\nArranque / tooling\n- turbo.json: dev ahora depende de ^build para compilar backend-commons\n  antes de los microservicios (resuelve TS2307 al levantar dev:core).\n\nDocs\n- docs/DocumentacionParaElEquipo/como-ejecutar.md: guía de ejecución.\n- .claude/RESUMEN.md actualizado (estado de runtime verificado).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d06a440021df7dd92404461e0ab7ff4025d83818","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/trees/d06a440021df7dd92404461e0ab7ff4025d83818"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/commits/c1e426413626c24c84c8c986e313488d6feee32c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commit/c1e426413626c24c84c8c986e313488d6feee32c","node_id":"C_kwDOTQmPS9oAKGMxZTQyNjQxMzYyNmMyNGM4NGM4Yzk4NmUzMTM0ODhkNmZlZWUzMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commit/65f17301a5ebce8072c81b0ad1fd9bac08d7215c","sha":"65f17301a5ebce8072c81b0ad1fd9bac08d7215c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/65f17301a5ebce8072c81b0ad1fd9bac08d7215c"}],"sha":"c1e426413626c24c84c8c986e313488d6feee32c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/c1e426413626c24c84c8c986e313488d6feee32c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120062171?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Isaacjbar","id":120062171,"login":"Isaacjbar","node_id":"U_kgDOBygA2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/65f17301a5ebce8072c81b0ad1fd9bac08d7215c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T21:41:33Z","email":"isaac777jb@gmail.com","name":"Isaac Jimenez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T21:41:33Z","email":"isaac777jb@gmail.com","name":"Isaac Jimenez"},"message":"feat: integrar frontend con el API real (RTK Query) + fixes de integración\n\nConecta web-shell y los 7 microfrontends al API Gateway real, reemplazando los mocks:\n\n- commons: capa RTK Query compartida (baseApi con unwrap del {data} + re-auth 401/refresh,\n  sesión cross-zone por cookie, ApiProvider por MF).\n- web-shell: login/logout reales contra /auth (decodifica el JWT -> rol + privilegios).\n- solicitudes/flujo/contratos/documentos/firmas/reportes/admin: endpoints reales\n  (contracts, workflow, documents, signatures, reports, users, catálogos) vía injectEndpoints.\n- gateway: APP_PORT=3001 (Grafana ocupa el 3000 en local).\n- seed: 5 usuarios por rol + script scripts/seed-demo.mjs (contratos demo en varios estados).\n\nFixes de bugs encontrados en barrido adversarial + verificación en navegador (Playwright):\n- admin: editar usuario ya no truena con 400 (no se envía email en el PATCH).\n- contratos: quitado el filtro por sociedad (las plantillas no tienen sociedad).\n- flujo: \"Tipo\" muestra el providerType real; se quita el \"solicitante\" falso.\n- solicitudes: la bitácora del detalle usa /workflow (no /reports/audit) para el solicitante.\n- manejo de error en mutations (submit/cancel/recover, toggles, eliminar, subir, versionar).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec01360c0b1239b07b75bd84841be9da75cc52be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/trees/ec01360c0b1239b07b75bd84841be9da75cc52be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/commits/65f17301a5ebce8072c81b0ad1fd9bac08d7215c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url