"login":"Isaacjbar","node_id":"U_kgDOBygA2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/94af5a19f5c24d8c75b9293f518a2c4033dd4cac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:52:58Z","email":"isaac777jb@gmail.com","name":"Isaac Jimenez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:52:58Z","email":"isaac777jb@gmail.com","name":"Isaac Jimenez"},"message":"chore(ci): ignorar *.tsbuildinfo y robustecer pre-commit de biome\n\n- .gitignore: *.tsbuildinfo (artefacto de tsc, no debe versionarse).\n- pre-commit: --no-errors-on-unmatched evita que biome falle en commits sin\n  archivos fuente (p. ej. solo config/docs).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4017a79c85e5cf16426042e73060a1fc98b0c67c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/trees/4017a79c85e5cf16426042e73060a1fc98b0c67c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/commits/94af5a19f5c24d8c75b9293f518a2c4033dd4cac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120062171?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Isaacjbar","id":120062171,"login":"Isaacjbar","node_id":"U_kgDOBygA2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commit/94af5a19f5c24d8c75b9293f518a2c4033dd4cac","node_id":"C_kwDOTQmPS9oAKDk0YWY1YTE5ZjVjMjRkOGM3NWI5MjkzZjUxOGEyYzQwMzNkZDRjYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commit/3c890ffbf1c82f88e954e19a4da399bbee947a0f","sha":"3c890ffbf1c82f88e954e19a4da399bbee947a0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/3c890ffbf1c82f88e954e19a4da399bbee947a0f"}],"sha":"94af5a19f5c24d8c75b9293f518a2c4033dd4cac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/94af5a19f5c24d8c75b9293f518a2c4033dd4cac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120062171?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Isaacjbar","id":120062171,"login":"Isaacjbar","node_id":"U_kgDOBygA2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/3c890ffbf1c82f88e954e19a4da399bbee947a0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:45:41Z","email":"isaac777jb@gmail.com","name":"Isaac Jimenez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:45:41Z","email":"isaac777jb@gmail.com","name":"Isaac Jimenez"},"message":"feat: backend CLM — microservicios, gateway, colas BullMQ y manejo de errores\n\nImplementa la lógica de negocio de los 4 microservicios NestJS y el API Gateway:\n\n- contracts: CRUD + folio autogenerado, scoping por privilegios, catálogos\n  (sociedades, áreas, apoderados, plantillas) y espejo de estado por cola.\n- workflow: State Machine del ciclo de vida, SLA semáforo, transiciones,\n  bitácora (AuditLog) y notificaciones (Observer).\n- documents: Factory de documentos requeridos (PF/PM), versionado y firmas\n  (Strategy canvas/electrónica).\n- auth: módulo Users (CRUD) con privilegios derivados de roles; areaId en el JWT.\n- gateway: rutas REST + Swagger + @RequirePrivilege + Bull Board (/admin/queues).\n\nEncolamiento durable con BullMQ (cola notifications, sla-scan repetible y saga\ndel contrato entre servicios), resolviendo el caveat fire-and-forget del ADR-0007.\n\nPatrones: Repository, Factory, Strategy, State Machine, Observer, Decorator, API Gateway.\n\nFixes:\n- commons: import de valor de Reflector en los guards (rompía la DI en runtime).\n- propagacion de errores microservicio->gateway (MicroserviceExceptionFilter +\n  RpcErrorInterceptor): ahora 403/404/400 en vez de 500 generico.\n\nIncluye migraciones Prisma y seeds (admin, catalogos, etapas de workflow).\nVerificado end-to-end: login, flujo DRAFT->SIGNED, RBAC, documentos, reportes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2dbad418b9130410884c3f06985f67a953b58387","u