d":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Isaacjbar","id":120062171,"login":"Isaacjbar","node_id":"U_kgDOBygA2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/commits/55025b1113019ef19eb9502781548c093b2a4543/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T06:56:08Z","email":"isaac777jb@gmail.com","name":"Isaac Jimenez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T06:56:08Z","email":"isaac777jb@gmail.com","name":"Isaac Jimenez"},"message":"feat(web-shell): microservicios, microfrontends, RBAC y 7 MFs completos\n\n## Arquitectura\n- Aplanar monorepo: clm-system/ -> raiz git (fix Husky prepare)\n- Backend: NestJS API Gateway + 4 microservicios Redis pub/sub\n  (auth, contracts, workflow, documents) + commons compartido\n- Datos: schema-per-service (Prisma) en 1 PostgreSQL + Redis\n- Frontend: SOFEA + Next.js Multi-Zones (web-shell + 7 microfrontends)\n- Design system: Neobrutalism/shadcn -> @aletheia/frontend-commons\n- RBAC: Redux host + cookie cross-zone + CookiePrivilegeGuard\n\n## Backend (compila 6/6)\n- gateway: REST + Swagger /api/docs + JWT/PrivilegeGuard globales\n- auth-service: login/refresh/logout + Prisma schema auth + seed\n- contracts/workflow/documents-service: booteables con Prisma propio\n\n## Frontend (compila 8/8, validado con Playwright)\n- web-shell: login por 5 roles (mock) + dashboard RBAC\n- solicitudes-mf: listado + crear (folio, PF/PM, docs dinámicos) + detalle\n- contratos-mf: CRUD plantillas + editor WYSIWYG-lite + elaborar doc\n- documentos-mf: carga requeridos, versionado, vigencia\n- flujo-mf: panel revision por rol + semaforo SLA + linea de tiempo\n- firmas-mf: canvas firma base64 + apoderado + detalle\n- reportes-mf: KPIs + filtros + exportar CSV + bitacora auditoria\n- admin-mf: CRUD usuarios/areas/apoderados + config etapas flujo\n\n## Config\n- biome.json: unsafeParameterDecoratorsEnabled, reglas a11y/style relajadas\n- turbo.json: dev depende de ^build + db:generate\n- pnpm onlyBuiltDependencies: Prisma, NestJS, Biome, sharp\n- .claude/RESUMEN.md: resumen completo de arquitectura y estado\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7395f9ba3fd409ce6fac6b52515673978d210d5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/trees/7395f9ba3fd409ce6fac6b52515673978d210d5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cambar-Solutions/ALETHEIA/git/commits/55025b1113019ef19eb9502781548c093b2a4543","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120062171?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Isaacjbar","id":120062171,"login":"Isaacjbar","node_id":"U_kgDOBygA2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cambar-Soluti