api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/2d9473f6766fa0e4d06f89a2c48bd478a3cafbf5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T06:21:13Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T06:21:13Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Заменить мобильный сайдбар с выезжающей панели на постоянную узкую полоску иконок\n\nПользователь отметил, что скрытая по умолчанию панель с гамбургером все равно занимает\nлишний тап; вместо этого сайдбар теперь всегда виден, но ниже lg сжимается до иконок без\nподписей (подписи доступны как title-тултип). ProfileMenu получил проп compact для того же\nповедения с именем пользователя.","tree":{"sha":"03663c64e48dbe90663d6f4be82e5d374e4f8db8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/03663c64e48dbe90663d6f4be82e5d374e4f8db8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/2d9473f6766fa0e4d06f89a2c48bd478a3cafbf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/2d9473f6766fa0e4d06f89a2c48bd478a3cafbf5","node_id":"C_kwDOTQrr3toAKDJkOTQ3M2Y2NzY2ZmEwZTRkMDZmODlhMmM0OGJkNDc4YTNjYWZiZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/3fa4d49b9d96e4eb1563a6f0c6aa1386b9095f66","sha":"3fa4d49b9d96e4eb1563a6f0c6aa1386b9095f66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/3fa4d49b9d96e4eb1563a6f0c6aa1386b9095f66"}],"sha":"2d9473f6766fa0e4d06f89a2c48bd478a3cafbf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/2d9473f6766fa0e4d06f89a2c48bd478a3cafbf5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/3fa4d49b9d96e4eb1563a6f0c6aa1386b9095f66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T06:03:34Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T06:03:34Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Сделать интерфейс адаптивным: мобильный сайдбар, скролл таблиц, формы\n\nТри отдельных проблемы:\n1. Карточка настроек на странице \"Рейтинг\" была искусственно ужата\n   max-w-xl, в отличие от такой же карточки на \"Награды\" - убрано.\n2. Ни одна из 7 таблиц консоли не имела overflow-x-auto - на узких\n   экранах либо ломали раскладку, либо обрезались без возможности\n   докрутить. Обёрнуты все, плюс 4 формы с фиксированным grid-cols-2\n   переведены на grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2.\n3. Сайдбар консоли был статичным w-64 без адаптива - на мобильном\n   съедал большую часть экрана. Теперь off-canvas: скрыт за гамбургер-\n   меню на экранах уже lg (1024px), с бэкдропом и авто-закрытием при\n   переходе; на десктопе поведение не изменилось.\n\nЗаодно у прохождения теста (CoursePage) список глав в сайдбаре скрыт\nна мобильном уже давно (hidden md:block) без замены - добавлен\nмобильный <select> для навигации по главам, раньше сотрудник с\nтелефона не мог переключаться между главами вообще.\n\nПроверено на 559x707 (эмуляция мобильного, реальный resize окна\nChrome-расширения не работает в этой среде) - консоль, тесты,\nдашборд, награды, рейтинг.","tree":{"sha":"2229b3feced8d077b0aff8b13b42737cd081467b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/2229b3feced8d077b0aff8b13b42737cd081467b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/3fa4d49b9d96e4eb1563a6f0c6aa1386b9095f66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cl