"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/f055286fd62f52bd19cacc66688ef807d8f8d6e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T05:24:55Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T05:24:55Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Объединить Волны/Курсы/Награды/Рейтинг под одним пунктом меню\n\nВсе четыре раздела - по сути работа над курсами, четыре отдельных\nпункта в сайдбаре плодили лишний визуальный шум. Заменено на один\nпункт \"Обучение\" + горизонтальные вкладки (TrainingTabs) сверху на\nкаждой из четырех страниц. Рейтинг во вкладках виден только\nсуперадмину, как и раньше в отдельном пункте меню.\n\nПроверено: активность пункта \"Обучение\" в сайдбаре корректно\nподсвечивается на всех четырех вкладках и на дочерних страницах\nредактирования волны/курса; менеджер без прав видит только 3 вкладки\n(без Рейтинга).","tree":{"sha":"5c736cf50526a048f526a2af4fcf7836fa621570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/5c736cf50526a048f526a2af4fcf7836fa621570"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/f055286fd62f52bd19cacc66688ef807d8f8d6e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/f055286fd62f52bd19cacc66688ef807d8f8d6e3","node_id":"C_kwDOTQrr3toAKGYwNTUyODZmZDYyZjUyYmQxOWNhY2M2NjY4OGVmODA3ZDhmOGQ2ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/8f0d1e8028e5c62d2b97de1af4f5a9ccc7ef73f4","sha":"8f0d1e8028e5c62d2b97de1af4f5a9ccc7ef73f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/8f0d1e8028e5c62d2b97de1af4f5a9ccc7ef73f4"}],"sha":"f055286fd62f52bd19cacc66688ef807d8f8d6e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/f055286fd62f52bd19cacc66688ef807d8f8d6e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/8f0d1e8028e5c62d2b97de1af4f5a9ccc7ef73f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T08:09:09Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T08:09:09Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Добавить фильтр периода и более выразительные плитки на дашборд\n\nПункт 6 из pro-roadmap.md (core-часть, без графика фишинга - тот\nзависит от раздела 3, который отложен). Фильтр \"Период отчета\"\n(30/90/180/365 дней/всё время) на общем обзоре дашборда - по дате\nстарта волны, без новых моделей. Три плитки \"Всего/Сдали/Процент\"\nзаменены на шесть цветных (по статусам: сдано/в процессе/не сдано/\nне начато), та же цветовая конвенция, что уже используется в\nStatusBadge - зеленый/янтарный/красный/серый.","tree":{"sha":"a8955653dbb7ae8c835bbae166f02cd3c8786892","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/a8955653dbb7ae8c835bbae166f02cd3c8786892"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/8f0d1e8028e5c62d2b97de1af4f5a9ccc7ef73f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/8f0d1e8028e5c62d2b97de1af4f5a9ccc7ef73f4","node_id":"C_kwDOTQrr3toAKDhmMGQxZTgwMjhlNWM2MmQyYjk3ZGUxYWY0ZjVhOWNjYzdlZjczZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/90cd629a2dd762c474160ebb33c6bf76d03cacda","sha":"90cd629a2dd762c474160ebb33c6bf76d03cacda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/90cd629a2dd762c474160ebb33c6bf76d03cacda"}],"sha":"8f0d1e8028e5c62d2b97de1af4f5a9ccc7ef73f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/8f0d1e8028e5c62d2b97de1af4f5a9ccc7ef73f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/90cd629a2dd762c474160ebb33c6bf76d03cacda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T08:02:21Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T08:02:21Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Добавить лидерборды по отделу и компании\n\nНовое приложение leaderboard: LeaderboardSettings (singleton, выключено\nпо умолчанию - публичный рейтинг успеваемости по ИБ HR-чувствителен и\nможет демотивировать отстающих). Метрика - процент сданных назначений\n(сдано/всего), та же что и кольцо прогресса на дашборде сотрудника,\nагрегируется на лету через Count(filter=...) по WaveAssignment, без\nновых моделей данных.\n\nСотрудник видит топ-10 по компании и топ-10 по своему отделу, плюс\nотдельной строкой своё место, если не попал в топ - не полный список\nснизу вверх. Включение - только суперадмину (тот же уровень, что и\nтумблер анонимизации наград).\n\nПроверено на демо-данных (24 сотрудника, 7 отделов): ранжирование верное,\n\"вне топ-10\" показывает место корректно, менеджер без прав видит редирект\nна дашборд и не видит пункт меню.","tree":{"sha":"556618db86c47af21fa311fba1f7116b3bb803eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/556618db86c47af21fa311fba1f7116b3bb803eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/90cd629a2dd762c474160ebb33c6bf76d03cacda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/90cd629a2dd762c474160ebb33c6bf76d03cacda","node_id":"C_kwDOTQrr3toAKDkwY2Q2MjlhMmRkNzYyYzQ3NDE2MGViYjMzYzZiZjc2ZDAzY2FjZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/041272cfdc4fffa6b3b34dd424ee1bc3dfc88c62","sha":"041272cfdc4fffa6b3b34dd424ee1bc3dfc88c62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/041272cfdc4fffa6b3b34dd424ee1bc3dfc88c62"}],"sha":"90cd629a2dd762c474160ebb33c6bf76d03cacda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/90cd629a2dd762c474160ebb33c6bf76d03cacda"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/041272cfdc4fffa6b3b34dd424ee1bc3dfc88c62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T19:05:31Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T19:05:31Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Переименовать значки в награды, привязать выдачу к конкретной волне\n\n\"Значки\" звучит уничижительно - везде в интерфейсе и Django Admin\nзаменено на \"награды\" (Badge/EmployeeBadge как имена классов не трогал,\nэто внутренний код).\n\nДобавлено поле Badge.wave - награда может быть привязана к конкретной\nволне (годовой/квартальный цикл обязательного курса), а не только к\nкурсу вообще. Это позволяет делать \"Пароли 2026\" и \"Пароли 2027\" как\nдва разных объекта с разными иконками, каждый выдаётся только за свою\nволну - честная пересдача внутри одного цикла (в т.ч. после списывания)\nне дублирует уже полученную награду за счет unique_together, а новый\nцикл (новая волна с новой наградой) выдаёт независимо.\n\nПроверено вживую: два сотрудника, две волны одного курса, каждый\nполучил только награду своей волны.","tree":{"sha":"e3656b7a256ec49354125ae0a66a6d20e80b9f27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/e3656b7a256ec49354125ae0a66a6d20e80b9f27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/041272cfdc4fffa6b3b34dd424ee1bc3dfc88c62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/041272cfdc4fffa6b3b34dd424ee1bc3dfc88c62","node_id":"C_kwDOTQrr3toAKDA0MTI3MmNmZGM0ZmZmYTZiM2IzNGRkNDI0ZWUxYmMzZGZjODhjNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/a354e5f8803f6a60dbae261e99c05a631dd9dbae","sha":"a354e5f8803f6a60dbae261e99c05a631dd9dbae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/a354e5f8803f6a60dbae261e99c05a631dd9dbae"}],"sha":"041272cfdc4fffa6b3b34dd424ee1bc3dfc88c62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/041272cfdc4fffa6b3b34dd424ee1bc3dfc88c62"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/a354e5f8803f6a60dbae261e99c05a631dd9dbae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T18:41:37Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T18:41:37Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Добавить значки за прохождение курса (badges/achievements)\n\nНовое приложение badges: Badge (тип значка, иконка, привязка к курсу\nили \"любой курс\"), EmployeeBadge (факт выдачи, публичный токен),\nBadgeSettings (тумблер показа настоящего имени на публичной странице).\nНачисление - хук в quizzes/services.py после честной сдачи теста, только\nза первое прохождение назначения. Публичная страница-подтверждение\n/badge/<token>/ без авторизации, с throttle. Админский CRUD в консоли\n(доступен менеджерам), тумблер публичности - только суперадмину.\n\nЗаодно исправлен nginx.conf: $host обрубал порт в Host-заголовке, из-за\nчего абсолютные URL медиа-файлов (иконки значков) собирались без порта\nна нестандартных портах вроде локального :8090 - заменено на $http_host.\n\nPro-only, решение отдавать в открытую версию - после того как фичу можно\nбудет посмотреть вживую вместе с контролем фокуса на тесте.","tree":{"sha":"c066a0f1df3bf125c6c3fa498655ba35f8155d21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/c066a0f1df3bf125c6c3fa498655ba35f8155d21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/a354e5f8803f6a60dbae261e99c05a631dd9dbae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/a354e5f8803f6a60dbae261e99c05a631dd9dbae","node_id":"C_kwDOTQrr3toAKGEzNTRlNWY4ODAzZjZhNjBkYmFlMjYxZTk5YzA1YTYzMWRkOWRiYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/781647365fa9b8cabc1d0b6c5f33d3da847836f3","sha":"781647365fa9b8cabc1d0b6c5f33d3da847836f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/781647365fa9b8cabc1d0b6c5f33d3da847836f3"}],"sha":"a354e5f8803f6a60dbae261e99c05a631dd9dbae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/a354e5f8803f6a60dbae261e99c05a631dd9dbae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/781647365fa9b8cabc1d0b6c5f33d3da847836f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T17:59:02Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T17:59:02Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Добавить контроль фокуса на тесте (анти-чит)\n\nПервый уход со страницы теста (потеря видимости вкладки или фокуса окна) -\nпредупреждение, второй - принудительный провал попытки с фиксацией причины\n(QuizAttempt.forfeited_reason). Grace-period 1.5с не считает случайное\nсистемное уведомление нарушением. Балл при форфейте честный (по реально\nотвеченным вопросам), passed форсится в False.\n\nPro-only на данный момент - решение отдавать в открытую версию или нет\nпринимается после того как обкатаем фичу.","tree":{"sha":"c1c6f9f93914b284f81e380c40bc57a86a57048a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/c1c6f9f93914b284f81e380c40bc57a86a57048a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/781647365fa9b8cabc1d0b6c5f33d3da847836f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/781647365fa9b8cabc1d0b6c5f33d3da847836f3","node_id":"C_kwDOTQrr3toAKDc4MTY0NzM2NWZhOWI4Y2FiYzFkMGI2YzVmMzNkM2RhODQ3ODM2ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/af6d64d1a8e6688d069a44f8540f031834a5143d","sha":"af6d64d1a8e6688d069a44f8540f031834a5143d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/af6d64d1a8e6688d069a44f8540f031834a5143d"}],"sha":"781647365fa9b8cabc1d0b6c5f33d3da847836f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/781647365fa9b8cabc1d0b6c5f33d3da847836f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/af6d64d1a8e6688d069a44f8540f031834a5143d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:46:51Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:46:51Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Исправить падение createsuperuser, обновить документацию по установке\n\nmanage.py createsuperuser падал с TypeError на чистой базе, так как модель\nUser логинится по email, но использовала стандартный UserManager Django,\nкоторый жестко требует username как позиционный аргумент create_superuser().\nДобавлен свой UserManager на базе email. Также поправлены README (nginx.conf\nдля non-Docker бэкенда) и admin-guide (устаревшая ссылка на \"Интеграции\"\nвместо актуальных \"Безопасность\"/\"Журналы\").","tree":{"sha":"cc9f1ca95851d258390e6b6c74e591788aa051ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/cc9f1ca95851d258390e6b6c74e591788aa051ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/af6d64d1a8e6688d069a44f8540f031834a5143d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/af6d64d1a8e6688d069a44f8540f031834a5143d","node_id":"C_kwDOTQrr3toAKGFmNmQ2NGQxYThlNjY4OGQwNjlhNDRmODU0MGYwMzE4MzRhNTE0M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/843a4335c403fd826c7a528e6bfb9a717deee490","sha":"843a4335c403fd826c7a528e6bfb9a717deee490","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/843a4335c403fd826c7a528e6bfb9a717deee490"}],"sha":"af6d64d1a8e6688d069a44f8540f031834a5143d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/af6d64d1a8e6688d069a44f8540f031834a5143d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/843a4335c403fd826c7a528e6bfb9a717deee490/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:38:20Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:38:20Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Скрыть версию nginx в заголовках и на страницах ошибок (релиз 1.2.3)\n\nserver_tokens нигде не был выставлен - nginx по умолчанию отдает точную\nверсию в заголовке Server и на дефолтных страницах ошибок (404/502 и\nт.п.), что упрощает атакующему поиск известных CVE под конкретную\nверсию. Добавлен server_tokens off - проверено curl''ом: заголовок Server\nтеперь без версии, страница 404 показывает просто \"nginx\".","tree":{"sha":"091b693052a93b87c4c0f6b666511c470742af68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/091b693052a93b87c4c0f6b666511c470742af68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/843a4335c403fd826c7a528e6bfb9a717deee490","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/843a4335c403fd826c7a528e6bfb9a717deee490","node_id":"C_kwDOTQrr3toAKDg0M2E0MzM1YzQwM2ZkODI2YzdhNTI4ZTZiZmI5YTcxN2RlZWU0OTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/4f054f5bc593b07efd531e736cdc54be940cc