everg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/83a9a2fe0ab0e911304457fa6e179b4b36db31ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:23:12Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:23:12Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Собрать все журналы на одной странице, дописать ручное обновление (релиз 1.2.1)\n\nЖурналы входов, вызовов интеграций и отправок уведомлений были на трех\nразных страницах консоли рядом с настройками каналов - теперь отдельная\nвкладка \"Журналы\" с переключателем между тремя, настройки остались на\nсвоих местах (LDAP/API-токены на Интеграциях, каналы на Уведомлениях).\n\nREADME/docs/upgrading описывали обновление только через Docker - добавлены\nте же шаги для ручной установки (git pull, pip install, manage.py migrate,\nnpm install, плюс pg_dump напрямую вместо docker compose exec db).","tree":{"sha":"862180dd29637c644c785198fe5dfadb4fb6ad1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/862180dd29637c644c785198fe5dfadb4fb6ad1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/