er}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/f155da5e20024d9a4f9c53058054785361973522/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:03:30Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:03:30Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Добавить переключатель блокировки входа и журнал попыток входа (релиз 1.2.0)\n\nБлокировка аккаунта после 5 неверных паролей теперь опциональна -\nпереключатель в консоли (Интеграции → Защита входа), по умолчанию\nвключена. Журнал фиксирует каждую попытку входа, успешную и нет, с\nemail и IP-адресом (nginx всегда перед Django в этом деплое, поэтому\nX-Forwarded-For можно доверять безусловно) - работает независимо от\nтого, включена сама блокировка или нет.\n\nПроверено вживую: включение/выключение через API, поведение при\nвыключенной блокировке (6 неверных паролей не блокируют, но\nлогируются), журнал корректно показывает IP и результат.","tree":{"sha":"835242f7e101a3a2a90bac1ba9c982e7e3ac80aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/835242f7e101a3a2a90bac1ba9c982e7e3ac80aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/f155da5e20024d9a4f9c53058054785361973522","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/f155da5e20024d9a4f9c53058054785361973522","node_id":"C_kwDOTQrr3toAKGYxNTVkYTVlMjAwMjRkOWE0ZjljNTMwNTgwNTQ3ODUzNjE5NzM1MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/8d6480872b22b833fc2449bebe30dcc39ebfa22e","sha":"8d6480872b22b833fc2449bebe30dcc39ebfa22e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/8d6480872b22b833fc2449bebe30dcc39ebfa22e"}],"sha":"f155da5e20024d9a4f9c53058054785361973522","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/f155da5e20024d9a4f9c53058054785361973522"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/8d6480872b22b833fc2449bebe30dcc39ebfa22e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T08:49:16Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T08:49:16Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Исправить бесконечный рост счетчика блокировки, добавить unlock_account\n\nregister_failed_login никогда не сбрасывал счетчик сам по себе - после\nпервой блокировки любая следующая одна ошибка пароля, хоть через день,\nснова блокировала аккаунт на 15 минут. Теперь счетчик сбрасывается перед\nновым инцидентом, если предыдущая блокировка уже истекла.\n\nТакже добавлена management-команда unlock_account - аварийный выход,\nесли единственный администратор сам оказался заблокирован (целенаправленный\nподбор пароля его аккаунта или просто опечатка), а веб-форма сброса пароля\nв консоли ему самому недоступна.","tree":{"sha":"74eaf80cd056ef62545b4301428ab972b93a2b0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/74eaf80cd056ef62545b4301428ab972b93a2b0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/8d6480872b22b833fc2449bebe30dcc39ebfa22e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/8d6480872b22b833fc2449bebe30dcc39ebfa22e","node_id":"C_kwDOTQrr3toAKDhkNjQ4MDg3MmIyMmI4MzNmYzI0NDliZWJlMzBkY2MzOWViZmEyMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d/Awareness/commit/ce595910cd2a5759385aee818e155dc79294a42f","sha":"ce595910cd2a5759385aee818e155dc79294a42f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/ce595910cd2a5759385aee818e155dc79294a42f"}],"sha":"8d6480872b22b833fc2449bebe30dcc39ebfa22e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/8d6480872b22b833fc2449bebe30dcc39ebfa22e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cleverg0d","id":108401157,"login":"cleverg0d","node_id":"U_kgDOBnYSBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/commits/ce595910cd2a5759385aee818e155dc79294a42f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T08:29:17Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T08:29:17Z","email":"sistyagin@gmail.com","name":"cleverg0d"},"message":"Добавить блокировку аккаунта после серии неверных паролей (релиз 1.1.0)\n\nДо этого от подбора пароля защищал только throttle по IP на LoginView\n(10/min) - перебор одного и того же аккаунта, распределенный по многим\nIP, ничем не ограничивался. Теперь после 5 неверных паролей подряд сам\nаккаунт блокируется на 15 минут независимо от IP, с тем же общим\nсообщением об ошибке, чтобы не палить существование аккаунта через факт\nблокировки. Сброс пароля администратором заодно снимает блокировку,\nчтобы сотрудник с новым паролем не ждал таймаут.","tree":{"sha":"d7f57756febd676e9e9025d726285750e9823c15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/trees/d7f57756febd676e9e9025d726285750e9823c15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cleverg0d/Awareness/git/commits/ce595910cd2a5759385aee818e155dc79294a42f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108401157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cleverg0d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.co