-07T10:21:54Z","email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T10:21:54Z","email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"message":"Add alarm-exceedance popover and dev-mode manual trigger\n\n- Detect client-side when a live reading breaches its setpoint (high\n  pressure, high/low flow, low tank level) and show an amber alarm popover\n  across the HMI listing each breached condition; auto-clears when resolved\n- Add a dev_mode flag on SiaDashboard that renders an on-screen dev toolbar\n  (High Pressure / Low Tank / High Flow / Low Flow / Clear) to force alarm\n  conditions for testing; hidden entirely in normal mode\n- Add run_dev_server.py to launch the dashboard in dev mode with nominal data","tree":{"sha":"49ad6f09621533962813003e822e998926dcad94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/petronash-hmi/git/trees/49ad6f09621533962813003e822e998926dcad94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/petronash-hmi/git/commits/a4fe5710036d846b16e45d50fcc92bb1fb5c51ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/petronash-hmi/commit/a4fe5710036d846b16e45d50fcc92bb1fb5c51ed","node_id":"C_kwDOTRACt9oAKGE0ZmU1NzEwMDM2ZDg0NmIxNmU0NWQ1MGZjYzkyYmIxZmI1YzUxZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/petronash-hmi/commit/edef631d14167dd1eef620d7f5a84c521ba59756","sha":"edef631d14167dd1eef620d7f5a84c521ba59756","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/petronash-hmi/commits/edef631d14167dd1eef620d7f5a84c521ba59756"}],"sha":"a4fe5710036d846b16e45d50fcc92bb1fb5c51ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/petronash-hmi/commits/a4fe5710036d846b16e45d50fcc92bb1fb5c51ed"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/petronash-hmi/commits/edef631d14167dd1eef620d7f5a84c521ba59756/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T10:09:35Z","email":"jarrod@span-en