t to skid flow, and a low tank\n  level alarm that follows the mm/inch display-units toggle\n- Change skid flow units from Gal/Hr to GPD\n\nAlarm values are display-only defaults for now, wired through the\ndashboard data pipeline so they can be fed from the pump apps later.","tree":{"sha":"2d4ebac5f4102debccbd79f44d417eb6751501ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/petronash-hmi/git/trees/2d4ebac5f4102debccbd79f44d417eb6751501ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/petronash-hmi/git/commits/37b1dc4be66f14dd91faec23a0d1632b0210cfe8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/petronash-hmi/commit/37b1dc4be66f14dd91faec23a0d1632b0210cfe8","node_id":"C_kwDOTRACt9oAKDM3YjFkYzRiZTY2ZjE0ZGQ5MWZhZWMyM2EwZDE2MzJiMDIxMGNmZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/petronash-hmi/commit/ca694297b23f3526cd76ae304ca73700abdc82a4","sha":"ca694297b23f3526cd76ae304ca73700abdc82a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/petronash-hmi/commits/ca694297b23f3526cd76ae304ca73700abdc82a4"}],"sha":"37b1dc4be66f14dd91faec23a0d1632b0210cfe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/petronash-hmi/commits/37b1dc4be66f14dd91faec23a0d1632b0210cfe8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/petronash-hmi/commits/ca694297b23f3526cd76ae304ca73700abdc82a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T02:06:57Z","email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T02:06:57Z","email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"message":"Add Petronash/Aramco header logos and configurable display units\n\n- Flank the SIA Remote Command title with Petronash (left) and Aramco\n  (right) logos, cropped to content and matched in height\n- Add a Display Units config option (Millimeter / Inch) that switches the\n  tank level readout between mm and inches on the dashboard",