:false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15681329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e","id":15681329,"login":"wp07e","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjgxMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e/AI-OS/commit/ce86535a6c38564b3c4ce8caac053f4384e3c697","node_id":"C_kwDOTRFW2NoAKGNlODY1MzVhNmMzODU2NGIzYzRjZThjYWFjMDUzZjQzODRlM2M2OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e/AI-OS/commit/7779c354e90e626d071eedf5f30227cbd909b7a3","sha":"7779c354e90e626d071eedf5f30227cbd909b7a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/commits/7779c354e90e626d071eedf5f30227cbd909b7a3"}],"sha":"ce86535a6c38564b3c4ce8caac053f4384e3c697","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/commits/ce86535a6c38564b3c4ce8caac053f4384e3c697"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15681329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e","id":15681329,"login":"wp07e","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjgxMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/commits/7779c354e90e626d071eedf5f30227cbd909b7a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:58:45Z","email":"walkerp07@yahoo.com","name":"Phillip Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:58:45Z","email":"walkerp07@yahoo.com","name":"Phillip Walker"},"message":"fix(prefill): use run.py for previews, wait for watchdog on crash\n\nThe previous prefill told the agent to call HTTP API routes\n(/api/workspace/<id>/blender/preview and /restart) via curl. Two problems:\n\n1. Wrong host: the agent''s curl hit 127.0.0.1:4096 (opencode''s web UI),\n   not the Next.js API server (host port 3000). The container can reach\n   the host via host.docker.internal:3000, but...\n\n2. Auth required: the API routes authenticate via a browser session cookie\n   (aios_session). The agent container has no session cookie, so even with\n   the correct host the routes return 401 unauthorized.\n\nFixed both:\n\n- Previews: the agent now uses run.py directly via bash (same container,\n  no HTTP, no auth). The prefill includes the exact command:\n    echo ''{op:preview,...}'' > <folder>/request.json\n    cd /app/blender && uv run ... run.py <folder> --request request.json\n  run.py uses the direct socket (600s budget) and writes state.json phases.\n\n- Crash recovery: the agent is told to just WAIT ~30-60s for the watchdog\n  to auto-restart Blender (it can''t SSH to the GPU instance, and the web\n  API restart route needs browser auth). The watchdog runs every 10s and\n  handles the full restart flow automatically.","tree":{"sha":"09a3cfd5784d30802e3981f036c2eb40aa2cb95c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/git/trees/09a3cfd5784d30802e3981f036c2eb40aa2cb95c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/git/commits/7779c354e90e626d071eedf5f30227cbd909b7a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15681329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e","id":15681329,"login":"wp07e","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjgxMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e/AI-OS/commit/7779c354e90e626d071eedf5f30227cbd909b7a3","node_id":"C_kwDOTRFW2NoAKDc3NzljMzU0ZTkwZTYyNmQwNzFlZWRmNWYzMDIyN2NiZDkwOWI3YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e/AI-OS/commit/61bbdec6beec87161b46257ab222eae2a7b73901","sha":"61bbdec6beec87161b46257ab222eae2a7b73901","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/commits/61bbdec6beec87161b46257ab222eae2a7b73901"}],"sha":"7779c354e90e626d071eedf5f30227cbd909b7a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/commits/7779c354e90e626d071eedf5f30227cbd909b7a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15681329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e","id":15681329,"login":"wp07e","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjgxMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/commits/61bbdec6beec87161b46257ab222eae2a7b73901/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:33:10Z","email":"walkerp07@yahoo.com","name":"Phillip Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:33:10Z","email":"walkerp07@yahoo.com","name":"Phillip Walker"},"message":"fix(prefill): tell agent to use curl for preview/restart HTTP routes\n\nThe agent said ''I don''t have an HTTP POST tool available'' when it needed\nto call POST /api/workspace/<id>/blender/preview and /blender/restart.\nThis was wrong — the agent has the bash tool with curl available (and\nwebfetch). But the prefill said ''POST /api/workspace/...'' without\nshowing the actual curl command or mentioning bash, so the model didn''t\nconnect the dots.\n\nThe prefill now includes the exact curl command for both routes:\n  curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:4096/api/workspace/<id>/blender/preview\n  curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:4096/api/workspace/<id>/blender/restart\n\nAnd explicitly reminds the agent: ''You have the bash tool — use curl for\nHTTP calls to host-side routes.''","tree":{"sha":"4233baa2d086fa229c648196aa91c393e38e22f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/git/trees/4233baa2d086fa229c648196aa91c393e38e22f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/git/commits/61bbdec6beec87161b46257ab222eae2a7b73901","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15681329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e","id":15681329,"login":"wp07e","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjgxMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e/AI-OS/commit/61bbdec6beec87161b46257ab222eae2a7b73901","node_id":"C_kwDOTRFW2NoAKDYxYmJkZWM2YmVlYzg3MTYxYjQ2MjU3YWIyMjJlYWUyYTdiNzM5MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e/AI-OS/commit/6f300e04c74d2491100de930602c20e3a5c55c8d","sha":"6f300e04c74d2491100de930602c20e3a5c55c8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/commits/6f300e04c74d2491100de930602c20e3a5c55c8d"}],"sha":"61bbdec6beec87161b46257ab222eae2a7b73901","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/commits/61bbdec6beec87161b46257ab222eae2a7b73901"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15681329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e","id":15681329,"login":"wp07e","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjgxMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/commits/6f300e04c74d2491100de930602c20e3a5c55c8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:29:24Z","email":"walkerp07@yahoo.com","name":"Phillip Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:29:24Z","email":"walkerp07@yahoo.com","name":"Phillip Walker"},"message":"fix(gpu): restartBlender crash-loop — quoting, pkill, and detach bugs\n\nThe restartBlender function had three bugs that caused an infinite crash\nloop when the watchdog tried to restart a crashed Blender:\n\n1. Shell syntax error: ''if [ -f ... ]; then;'' had a stray semicolon after\n   ''then'', causing the relaunch command to fail silently. The SSH command\n   hung indefinitely, and the watchdog spawned a new stuck SSH process\n   every 10s.\n\n2. pkill -f blender killed the SSH session itself: the remote command line\n   contained ''blender'' (in the script path), so ''pkill -f blender''\n   matched and killed the SSH shell before it could relaunch Blender.\n   Fixed: use ''pgrep -f /opt/blender/blender | xargs -r kill'' to match\n   only the Blender binary process.\n\n3. SSH backgrounding didn''t detach: ''nohup ... &'' inside an SSH command\n   kept the SSH channel open because the backgrounded process inherited\n   SSH''s stdout/stderr file descriptors. SSH never returned, the watchdog\n   timed out, and Blender never fully launched. Fixed: use the SCP-then-\n   execute pattern — write a standalone restart script locally, SCP it to\n   the GPU instance, then execute it in a separate SSH call with setsid +\n   full fd redirect (</dev/null >>log 2>&1) so Blender fully detaches.\n\nAlso manually restarted Blender on the current GPU instance (ssh5.vast.ai)\nto restore service immediately.","tree":{"sha":"fb6feef3093b99cca299df49ed29cf27805f1a6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/git/trees/fb6feef3093b99cca299df49ed29cf27805f1a6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wp07e/AI-OS/git/commits/6f300e04c74d2491100de930602c20e3a5c55c8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15681329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e","id":15681329,"login":"wp07e","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjgxMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wp07e","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e/AI-OS/commit/6f300e04c74d2491100de930602c20e3a5c55c8d","node_id":"C_kwDOTRFW2NoAKDZmMzAwZTA0Yzc0ZDI0OTExMDBkZTkzMDYwMmMyMGUzYTVjNTVjOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wp07e/AI-OS/commit/8f7163bfb1eb12d3c505d6b84b6a904f58458f9b","sha":"8f7163bfb