izations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/dcc801eba0b32c2babeae378fda66616d45cda31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T15:00:06Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T15:00:06Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"message":"Fix the blank social card, and refresh the stale README preview\n\nThe pages declared twitter:card=summary_large_image but shipped no image, so\nevery shared link rendered an empty card. Adds og:image / twitter:image\n(absolute, as the spec requires — verified on nested pages too), og:url per\npage, og:image dimensions and alt text, and twitter title/description.\n\nog.png is the hero at 1200x630. The README preview was captured before the\nhero, bank grid and continuous spectrum landed, so it advertised a design\nthe site no longer has; regenerated from the current build.\n\nA browser test now asserts a large-image card always carries an image.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4db6e9f9c2fd3a08e01c7431eed8a8a24e24edb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/git/trees/4db6e9f9c2fd3a08e01c7431eed8a8a24e24edb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/git/commits/dcc801eba0b32c2babeae378fda66616d45cda31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76992713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411","id":76992713,"login":"sumitsingh4411","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTkyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commit/dcc801eba0b32c2babeae378fda66616d45cda31","node_id":"C_kwDOTRMwaNoAKGRjYzgwMWViYTBiMzJjMmJhYmVhZTM3OGZkYTY2NjE2ZDQ1Y2RhMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commit/d035185f0d22328928eb940a269da4870e182f6a","sha":"d035185f0d22328928eb940a269da4870e182f6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/d035185f0d22328928eb940a269da4870e182f6a"}],"sha":"dcc801eba0b32c2babeae378fda66616d45cda31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/dcc801eba0b32c2babeae378fda66616d45cda31"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76992713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411","id":76992713,"login":"sumitsingh4411","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTkyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/d035185f0d22328928eb940a269da4870e182f6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:33:43Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:33:43Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"message":"Add a progress dashboard, and make the spectrum one continuous bar\n\nSpectrum: segments no longer sit apart with 3px gaps — they butt together\nand only the outer ends round, so every bar on the site reads as one\ncontinuous rail. The per-segment glow moved to the track, since adjacent\nglows bled across the now-touching edges.\n\nProgress dashboard at /progress/: an overall completion ring, done /\nremaining / categories-cleared / banks-cleared tiles, per-difficulty and\nper-bank breakdowns, a ''pick up where you left off'' list sorted by how\nclose each category is, plus export / import / reset of the saved data.\nEverything stays in localStorage — no account, no server.\n\nThe dashboard must derive question ids exactly as the checkboxes do, or it\nwould silently count nothing. questionId() is now shared from transform.ts\ninstead of being duplicated in QuestionList, pinned by a unit test against\nan id already written into users'' storage, and covered end-to-end: tick two\nquestions, then assert the dashboard reports them.\n\nAlso fixes a subtle Astro trap — the resume rows are injected via innerHTML\nso they never receive the scoped-style attribute; their CSS is now global,\nand a browser test asserts the rows actually lay out with a filled bar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e386055f1002d7393e5ffc031133eb608b5f3aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/git/trees/3e386055f1002d7393e5ffc031133eb608b5f3aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/git/commits/d035185f0d22328928eb940a269da4870e182f6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76992713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411","id":76992713,"login":"sumitsingh4411","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTkyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commit/d035185f0d22328928eb940a269da4870e182f6a","node_id":"C_kwDOTRMwaNoAKGQwMzUxODVmMGQyMjMyODkyOGViOTQwYTI2OWRhNDg3MGUxODJmNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commit/a93bbd26aec35e9a1e5e5b74bc8bbe4e17021dea","sha":"a93bbd26aec35e9a1e5e5b74bc8bbe4e17021dea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/a93bbd26aec35e9a1e5e5b74bc8bbe4e17021dea"}],"sha":"d035185f0d22328928eb940a269da4870e182f6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/d035185f0d22328928eb940a269da4870e182f6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76992713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411","id":76992713,"login":"sumitsingh4411","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTkyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/a93bbd26aec35e9a1e5e5b74bc8bbe4e17021dea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T05:52:34Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T05:52:34Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"message":"Header: centered segmented nav with a sliding indicator\n\nThe three nav links sat as naked text beside the wordmark, leaving a dead\nvoid across the middle of the bar, and the active underline was too dark to\nread. Now: brand | nav | actions as a 3-column grid so the nav centers, the\nlinks live in a segmented pill, and a glider slides to the active item and\nfollows hover. Sections and Question banks carry mono count badges (21 /\n3,146), which suit a site whose whole character is counted data.\n\nTwo positioning bugs found by measuring rather than eyeballing:\n- absolute offsets resolve against the padding box''s outer edge, so the\n  glider needed insetting by the nav''s own 3px padding;\n- the glider was placed before the webfont swapped in, which shifted link\n  widths under it — it now re-measures on document.fonts.ready.\n\nVerified flush (dx/dy/dw/dh = 0) on every nav page in both themes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"daf84f1d9dd04c2c5acb014c48e6d1dbdc60e57b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/git/trees/daf84f1d9dd04c2c5acb014c48e6d1dbdc60e57b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/git/commits/a93bbd26aec35e9a1e5e5b74bc8bbe4e17021dea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76992713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411","id":76992713,"login":"sumitsingh4411","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTkyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commit/a93bbd26aec35e9a1e5e5b74bc8bbe4e17021dea","node_id":"C_kwDOTRMwaNoAKGE5M2JiZDI2YWVjMzVlOWExZTVlNWI3NGJjOGJiZTRlMTcwMjFkZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commit/91e2d079a2c0c1d0be15018de750d48e7f3d948d","sha":"91e2d079a2c0c1d0be15018de750d48e7f3d948d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/91e2d079a2c0c1d0be15018de750d48e7f3d948d"}],"sha":"a93bbd26aec35e9a1e5e5b74bc8bbe4e17021dea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/a93bbd26aec35e9a1e5e5b74bc8bbe4e17021dea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76992713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411","id":76992713,"login":"sumitsingh4411","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTkyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/91e2d079a2c0c1d0be15018de750d48e7f3d948d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T05:39:18Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T05:39:18Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"message":"Premium pass on the top bar and the handbook section\n\nTop bar: the brand mark is now the spectrum itself (three tiers, matching\nthe favicon) and animates on hover; nav gains an active state with an\naccent underline; the search button grows an accent focus ring and a bold\nquestion count; a divider separates search from the icon buttons; the bar\ngains depth once you scroll past the top.\n\nHandbook: four columns grouped by stage left a ragged bottom edge (5/3/8/5)\nand floated the ''bank'' pill into the middle of React''s blurb, squeezing it\nto three lines. Replaced with numbered stage rules — the sections genuinely\nare a sequence — and a five-column card grid, chosen so Core (5) and\nInterview prep (5) land as exact rows and Engineering (8) breaks 5+3, with\nno lone trailing card. The pill now sits beside the section number, so\ncards need no footer and gain no dead space when a section has no bank.\nBlurbs clamp at three lines, so nothing truncates mid-word.\n\nAlso anchors ''All sections ->'' to the eyebrow line instead of the baseline\nof a two-line heading, where it floated detached.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de078ae89fd857bb2d2ee5e3e2029c8f0444fcd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/git/trees/de078ae89fd857bb2d2ee5e3e2029c8f0444fcd5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/re