13?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411","id":76992713,"login":"sumitsingh4411","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTkyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/e59aaa03d4dd90c2668945b1eafb1c1e9d5f7848/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T21:55:29Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T21:55:29Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"message":"Homepage: sharpen the hero and fix the orphaned bank card\n\nHero: mono status pill with a live dot, larger display type, and the\npunchline underscored by the difficulty spectrum at its true 20/48/32\nproportions — the signature now opens the page. Adds a masked dot-grid\nand spotlight for depth.\n\nBanks: the 5-card grid left React orphaned on its own row. A sixth\n''All question banks'' cell now completes a 3x2. Cards get an emoji tile,\na labelled count, a hover edge-light, and their spectrum bars pinned to\nthe bottom so they align across a row regardless of blurb length.\n\nSpectrum segments gain a hover tooltip with their count and share.\n