lse,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/d2cda7484beef2412cf15d6b5f6f2fbd60f77068/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T21:24:45Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T21:24:45Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"message":"Add generated website: dark Astro site built from the Markdown\n\nThe repo''s Markdown stays the single source of truth — the site is generated\nfrom it at build time, so editing a question redeploys the page.\n\nContent pipeline (site/src/lib):\n- transform.ts strips GitHub-only chrome (banners, badges, back-links), maps\n  repo paths to site routes, and parses \"- 🟡 Question\" bullets into structured\n  {difficulty, text}. Unrouted repo files fall back to their GitHub URL.\n- markdown.ts renders via markdown-it + Shiki (dual light/dark), rewriting every\n  relative .md link, and turns \"- [ ]\" requirement lists into real checkboxes.\n- content.ts globs the repo, orders bank categories from each bank''s index table,\n  and computes the live homepage stats (3,146 questions, 103 categories).\n\nDesign: the difficulty spectrum is the signature — a tricolor bar sized by the\nreal proportions of the set it describes. It''s the hero, the top bar''s edge, a\nmini-bar on every card, and on a category page each segment fills with the brand\naccent as you complete questions of that difficulty.\n\nFeatures: ⌘K palette over all 3,146 questions (static 53 KB gzipped index, no\nsearch service), difficulty filters, per-category progress in localStorage,\ndark/light with no flash, mobile drawer.\n\n168 static pages, 6.4 KB of JS. Deploys to GitHub Pages via Actions.\n\nTests: 9 unit tests for the content transforms, 34 browser tests covering\nprogress persistence, the spectrum fill, filters, the palette, theming and\nmobile nav.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f89440329276853f13724b690f20d981211e337f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/git/trees/f89440329276853f13724b690f20d981211e337f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/git/commits/d2cda7484beef2412cf15d6b5f6f2fbd60f77068","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76992713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411","id":76992713,"login":"sumitsingh4411","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTkyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commit/d2cda7484beef2412cf15d6b5f6f2fbd60f77068","node_id":"C_kwDOTRMwaNoAKGQyY2RhNzQ4NGJlZWYyNDEyY2YxNWQ2YjVmNmYyZmJkNjBmNzcwNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commit/163a98c9e38bbd333265efbf8e4da8dec909d1df","sha":"163a98c9e38bbd333265efbf8e4da8dec909d1df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/163a98c9e38bbd333265efbf8e4da8dec909d1df"}],"sha":"d2cda7484beef2412cf15d6b5f6f2fbd60f77068","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/d2cda7484beef2412cf15d6b5f6f2fbd60f77068"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76992713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411","id":76992713,"login":"sumitsingh4411","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTkyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commits/163a98c9e38bbd333265efbf8e4da8dec909d1df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T17:59:54Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T17:59:54Z","email":"shivsingh6371913458@gmail.com","name":"sumitsingh4411"},"message":"Split giant question banks into per-category subfolders\n\n- Each large bank (machine-coding, JavaScript, system-design, DSA) is now a\n  question-bank/ folder: one page per category + an index README with counts.\n- DSA (963 flat problems) re-bucketed by problem-name into 20 NeetCode-style\n  patterns (Arrays & Hashing, Two Pointers, Trees, Graphs, DP, ...) and stripped\n  of leaked topic-label rows.\n- Updated section + root README links to point at the new folder indexes.\n- React bank (75) kept as a single file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2796f111148984a8ce1fa2e71aff424c1d602a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/git/trees/e2796f111148984a8ce1fa2e71aff424c1d602a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/git/commits/163a98c9e38bbd333265efbf8e4da8dec909d1df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76992713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411","id":76992713,"login":"sumitsingh4411","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTkyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sumitsingh4411","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sumitsingh4411/frontend-interview-questions/commit/163a98c9e38bbd333265efbf8e4da8dec909d1df","node_id":"C_kwDOT